SELECT 24, 25, 20, 5, 'Title says it all. Big selection of combo lunches for less than $5.00 including canned soft drink. The place is clean and has seating for eat-in. In a store front at Old Fox Hill Rd and King St. Golden City Chinese Restaurant is a good place to quickly pickup some Chinese food. They have reasonably priced combination meals that include your entre, fried rice, and an egg roll.', '2021-01-08 05:48:10', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 25, 26, 20, 1, 'Okay I totally love my regular place, but decided to check this one out. First off it took 2 hours for it to be delivered, no biggie I think if the food is amazing. Unfortunately that isnt the case. I got chicken lo mein...could barely find chicken, was dry. General Tso wasnt good at all and the fried rice  and white rice was like rocks...I dont like wasting food but I tried to eat it...very disappointed, threw it all away. I will definitely be sticking to my regular place.', '2018-07-19 05:19:31', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 26, 27, 20, 2, 'Last night the food was delivered to my Hotel room with no problem...This afternoon, I place a order. I was informed the delivery may be an hour late...Well, one hour and fifteen minutes later, I recieved a call ..Meet them in the lobby. What?? I wasn''t prepared for that. Just last night the driver came to my room..What changed over night?', '2018-03-03 17:40:44', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 27, 28, 20, 5, 'It has a friendly staff and real reasonable prices!!!', '2019-11-29 12:26:15', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 28, 29, 20, 1, 'DO NOT ORDER FOR DELIVERY. They do not bring you your order and try to tell you that what they brought you is what you ordered… 🤬🤬🤬', '2019-12-07 22:37:39', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 29, 30, 20, 5, 'Have been ordering from here for about 5 years. We have tried many Chinese restaurants in the area but we always come back here. We have never been disappointed in the food or service.', '2018-03-03 22:10:59', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 30, 31, 20, 2, 'The people here are nice so this is a suggestion rather than a complaint. Please cook your stir fry veggies a little longer. I love a nice crisp sauteed veggie but these still taste raw and squeaky on my teeth. Specifically the green pepper and celery. The steamed rice is a little hard today, too. Skim the fat off your sauces too, very greasy. And the tea has a slight dirty water after taste and got dammit my fortune cookie is stale smh....this turned into a complaint. sorry. do better yall.', '2018-07-27 17:11:07', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 31, 32, 20, 5, 'I love their dumplings and Singapore Mei Fun (pancit). The lady is always very nice to me and it''s cool that it''s a family run business. Their wonton soup has subtle flavors and the hot and sour has more bold notes. The tea is hit or miss, but I''ve never had a problem getting hot food or waiting too long, but in always do carry out.', '2017-03-01 23:34:01', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 32, 33, 20, 5, 'It''s my go to place for Chinese take out. Nothing fancy, but it''s always hot, tasty, and cheap', '2019-04-16 14:54:35', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 33, 34, 20, 1, 'So, I ordered food at 9:06 and was told it would take an hour. Ok, no problem. When it became 10:30, I called for an ETA and was told the delivery guy was on his way. Then, another 25 minutes go by with still no food. What time did my food show up? 11:16. Oh, but they gave me a free bottle of coke to make up for the time I waited.  This is absolutely ridiculous and will N E V E R order from this place again.', '2016-09-12 03:17:34', NULL
UNION ALL
