SELECT 48, 48, 47, 1, 'Why. The service HORRIBLE! The undertone was a tad bit creepy... after waiting over 15-20 minutes for a waiter to take a drink order... (busy  - not at all)... didn’t get farther than that prior to my departure. Unacceptable!  My hard earned money goes to where the respect and service is given.  Know better to DO better. But I will never come back to this location. A disgrace.', '2021-04-17 04:36:53', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 49, 49, 47, 2, 'Sampler appetizer was very good. My crabs were seasoned but it had absolutely no flavor. I really should have sent it back but in this climate I just didn''t wanna seem like the angry black lady. Such a waste of money. Now I see why Olive garden next door had a long line and you could walk right in here. 🙄I won''t be going back.', '2021-04-19 02:32:55', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 50, 50, 47, 4, 'They just reopened recently so the one lost star is due to limited wait staff.  It looked too us like there was only 2 waitresses and one doubled as bartender.  Our food was amazing! We had crab cakes and the shrimp and fish platter, calamari,  and calamari chowder. All were great. Our waitress was friendly and did a good job keeping up with our drinks.  Will definitely be back.', '2021-01-20 04:45:41', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 51, 51, 47, 1, 'The food was horrible.  You can tell they are really struggling and cutting food quality and costs to the bone.  Instead of melted butter they give you some oily water.  I drank a bit of this oily water to see if it tasted like anything; it tasted like water, not even salty.  The poor crabs must have been bargain-cheap last week''s leftovers, the shells were more than half empty.  Really just a waste of time and money opening mostly empty shells.  I left hungry having eaten mostly corn and potatoes.', '2021-05-31 16:31:01', NULL
UNION ALL
