SELECT 58, 58, 47, 5, 'My wife and I just finished an early dinner...great choice. Our appetizer and meals were excellent; our server, Ava, was fantastic! I recommend that you ask to be seated in her area. Shrimp and mahi were fresh, and the crab/shrimp dip was scratch made and very tasty! You won’t regret a visit to this Joe’s..', '2019-08-15 23:08:42', NULL
