SELECT 73, 73, 47, 4, 'This is the second time my wife and I have gone to this restaurant. Just so you know I do not eat any type of seafood, fish, or clams nothing! I do not like the smell or taste, so the first time we went there I told my wife if the smell is to strong I will go to another restaurant near by and eat there (we went there for a friends birthday party and they did not know about me and fish). But it has no strong smell like at a fish market and I have been to ones in Seattle, Washington and Bergen, Norway. So both times I have eaten a cheeseburger which I think is very good, my wife had a fish taco and some of our friends had crabs and clams and they said it was good (the reason why we were eating here in the first place and same birthday party gang). This is a very casual dress place and the decorations and stuff hanging on the walls is like being at a sports bar / bait shop with all of the photos hanging up and of course large fiberglass sea creatures like a Great White Shark (about 8-10 feet long) a Leather-back Sea Turtle and other items.', '2017-09-04 16:02:23', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 74, 74, 47, 5, 'A great family friendly location.', '2021-04-05 01:21:25', NULL
UNION ALL
