SELECT 78, 78, 47, 2, 'Got the chicken tacos (I know, chicken in a fish place) and they were delicious but half an hour later my stomach hurt so bad it took two doses of Alka Seltzer to get to the point where I could go to sleep. This was my first time there and sadly, it''s my last. Unfortunate since the food was delicious but cross-contamination can ruin people''s nights.', '2019-01-27 20:26:21', NULL
