UNION ALL
SELECT 86, 84, 47, 1, 'Although our server was very late in approaching out table (almost half an hour) about a third of our orders wrong or missing items, she was still up beat and charming! We truly appreciated her efforts. The food however was was unforgivably flavorless! The menu mentioned that The Steamer option had garlic but there was no trace of garlic flavor on it. It was so disappointing! The calamari was over fried and too crispy and again flavorless. It''s like they just steamed and fried frozen food straight out of a Sysco truck. Their garlic bread, which was also forgotten by our server, was stale and tasted like a yesterday''s bread. Definitely never visiting a Joe''s Crab shack ever again. Since we live close enough to Maryland we''d rather go to a proper seafood restaurant than this place, which is sad because we live close to this franchise.', '2020-01-25 18:23:17', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 87, 85, 47, 3, 'Food was good when it finally came to table had to ask several times where it was. Took forever for the drink at the bar had to ask where that was. The one  manger is always nice and friendly he walked around checking on everyone. Nice for large parties,  will return.', '2020-03-14 23:30:24', NULL
UNION ALL
