SELECT 143, 137, 47, 5, 'Omg this one the first time I have ever been to Joe’s Crab Shack ! My girlfriend who took me out there ! it was her second time at one in Greenville SC ..Our first time together in lovely Fredericksburg Virginia! We had so much fun thanks to our awesomeness server named Joshua ! We definitely hope that we get him again ! He made us feel so special! And he had us laughing and smiling the whole time! Omg we needed this ! And was so attentive us .. He made our first time there very happy and we will definitely be back again ! We have just relocated to the area and so excited! This is our first restaurant in the area to visit! The food was so delicious and prices are very reasonable and lots of great things on the menu to choose from! We ordered two steam pots of seafood omg so good ! We highly recommend this location! All the staff are so sweet and friendly! Has a very cozy vibe too ! Thanks so much guys for making our weekend so sweet ! See y’all soon!!', '2020-01-26 03:08:02', NULL
UNION ALL
