SELECT 178, 171, 47, 1, 'Crab was good, lobster not so much, prices were as high as any other seafood place in the area.  Would have given a 4 but the staff literally acted like we were a bother to them. 2 waitresses were jaw jacking at the hostess stand when we walked in, I smiled and said hello. They looked at me like a deer caught in headlights then seemed annoyed when she asked us how many. The place was practically empty yet they were scrambling to figure out where to seat us, mumbling amongst themselves.  Once seated, a young lady came over to get our drinks, another server came by and asked if our drink order was already taken we said yes and I asked if I could ask her a question, she said she wasn''t sure if she was our server and walked away. When our server finally got to us, she did apologize for the wait. She seemed nice but, then disappeared. We got our food and about 3/4 way through I wanted to order more crab. We didn''t even see her for 15 minutes and when we did she went out to the patio through one door and came back in through the front, bypassing us. I decided to forgo the extra order of crab and dessert for our son because we didn''t have another hour to wait in an empty restaurant. We will not be back.', '2017-09-06 23:30:53', NULL
UNION ALL
