SELECT 673, 628, 35, 5, 'What''s all the hype? Drove to Norfolk, VA to give this place a try... And man, well worth the drive! Got a meat platter that had a variety of smoked meats... delicious! Enjoyed the meal while sitting out on the screened patio. Nice vibe.. And ordered the ginormous beef ribs for later. Highly recommended! But you''d better get there early because a line starts to form and they seem to sell out every day!', '2021-04-10 19:47:50', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 674, 629, 35, 5, CONVERT(X'' USING utf8mb4), '2021-06-16 21:33:52', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 675, 630, 35, 4, 'The food taste good. However we have gone several times just to find out they are sold out. The line is always long. So order ahead, with hopes that they have what you want available. The smoked pickle taste pretty good. Ever time i go they run out of the potato for one of the meals. This last time i went they had it and it def. Was not what i expected. Was just a regular baked potato with toppings. I gave them a 4 star because of the line and you just don''t know if they will be opened when you go/ sold out.', '2021-05-18 00:33:07', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 676, 631, 35, 2, 'I want to start by saying that the brisket was delicious as usual. The service on the other hand left something to be desired. We got two sliced brisket sandwiches, one side and one drink and it cost $32. I love BBQ but that''s just too much money for two sandwiches one side and one drink. Really for cuts of meat that have traditionally been used to serve the poor!!!....that''s just too much money for me', '2021-05-28 09:29:13', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 677, 632, 35, 5, 'Amazing BBQ, the best I''ve ever had. Served simply on picnic tables with traditional sides. The brisket was melt in your mouth. Many sauces for different tastes.. I honestly can''t wait to go back. The rub and woodsmoked method make the food like none other. I was so into eating the food.. I forgot to take pictures. Next time!', '2021-04-08 02:20:26', NULL
UNION ALL
