SELECT 682, 635, 35, 3, 'The food was really good I bought the platter for $27 and added sausage for three dollars.. my meal also came with two sides and a fountain drink.', '2021-03-06 17:33:28', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 683, 636, 35, 4, 'Definitely good barbecue. Brisket was slightly dry but good. Had the sweats meats with sausage added. My sides broccoli salad,  baked beans, green chili mac and cheese, and cilantro coleslaw. Let my say sugar sugar sugar. Most sides sweet. Mac and cheese was delicious. Ribs had that perfect tenderness. Homemade pork rinds some of the best we ever had!', '2021-05-13 23:38:24', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 684, 637, 35, 5, 'I am not usually a huge BBQ fan but this place is delicious.  We ordered the Meat Sweats,  it was a lot of yummy meats with some delicious sides.  I really liked that the sauces/dips came separate so I could try the different ones and only use as much as I want.', '2021-02-13 14:49:57', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 685, 638, 35, 3, 'great food, loved the brisket...the pulled pork sandwich was great...the baked beans were just ok, definitely NOT the normal baked beans, they were more like chili beans or kidney beans i think they are called...the big burgundy ones...only one star less than i really felt bc the price point was sub par...what i paid vs what i got was not equally proportioned based on eating bbq from other spots', '2021-02-04 04:51:19', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 686, 639, 35, 4, 'The brisket was everything very tender and moist. Won’t a fan of none of the sides disappointed with the Mac and Cheese but again the brisket was greattttt !', '2020-10-09 00:13:58', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 687, 640, 35, 5, 'Pretty Good, with Texas inspired in the name I had to give it a try. We got the Chopped Brisket sandwich lunch combo which was good. Being from Dallas Tx I grew up eating Chopped Beef sandwiches and had them about once a week as a teenager. This sandwich might have took me back to those days if I hadn''t visited home less than 2 months ago. We also tried a couple of the sausage links( reg/ jalapeno cheddar) they were good.... for here. To be honest I have been chasing something to take me back to Texas for the last 26 years and Redwood Smoke Shack has come the closest. I will be back to try more of the menu. Keep up the good work!', '2020-12-17 20:28:44', NULL
UNION ALL
