SELECT 692, 643, 35, 5, 'Sooo good. Have been before and had the meat sweats plate and some other amazing food. This last time, I had the Mac and cheese topped with brisket and broccoli salad. It was a feast. All the sides I’ve had are amazing. The corn bread is very tasty, and the bananamisu is outrageously good. Staff is friendly, all wearing masks appropriately. Will definitely go back!', '2021-03-07 17:59:14', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 693, 644, 35, 3, 'Went to Redwood Smoke on Saturday. I ordered their sides of Mac and cheese and collard greens. They were sooo salty I thought the cook had turned the salt shaker upside down in both my sides. They were awful. Had to throw them away. For as much as this food costs it was a total waste of my money. Won''t be eating there again anytime soon.', '2021-05-23 20:11:29', NULL
UNION ALL
