SELECT 751, 688, 35, 5, 'Been there twice now. The brisket is super good. Really tender with a perfect bark. The sausage is good. The sides are awesome. I had the green chili mac and cheese and the collards on my second visit. My wife got a pulled pork sandwich and she enjoyed it.', '2020-01-11 23:11:37', NULL
