SELECT 752, 689, 35, 5, 'Always beyond excellent! Burnt ends are to die for... MEAT CANDY!', '2020-12-12 21:10:07', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 753, 690, 35, 5, 'Delicious & fun menu. Competition grade meats and the green Chile Mac & cheese has just a touch of heat.The Tomic Tater was cooked perfectly with chicken, slaw, and BBQ beans on top. The Loaded Mac & Cheese was good. I chose pork on top. Both $22.50 with tax.', '2019-09-20 16:40:55', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 754, 691, 35, 5, 'Having lived in central Texas for a decade, my expectations for Texas style bbq are pretty high. Redwood always exceeds expectations. Have the brisket with smoked beans and potato salad, you won’t regret it!', '2020-08-19 00:53:49', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 755, 692, 35, 5, 'Damn best in Norfolk.', '2021-06-10 12:19:41', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 756, 693, 35, 5, 'Food and Service is worth the drive and time. I promise.', '2020-10-20 16:54:29', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 757, 694, 35, 2, 'Was very excited for my family to try this restaurant based on several reviews...but ended up mostly DISAPPOINTED! Ordered through doordash and food came quickly. First issue, we ordered $70 worth of food to include 3 platters, two platters were BOTH MISSING FRIES! We paid $18+ for a brisket platter that literally had ONE SLICE of brisket, that''s not a platter, and way overpriced for the amount of food! The pork bbq tasted like smoke, not pork or bbq sauce at all! Ended up doctoring up my pork bbq for my son to eat and got me food from somewhere else! Oh, my children said the bananamisu wasn''t all that great as I bought each of them a dessert! Didn''t do one star only because of on time delivery. Very disappointing taste and experience!', '2020-11-06 00:02:32', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 758, 695, 35, 5, 'I Love all of The dishes that I''ve eaten this far, and would like to enjoy more of The added Menu.', '2020-10-20 22:45:05', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 759, 696, 35, 4, 'The food was delicious and the price for it was decent. Good customer service.', '2020-10-29 05:01:50', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 760, 697, 35, 1, 'Prices were higher than I was happy about, small menu. So if u have allergies don''t bother.  The seating is outside and we got rained on after the patio table almost flipped from not being drilled into ground. The cashier was nice ,but it still didnt make up for the fact I was only able to get pulled chicken because the sides were out and they wouldn''t substitute dessert. I usually try and give new places a valid shot but this place was the worst around in a very long time for me. Wasted $30. Wont be back.', '2020-08-11 19:58:34', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 761, 698, 35, 5, 'Not only was the food amazing, the people have fantastic customer service. So friendly and welcoming. Additionally, we left our daughter''s ballet bag there and after realizing that we had left it a week later we went to see.if they had it. They had kept it, looked after it in a locked locker. Brilliant service all around. Thank you!', '2019-11-26 22:10:41', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 762, 699, 35, 5, 'Pulled pork sandwich,  macaroni and cheese and collard greens for less than $10! Delicious food, friendly people and the best iced tea I''ve had since arriving in Virginia.', '2020-10-31 20:58:10', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 763, 700, 35, 5, 'Gr8 place to learn to cook BBQ', '2021-05-18 01:46:43', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 764, 701, 35, 4, 'Very good barbeque and friendly staff. There is plenty of outdoor seating. Prices are a little steep and could be lower. Other than that one of the best barbeque restaurant in the Norfolk area.', '2020-08-21 17:34:06', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 765, 702, 35, 5, '1st time buyer and was not disappointed.  Even the sides were good.  If you''re hankering for some Q, give these folks a try. Very tasty.', '2020-05-12 21:49:11', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 766, 703, 35, 5, 'Food was extremely good. The brisket melted and the mac and cheese had very good flavor. Lunch special was worth the money.', '2020-06-24 17:51:38', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 767, 704, 35, 4, 'I’d definitely give it a five star, but one thing was a tad underwhelming, I got the rib platter, best dry rub ribs I’ve ever had, perfectly comes off the bone, rub is perfectly balanced with the smokey taste and meat, nice potato salad, love the fact it’s made with red potatoes, a plus that they also serve collard greens, but the only reason I didn’t give the 5 stars was the bananamisu, I get that it’s just supposed to be banana pudding, one of the best I’ve had don’t get me wrong, but I just kinda wish it was a bit more creative, the texture and taste were completely good, just felt like it was missing something, this is a perfect place for a bite to eat for BBQ, so definitely a recommended spot on my part.', '2020-06-12 20:15:11', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 768, 705, 35, 3, 'Quaint place in Ghent area. Small but cozy spot. Had tender brisket. House BBQ sauce was tasty. A bigger slice of cornbread and sweeter sweet tea would''ve been great. Friendly staff.', '2020-02-05 18:04:37', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 769, 706, 35, 5, 'Fantastic Bar b que. Beware they often sell out before closing time. So if you want some of the smokey goodness get there early.', '2020-06-21 21:00:57', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 770, 707, 35, 5, 'Great service and fantastic food! Best brisket we''ve ever had, hands down. Sausage, pulled pork, cornbread, and bananamisu were all outstanding as well! Even their homemade BBQ sauces were out of this world. Can''t wait to go back!', '2020-01-05 05:35:24', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 771, 708, 35, 5, 'This place has the tastiest meat going.  Brisket is so tender and tasty.  Great food choices.  I still want to get the banana pudding.', '2020-03-15 03:21:44', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 772, 709, 35, 5, 'My boyfriend and I have been talking about coming to this place the last few weeks, and we decided to come in today to try it out. You walk in and it is really nice very good flow system, the menu right by the door and the counter to order at. The people who were behind the counter were very nice and hooked me up with a lot of bbq sauce! I tried the loaded mac and cheese with the potato salad and the corn pudding. It was all delicious!!! And I am very picky about my pork as well as mac and cheese! It exceeded my expectations! I will be back to try something new soon! My boyfriend got the burnt ends and the beef rib, and both were really good!!! I would recommend them to anyone who wants to eat really good food!', '2019-09-21 20:28:48', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 773, 710, 35, 5, 'Awesome burnt ends!', '2021-05-15 21:40:59', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 774, 711, 35, 5, 'I''ve eaten plenty of brisket in the US, especially in Texas. This is the best you''re going to have in a long time up north. Highly recommended. Brisket was done perfectly with bark yet tender and juicy. Sauces are on point. Beans were next level from someone who isn''t a fan of beans. Corn puddin was different than what I expected but it was much better than what I''m used to. Hell, they even had Big Red in the fountain to drink. It''s literally a slice of Texas in Ghent.', '2020-01-21 17:34:39', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 775, 712, 35, 5, 'Just great brisket. I have to go back for burnt ends soon.', '2020-10-28 17:50:57', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 776, 713, 35, 5, 'MEAT COMA!! We went for Greek night but they were sold out just 2 hrs after posting!  Very filling, but completely worth it.  Just wish there was enough from what was advertised on Instagram.', '2020-07-24 21:08:40', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 777, 714, 35, 5, 'Absolutely delicious. Got the meat sweats sampler and shared it with my wife. More than enough for both of us and a good example of what they have to offer', '2020-03-10 18:54:20', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 778, 715, 35, 5, 'Both times we''ve been there, we''ve been impressed with how yummy the food is and how friendly the staff is. The brisket can''t be beat for this part of the country. As good as anything I had in Texas (I''m from there, for whatever that''s worth). The setup even feels like something you''d experience on a country road in Texas. Unassuming spot on the side of the road with indoor and outdoor bench seating. Several sauces to choose from. The sides are amazing to. The Mac and cheese is some of the best I''ve ever had; the French fries, baked beans, and cole slaw don''t disappoint either. Filling portion sizes and good prices considering quality and quantity.', '2019-12-18 20:50:03', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 779, 716, 35, 5, 'Absolutely fabulous!! Pulled pork Sammich Platter with Pit smoked beans and crinkle fries. I never knew crinkle fries could be so good! Fast and friendly service. Definitely put this place on your must do list. Everything on the menu looks great so it will take several trips.', '2019-09-28 20:20:15', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 780, 717, 35, 5, 'Friendly atmosphere, excellent food.. We ordered the meat sweats their staff wear masks, they have social distancing and guidelines in place.', '2020-07-26 22:43:58', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 781, 718, 35, 5, 'It''s hard to believe that brisket this good can be found in VA.', '2020-10-02 16:37:47', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 782, 719, 35, 5, 'Love it go at least once a week will continue to go love the food and people that wait on you are very polite and kind', '2020-08-06 22:03:10', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 783, 720, 35, 5, 'This place was great. I was sure what to get so I got the platter and every piece of meat was perfect.  I will definitely be going back. If you''ve never been here you need to get up and go right now because you will absolutely love it!!!!', '2019-10-12 22:36:39', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 784, 721, 35, 4, 'Super good smoked meats and poultry. All done in house. Tender and flavorful, several different sauces. I''m going back for more soon!', '2019-11-12 21:22:37', NULL
