UNION ALL
SELECT 788, 725, 35, 5, 'Great BBQ the smoked brisket was moist and full of flavor. Good variety of home made BBQ sauces. The house is our favorite. I could eat a giant bowl of their corn pudding. Everything was fantastic during our visit from the facilities to staff to food. All was great everyone had a smile on their face.', '2019-06-22 17:29:18', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 789, 726, 35, 5, 'If you want real and the best barbecue in all of the tidewater area, please try this place. Amazing! Great service and delicious! They have the BEST BRISKET I HAVE EVER HAD!!!', '2019-10-05 22:34:53', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 790, 727, 35, 4, 'A little pricy, pork bbq tasted pretty good, the slaw was nice and crunchy, and the beans were the best part; overall was not spectacular on this visit.', '2020-07-10 23:49:45', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 791, 728, 35, 5, 'Love the char on the brisket which was fall apart tender. Also got pumpkin corn pudding.', '2020-10-23 17:35:57', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 792, 729, 35, 3, 'Very overpriced and the portions don’t even come close to reflecting what you spend. The mac and cheese is delicious as is the brisket. Nothing else was really worth the price paid. The service was great and the energy in the restaurant was fun and lighthearted. Definitely my favorite part about my visit.', '2019-11-21 18:04:03', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 793, 730, 35, 4, 'Call before you go! The fact that they run out of food on a daily basis is a testament to the satisfaction of their clients. They take great pride in the smoking of their foods and offer the traditional items you''d find in most quality family backyard barbecues! It ain''t cheap! My wife and I sat down for a piece of brisket, an order of burnt ends, two ribs, two sides, a beer and a Coke and the bill before tip was almost $60. There''s only a few seats inside and their covered back porch can seat slightly more than 20 people in four table settings. On good weather days, they offer unprotected outside seating were you might find some local quality entertainment. Like most good barbecue joints, they have a variety of sauces offered. I particularly liked the espresso. They have a nice dry rub that appears to be a simple salt and mostly pepper seasoning that allows you to eat the meat without the sauce if you choose. It''s a great family setting and you can expect to find everything from younger adults to families with younger children enjoying the surroundings and a simple meal prepared the right way.', '2019-08-10 13:24:37', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 794, 731, 35, 5, 'The BBQ was on point and delicious and the staff was great.  The meat was juicy with flavor and for someone who has never had brisket it was melt in the mouth good.  Good food for the money.', '2019-10-05 19:27:54', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 795, 732, 35, 5, 'The brisket was fantastic! The place came highly recommended by a buddy, and I was not disappointed. Even the crinkle cut fries were delicious. The staff was super friendly, and answered all my questions.', '2019-09-13 23:51:18', NULL
UNION ALL
