SELECT 816, 749, 35, 5, 'Was looking for a great place for some BBQ and found them. Brisket is delicious and got to get an order of burnt ends every time. Not only is the food absolutely delt the staff is always so inviting and make you feel incredibly welcomed. On the way out don''t forget to try thier cookies. They rotate which type are available but they are all delicious!!', '2019-11-03 14:39:06', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 817, 750, 35, 4, 'I had the burnt ends with their pumpkin corn pudding, coleslaw, and cornbread. The pork and pudding were absolutely fantastic! The slaw could have used a little more flavoring I thought. But after all that awesome deliciousness they gave this super tiny piece of cornbread that’s was more a sample size verses a portion? Come on ya’ll it’s the south we like our cornbread just as much as our BBQ! LOL', '2019-11-19 20:04:28', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 818, 751, 35, 5, 'Excellent BBQ. We shared the sampler platter and everything was great. The brisket and ribs were especially outstanding.', '2019-12-22 18:06:57', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 819, 752, 35, 5, 'This was my first time eating here, and my experience was worth the wait, I had the pulled pork sandwich with chilli verde macaroni(flavored with tomatillo, its has a mild flavor) very tasty, and baked beans,  also a slice of corn bread, they also had an assortment of bbq sauces, there was an espresso bbq, a vinegar based bbq and a house bbq,  I will definitely eat with again,  cant wait to try other items on their menu!', '2020-02-28 23:47:33', NULL
