SELECT 852, 782, 35, 5, 'The smoke was wonderful on my pork og sammich.  The cilantro slaw was so tasty.  I would have never thought to put cilantro in slaw, so I''m glad they did.  They have 4 different bbq sauces available.  I liked the espresso bbq sauce best.  I''m not usually into pumpkin flavored things, but the pumpkin corn pudding was good. The texture was perfect for me and not too sweet.  The line is worth the wait.', '2019-10-19 20:34:22', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 853, 783, 35, 5, 'To. Die. For!! I guarantee that you won''t find better bbq in Hampton Roads! Everyone there is so friendly too!', '2019-10-03 20:46:52', NULL
UNION ALL
