SELECT 868, 798, 35, 5, 'great brisket sandwich', '2020-11-20 22:40:39', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 869, 799, 35, 4, 'I had the $9.50 lunch special , comes with only 1 side and corn bread and a soda . They didn''t tell me that until I got to the end of the line about a second side doesn''t come with the meal. The pork bbq was good and the coleslaw at $3.00 , butter beans were good . Portions weren''t real hearty but tastey. I just thought $14.07 was just too pricy for lunch for one person :(  . Good place to eat if you got money to burn .', '2019-07-10 16:32:49', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 870, 800, 35, 5, 'This place is booooomb. Never thought I''d be able to get over dog n burger being gone, but Redwood totally delivers in its place. It''s honesty kinda pricey for what you get & the mac n cheese was a lil under seasoned but I''d say it''s worth it. Cutest lil patio set up outside & the sauces are dank. Definitely would recommend too anyone with a love for BBQ bc they''re doin it right! Will be back!', '2019-10-05 01:57:59', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 871, 801, 35, 5, 'Hands down the best BBQ in town!', '2020-08-22 17:18:59', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 872, 802, 35, 5, 'The food was absolutely delicious!', '2020-07-19 17:53:02', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 873, 803, 35, 5, 'This is no-frill operation, as a BBQ place should be. Outstanding smoked meats and sides.', '2019-10-30 22:19:00', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 874, 804, 35, 5, 'Fast service,  good food.  Amazing potato salad.', '2019-07-30 17:07:39', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 875, 805, 35, 5, 'Outstanding BBQ that this area really needed! I had the lunch special, which was a pork BBQ sandwich with a side (I picked the green chile mac n cheese), cornbread, and a drink. I also added bananamisu pudding for dessert. At the front counter, the chef preparing the meal gave us a free sample of pulled pork. It was amazing... melted in our mouths. The pork on the sandwich was the same way. The mac n cheese was delicious, and it was a unique take with the green chile flavor (it''s not spicy so give it a try). The dessert was banana pudding which was a generous serving that I split with 2 others. Very rich and cool temperature, which was very refreshing in the summer. Lastly, they have 5 sauces available to try. My personal favorite was espresso bbq sauce. They also had a vinegar, house bbq, hot sauce, and ketchup. I am definitely going to go back for lunch again, this is a new favorite spot of mine. The only critique I have - please add sweet tea to the drink menu!', '2019-07-10 20:15:47', NULL
UNION ALL
