UNION ALL
SELECT 885, 813, 35, 3, 'Very expensive and not that great, in my opinion.', '2020-04-23 18:54:36', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 886, 815, 35, 5, 'Redwood Smoke Shack won Veer Magazine Best Food Truck in 2017 and 2018. Bob and the crew are down to Earth, eager to please, and customer service oriented. His Texas inspired BBQ is smack your Mom good, and my Mom agrees! All the sauces are scratch made, of which I highly recommend the espresso BBQ. It''s like if Seattle''s best and Franklin''s got real drunk one night. Everything on the menu is delicious, but far and above all offerings are the burnt ends. They''re just little chunks of meat candy cascading down from smoker heaven. Bob frequently makes one off specials, the most popular being the pork belly burnt ends or the brontosaurus ribs. The best menu item to cut your teeth on Bob''s carnivorous genius is The Woody - several of his smoked meats, the cilantro lime slaw, and sauces on a Krispy Kreme donut. Sweet and savory!!! I really love it when he posts up outside of MoMac Brewery. Beer and BBQ go together like Forrest and Jenny . . . minus all the rampant drugs and whatnot. Buy some Redwood SWAG and get the discount! #MeatManCometh #RedwoodDisciple', '2018-12-29 02:29:32', NULL
UNION ALL
