SELECT 1295, 1214, 64, 4, 'Fun little dive bar. Like stepping into the 1980s. 70s music playing, couple of tvs, full bar and they''ll make fresh coffee for you.  It is a smoking bar, so heads up is that''s not your thing.  Food was hot and tasty.', '2019-11-10 16:52:39', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1296, 1215, 64, 3, 'It''s a mediocre bar but cleaner than some other local bars. I''ve visited a few times and one male bartender was nice, the other two females I encountered were ok. The beers were more expensive than my usual hangout but the service is not as good. I haven''t played pool yet but they have tables in the back. The general mood of the place was pretty laid back and I didn''t see any altercations so that''s a bonus. I may try it again in the future and see if I have a better experience.', '2019-11-07 10:14:43', NULL
UNION ALL
