SELECT 1312, 1231, 64, 3, 'Food is bland. Got the crab cake dinner and while it did have quite a bit of crab, it was bland. Same for the mashed potatoes. First walked in and almost left immediately due to atmosphere, more of a bar then a restaurant. Smoking is allowed at bar which surprised me, is that even allowed in VA anymore?  Waitress was friendly at least.', '2018-07-13 13:26:46', NULL
