SELECT 1313, 1232, 64, 1, 'The service was very nice. The place clean. We were one of the two  tables in the restaurant and it took forever to get our breakfast and the waffle my husband got was so light colored as if it was rushed at the last minute. My sausage patties must of been warmed in the microwave and they were tepid and not even browned like on a grill etc. Worst food and experience ever. Won''t be back.', '2018-08-22 17:56:09', NULL
