SELECT 1317, 1236, 64, 1, 'When me and my wife into this establishment there was no customers inside the dining room at all. I hesitated to go in there but the service seen me and my wife, so we decide to go ahead and try it out anyway. I wish I could turn back around and left me and my wife sat down another couple came in like about a couple of minutes after we did, we ordered our food we set there for over 30 minutes for our food to get done, with two customers inside the dining room it seemed like the server was not friendly at all, I ordered a ham and cheese omelette with hash browns with a buttermilk biscuit my wife order waffles with country ham her waffle was not cooked completely my egg omelette was cooked in the microwave my buttermilk biscuit was cooked in the microwave also my grits was cooked in the microwave did not enjoy it at all the cheese on top of my ham and cheese omelette was burnt so you can tell it was cooked in the microwave, so disappointed whoever said this place have some good food must never had no good food in their life. I want to go back there and show the cook how to cook because. I am a cook he would have got a F- in grade with me, I believe my buttermilk biscuit was a frozen buttermilk biscuit that he microwave.', '2018-08-05 23:10:16', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1318, 1237, 64, 4, 'I love the appetizers here and the happy hour beer prices!', '2019-05-26 00:28:31', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1319, 1238, 64, 3, 'Typical neighborhood dive bar, and they allow smoking. The smoke was really thick in the pool room too. I''m not sure how some bars get away with allowing smoking when I''m pretty sure a law was passed in VA banning it. Staff were nice, but I didn''t want to order any food after reading the reviews here and learning of their terrible experiences.', '2019-03-03 13:46:45', NULL
UNION ALL
