SELECT 1333, 1252, 64, 1, 'Breakfast buffet was slim pickings and the food was cold.  Buffet hours are til 12 on the weekends, we arrived about 10.  Eggs, bacon, potatoes, french toast, pancakes, sausage gravy and biscuits we''re all cold. After 1st trip to buffet, no eggs, second trip no eggs, boyfriend went a 3rd trip and still no eggs. Eggs, potatoes, blueberry cobbler and bacon we''re the only items that had flavor and tasted ok. Biscuits crumbled, sausage gravy had no flavor, blueberry pancakes tasted ok but had to use a knife to cut them. French toast cold and not good. No fresh fruit.', '2017-12-17 20:01:15', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1334, 204, 64, 4, 'The vault is a cool, local bar spot across the street from the Richmond airport...Good food, good drafts and liquor selection,  very clean bar. They do allow smoking at the bar at certain times which isn''t cool to a non smoker but the bar is long so maybe you would have space to move. They do karaoke on certain nights it''s really cool. They have a separate room with 2 pool tables,  2 cornhole tables,  2 dartboards with dats,  a JukeBox with internet/ downloading access to play any song you want to and a TV...there is a ATM on site too', '2018-06-23 08:37:42', NULL
UNION ALL
