SELECT 1414, 1332, 41, 5, 'I love this place as the food is consistant and the service is excellent with a smile. We had drinks and appetizers which were delicious. Conveniently right off the interstate 66 for easy access. The place is always super clean to done in. Give them a try!', '2019-07-14 22:02:20', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1415, 1333, 41, 5, 'Pleasantly surprised!!! Everyone was super nice and helpful. The food was remarkable.  The dinner side salad was huge and fresh with home made dressings.  We came on half price appetizer day but besides that it was a good value for the amount of fantastic food. The portions are very large. We were pleasantly surprised.', '2019-12-08 22:30:47', NULL
UNION ALL
