UNION ALL
SELECT 1420, 1338, 41, 4, 'I have a small appetite so I frequently order from the appetizer menu, so was pleased to see several options with good protein content. Ordered the seared ahi appetizer. Description said with an Asian slaw. Took about 2 minutes to realize the slaw was just a garnish. I asked the server for more of the slaw. It was delicious. The problem came when I was billed for a full garden side salad which normally has a whole lot of other (more expensive) ingredients than lettuce.... And it was smaller than a normal side salad..... But they billed me for a side salad. Would have rated a 5 except for that.', '2020-02-04 01:31:13', NULL
UNION ALL
