SELECT 1653, 1566, 2, 3, 'I was just picking up an order for a friend and he said the food was good but I will never try them personally. The guy working the register and phone went straight back to help with the food but there was no washing of the hands, hairnet, or gloves put on before throwing food in the oven. Come on guy, aren''t clean hands, gloves, and hairnets, basic requirements for handling other people''s food? I give him kudos for helping out because they WERE busy. It just makes me wonder what ELSE they do without washing their hands prior to returning to the kitchen.', '2019-11-08 12:30:26', NULL
