SELECT 1721, 1634, 22, 5, 'Wow!  We didn''t have college food like that back in the day!  Delicious options for those with food allergies.', '2019-07-28 22:53:38', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1722, 1635, 22, 5, 'My savior during undergrad. I’d love to come here during all-nighters for a break and some food to fuel up. Good eats, good memories. Will always be grateful to Southside xx', '2020-08-03 00:27:35', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1723, 1636, 22, 4, 'All you can eat buffet usually crowded at night. Dish conveyor belt for your plates and cups. COVID strict rules. Usually has everything a person needs for all meals of the day. However, sometimes the food is stale or has little to no flavor.', '2020-08-29 16:47:49', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1724, 1637, 22, 4, 'all u can eat.  went once pretty decent! ice cream was slightly hard to get during peak lunch time.  was pretty busy and backed up dish washing.  special employees and composting practices{as well as 10 dollar price} make relatively green and compelling.. wish people would still waste as little as possible!', '2019-09-10 20:18:24', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1725, 1638, 22, 3, 'The dining hall is good because it serves a variety of food every day, but if you do not like the meals that change daily, then you have to eat what is there every day.  This can get old after a while.  During busy hours, it is hard to find a seat, but during times when there are few students, it is a nice environment to enjoy a meal.', '2019-02-27 19:33:16', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1726, 1639, 22, 4, 'I like the dining hall. I was an occasional visitor and really liked the variety. The staff follows food safety guidelines very closely. It is a place where you can wear whatever you want and eat cereal anytime of day. If you''re coming from off campus the parking can be a little tricky especially with the ongoing Construction. If you''re already on campus I would recommend going but I do not recommend making a special trip to go to the dining hall..... unless you really liked the food in college.', '2020-05-17 13:35:59', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1727, 1640, 22, 5, 'It''s ok', '2021-01-30 16:45:57', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1728, 1641, 22, 4, 'Cheap All-You-Can-Eat food. Good value sometimes, other times you feel ripped off. They always overcook all meats to dry flakes, except for a few rare selections from time to time. Special theme days are always nice. Always ask to check out the food before you pay to get in.', '2019-03-21 02:19:28', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1729, 1642, 22, 5, 'Lots of different choices. Cafeteria style but much more open, you don''t wait in a line but can go to two or so different counters for different kids of foods. Also, they did a fine  job preventing cross-contamination for their gluten-free options. Lots of healthy choices, but they also have pizza and ice cream. Very good value.', '2018-10-27 16:05:40', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1730, 1643, 22, 5, 'Not only a variety of foods but also great quality!', '2020-01-28 03:36:33', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1731, 1644, 22, 3, 'For a college dining hall it''s honestly not that bad. Don''t get me wrong, if this were a real restaurant it''d get 1 star but as a dining hall that serves hundreds of students a day it does a fine job.', '2019-01-23 15:31:33', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1732, 1645, 22, 5, 'Fills my gut and tastes way better than Ike''s!', '2019-11-30 11:16:42', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1733, 1646, 22, 3, 'It is good for a dining hall. That being said, once you''ve eaten here many times, it starts to feel same-y.', '2019-05-03 21:27:52', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1734, 1647, 22, 4, 'A much better option then Ikes', '2020-03-17 06:52:58', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1735, 1648, 22, 3, 'Plentiful food and decent service, but quality of food and variety of options disappoints. For regular customers (e.g. students), you''ll be disappointed by the limited rotation of menus and lack of exciting flavors. The full self service salad bar is perhaps one of the few bright spots, and the simple servings corner has inconsistently good offerings.', '2018-11-10 18:42:38', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1736, 1649, 22, 5, 'Pretty noice not gonna lie theres Quite the variety, also not gonna lie.', '2019-09-03 05:04:08', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1737, 1650, 22, 5, 'Excellent selection and happy, helpful staff. Great bargain', '2019-04-27 20:19:57', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1738, 1651, 22, 3, 'Usually provides a decent selection but quality and taste very much vary day to day. A lot of times only a handful of each dish is available before they''re quickly taken. Staff could also be more courteous.', '2017-05-05 03:11:01', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1739, 1652, 22, 5, 'Was invited to George Mason''s Southside Dining Hall..and it was great food & great company & fellowship..great Resurrection Sunday!!!😊☝🙏🙌👌👍', '2019-04-22 01:54:40', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1740, 1653, 22, 2, 'I really never find anything good to eat here. For anyone who doesn''t know, this is a dining which means there is always a rotating menu. The problem is that there usually isn''t an appealing meal here. There have been times where I am happily surprised, but usually is only one element of the whole entree. For example there was a lovely grilled tilapia over a bed of rise that I enjoyed, but right beside it was another side that resembled (potatos? Maybe?) that was gelatinous and like warm. Dishes can only stay so fresh under a heat lamp. Overall, my dining experience at Southside is usually dissapointing to say the most.', '2019-09-16 18:33:11', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1741, 1654, 22, 4, 'Decent food, espeically their breakfast. However, on weekdays it gets pretty packed so its not the most ideal place to eat if you want to get a spot by yourself.', '2019-04-19 12:37:34', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1742, 1655, 22, 2, 'Well, there''s food. Sometimes lots of it, sometimes almost none. Go when it''s crowded for tons of food and no seating. Go on off hours for cold/stale food, limited options, and all the seating in the world. There''s usually something broken or empty. Cups are perpetually and suspiciously dirty. Background music is hilarious. Entrance staff are genuinely friendly. The managers do what they can but it''s a lost cause.', '2017-03-06 03:19:02', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1743, 1656, 22, 5, 'Love the vegan bar, best range of food options of the dining halls for vegetarians', '2019-02-26 18:59:22', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1744, 1657, 22, 4, 'It is a great option, if you live at Gmu. There is a variety of food, and it tastes good too. I highly recommend you to visit this place, if you are Gmu student', '2019-07-12 23:46:20', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1745, 1658, 22, 5, 'Great variety of food for the students and the food was tasty.  They were also very clean', '2019-07-05 09:59:58', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1746, 1659, 22, 5, 'Nice food for college', '2019-09-27 23:03:52', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1747, 1660, 22, 2, 'Found piece of hair n my salad', '2019-11-15 18:11:38', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1748, 1661, 22, 5, 'I''am A CHEF AT SOUTHSIDE . WE HAVE GREAT FOOD. AND THE SERVICE IS AWESOME. PLEASE STOP BY AND VISIT. I HIGHLY RECOMMEND 😁', '2018-06-21 21:50:56', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 1749, 1662, 22, 5, 'Love the pizza and Quesadillas', '2019-11-28 10:53:52', NULL
UNION ALL
