SELECT 1904, 1815, 31, 5, 'Perfect location for a KFC. I rode metro train/bus from Reston to this location since there are ZERO KFC''s in Reston/Herndon area. It was the new Chicken & Waffles that possessed me to find this location so I can enjoy some. Well it was totally worth the mini daytrip! KFC Chicken n Waffles are on point, money yummy. Chicken is up to usual KFC standards and very tasty. Waffle is thick is almost funnel cake like. Mrs Butterworths Syrup is included! :-))  I also finally tried a Nashville Hot tenders basket w creamy mashed taters in gravy and hot fresh biscuit. Amazing! All of it! On top of food being fresh n yummy, the staff/service were friendly and accurate with my order. And the restaraunt was nice and CLEAN. It''s also right near 2 bus metro stops, which makes it VERY convenient to get to. ( 55 bus from East Falls Church Metro/Rosslyn Metro got me there )', '2018-11-24 19:41:12', NULL
UNION ALL
