SELECT 2056, 1965, 17, 5, 'I knew B. Good when they were just starting out in Boston. They''ve grown a bit and feel more like a nicer fast-casual chain now in some ways, but we were very pleased with our recent visit where we ate mostly off the seasonal summer menu. The BBQ chicken bowl was nourishing and refreshing, the Mac side was super yummy, and the strawberry basil blended ice was delicious without being overly sweet. The restaurant was clean and the service was excellent. We don''t mind waiting a few more minutes for our food, it''s worth it.', '2019-08-11 22:48:34', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2057, 1966, 17, 5, 'I visited for lunch today .The people who work here are amazing! Each one was so sweet and helpful. The butternut squash soup was too spicy for me, but they let me exchange it for sweet potato fries. I watched them bend over backward to help other customers. It made being there a joy!', '2018-12-15 18:19:34', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2058, 1967, 17, 5, 'Highly recommend! The food was great and they have a line of speciality drinks! Additionally, they have a great outdoor seating area!', '2019-09-16 01:14:03', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2059, 1968, 17, 5, 'Real food is a good way to describe this place.  I had a bowl with quinoa, kale and squash. It was good, but not complicated.', '2019-10-12 23:29:34', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2060, 1969, 17, 2, 'Nice space but the menu needs help. I had a harvest salad with chicken. The kale was tough, the chicken was dry, and the toppings we''re unbalanced with too many chickpeas and not much of the others (roasted squash, shredded white cheddar). The sherry vinaigrette was Awful due to piles of stale dry herbs and too much white vinegar. The beet vinaigrette had a beautiful pink color but almost no flavor. Overall the idea and the ingredients seem good but the execution is way off.', '2018-03-16 15:34:09', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2061, 1970, 17, 4, 'I went here on a very nice day and we sat outside. The food was delicious and came in a timely manner; I ordered the West Side burger and sweet potato fries. The cashier was also very nice, however they did forget one of my friend''s orders, so she got her meal well after the rest of us.', '2018-01-21 17:44:30', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2062, 1971, 17, 5, 'Love their food! So fresh and healthy. Really wonderful service too! Definitely recommend if you are looking for something healthy to eat at a price range of about 7-15 dollars.', '2018-06-02 12:17:37', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2063, 1972, 17, 3, 'Southwest chicken salad was good. Service was so so. I felt like I was interrupting something.', '2019-03-26 10:54:15', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2064, 1973, 17, 5, 'Fast and fresh. Lots of vegan/gluten free options. Nice, clean atmosphere.', '2019-01-19 18:10:54', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2065, 1974, 17, 5, 'Gone here a couple times, their food is so so tasty! And the drinks they have are delicious! Fast service and healthy. A little pricey for me but this is Charlottesville!', '2017-11-04 21:05:34', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2066, 1975, 17, 5, 'Food bowl was superb! Great variety of drinks! Customer service was EXCELLENT! I will definitely be returning!', '2017-09-21 23:27:38', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2067, 1976, 17, 4, 'Food is fresh and good. Interesting menu choices.', '2019-07-13 16:08:26', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2068, 1977, 17, 3, 'Good food choices - bit slow', '2019-06-26 19:41:35', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2069, 1978, 17, 5, 'Incredible ingredients. Quick, clean, easy parking a short step away from the crush of the Barracks Rd SC. Will return.', '2018-12-30 19:10:24', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2070, 1979, 17, 1, 'This is the worst place in the world. I have been asking for info for my daughter for about a week from a so call manager named Mark who don''t make sense. and the Dm Named Matthew Westcott is not good either. He Hung the phone up in my hear and I didn''t like it, but I will be in touch with the head of heads Chris Fuqua and see who laugh last......................', '2019-03-19 19:00:09', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2071, 1980, 17, 4, 'zucchini spaghetti and eggplant meatballs was delish.   salsa was really good too.', '2018-07-23 10:58:27', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2072, 1981, 17, 4, 'Love the food.  The GF options. I came in for my first time to meet with a partner of my business.  The girl at the cashier, on Monday night July 16, was not polite and acting careless in her service. I hope management takes note.', '2018-07-17 06:54:48', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2073, 1982, 17, 4, 'The eggplant meat balls and the #2 sandwich with chicken was great! Some people with me had trouble with the menu, however, they loved the 37 foot ceiling, lol.', '2018-06-03 12:31:56', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2074, 1983, 17, 2, 'Be good or be disappointed. Got a burger for a second time. Disappointed indeed. I have been here a few times and had previously ordered a bowl. The bowls are definitely the way to go! I don’t think I’ve ever seen more than 10 customers here. They do, however, have outside seating and they have had live music during one of my visits, but I’m not sure if that’s a regular thing.', '2017-12-11 23:52:15', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2075, 1984, 17, 2, 'Very Noisy environment, Nasty girl behind the counter w/big hair, salads came without ingredients b that are on the menu " because" that''s what they had! Young lady at cash register was very nice. Would Not recommend b.good because it is B.BAD.  NOBODY BEHIND THE COUNTER SMILED & LOOkED and looked Pissed that anyone walked through the door. Could not wait for everyone to finish so we could leave.', '2017-11-23 00:03:27', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2076, 1985, 17, 1, 'Thanks for all the honest reviews: Unfortunately I didnt read them before waiting 25-30 minutes to get my food.. The b.good aspect just isnt accurate and this service is the worst. Large overpriced portions of “Superfoods” is NOT healthy and neither is 80/20 beef. If you wanna burger just be unhealthy and enjoy a five guys burger. Fry bags say Only 8 grams of Fat - Nutrition Facts show Sat Fat is 8 and ignores the other 18-20grams. The baked fries are 1st FRIED then baked?! What? Unhealthy- Uneducated people running a “Healthy” restaurant- Just laughable!', '2018-05-23 04:02:39', NULL
UNION ALL
