SELECT 2137, 2045, 10, 5, 'Visited Little Star for the first time and it was pure magic. Our server was friendly and all around incredible. The interior was gorgeous and they made excellent use of the space. The flatware was beautiful and every piece was a little bit different. Cocktails were delicious and very inventive. The food was out of this world delicious and the pacing of each dish brought out was perfect. Some have complained in reviews of being a bit pricey but I feel it''s appropriately priced for the quality and service.', '2019-06-16 06:16:25', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2138, 2046, 10, 5, 'Such an amazing dining experience in Charlottesville! Beth, our server, made our time so comfortable - all of the staff are attentive, friendly, offer great recommendations. The food came out quickly and was great - awesome flavors and so unique! We can’t wait to come back and try more dishes! There was nothing we didn’t like!', '2019-07-28 00:32:47', NULL
UNION ALL
