SELECT 2261, 2168, 57, 1, 'What a  terrible experience I had today! I ordered online and reviewed my ticket. The wings were sougy and bland and was supposed to be extra crispy. The pizzas were cold wi/ no sauce on them, the tinest pepporonies sparsly scattered & tough cheese that my toddlers wldnt even eat and the chicken strips were dry with no sauce. Basically the order was horrible. When I called manager L*** I took the refund option by returning the food. I baged up the food and waited for her driver to come back out as per her instructions. 1 1/2 hour later still no driver. I called back and got mgr la****** who apologized b/c lisa told her I would bring them the food for the refund. I explained again no car and babysitting twin toddlers which is why I chose delivery in the first place. 35 mins later...got my refund. Lisa''s attitude was not great leadership for cust service. I had to REMIND her satisfaction was gty''d before she offered the refund. If my family cld`ve ate the terrible food we wld''ve in order not to deal with her.  I haven''t eaten at Calz''s in over 6 years and was excited to order today. However my family will probably never return again.', '2017-03-14 09:09:32', NULL
