SELECT 2545, 2448, 65, 5, 'I love this place a bit high on the prices on something but understandable. I go here every year a few times I get all my outdoor plants from here', '2021-04-12 21:01:36', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2546, 2449, 65, 4, 'Huge variety of flowers and plants. I was looking for some exotic flowers which I did not find but my 10 year old loved the visit. It wasn''t too crowded although you wouldn''t think so from the parking lot. I didn''t receive any help as no one offered to but this was a browsing trip so not offended. If you''re looking to spruce up the garden this is a great place to start especially if you want to avoid the big chain stores.', '2021-04-09 20:55:36', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2547, 2450, 65, 5, 'Love Anderson’s and Sage Kitchen. Chicken salad sandwich and black bean salad are something to crave. There’s few places with such style and curated taste, Anderson’s and Sage are both!', '2021-05-09 16:31:37', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2548, 2451, 65, 5, 'Absolutely love the shopping experience! Staff is always great. Returned to get a few more plants for my upcoming vivarium project. My mini vivarium looks phenomenal thanks to the fair garden plants I found about 6 weeks ago. I highly recommend them.', '2021-03-16 21:30:59', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2549, 2452, 65, 5, 'I love this place...but it''s too cool...if you''re not careful, you could spend more $ than you planned on. So many great plants, veggies, gardening supplies and items...and stuff you want to have but may not need to have.', '2021-05-10 17:14:39', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2550, 2453, 65, 4, 'Very friendly staff, had most of what I needed. The greenhouse is beautiful. I could easily spend an entire paycheck in there!', '2021-04-28 01:20:44', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2551, 2454, 65, 5, 'One of our favorite places on the other side of the tunnel. Had to visit the VA, so this is just a 20 minute side trip. Sage kitchen is practicing good covid precautions, while still putting out a quality menu. And the shops are distancing well, but still furnishing great choices.', '2021-03-25 00:57:10', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2552, 2455, 65, 5, 'So many beautiful flowers you can''t make a decision but they come with a hefty price tag.', '2021-05-08 17:16:54', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2553, 2456, 65, 5, 'Wonderful choice of house plants and Christmas decor. They do a senior discount on Mondays. Great selection of pots for a reasonable price for the most part.', '2020-11-13 19:13:18', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2554, 2457, 65, 5, 'Great spice options. For a great price', '2021-05-01 18:11:13', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2555, 2458, 65, 4, 'I always enjoy Andersons - good early stock available for my garden', '2021-04-09 21:15:27', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2556, 2459, 65, 5, 'If I could live at this place, I would! Beautiful plants, great selection.', '2021-04-25 16:36:25', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2557, 2460, 65, 5, 'This store has everything you need for an adorable garden, plants, mulch and decor.', '2021-04-02 18:03:27', NULL
UNION ALL
