SELECT 2605, 2508, 65, 4, 'Anderson''s is a great small designer food place.  When you walk in you get greeted by a very welcoming and friendly staff.  The wait staff here is amazingly friendly and the more you eat here they will remember your order.  For breakfast they offer ever changing coffee drinks and juices.  Well worth trying.  Their breakfast food is amazing and there is something for everyone, but more fancy than traditional places, not diner food.  For lunch they always have the best soups to compliment there sandwiches, salads, and burgers.  My personal favorite is the Gobbler, it is Thanksgiving between bread.  The sides are good but you''ll probably full from the soup.  The desserts are good as well but I rarely have room for them.  My one complaint is that some menu items that are very good are seasonal only.', '2015-02-06 22:45:47', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2606, 2509, 65, 5, 'My favorite nursery, I try to visit in  the spring, so many plants, and also clothes and excellent food from what I understand. Having celiac disease I have not eaten there.', '2019-09-18 14:34:12', NULL
UNION ALL
