UNION ALL
SELECT 2614, 2517, 65, 5, 'Have you ever wanted something different?  Then come here! They are the perfect mix of a home store, garden center, and gift shop rolled into one location.  The BEST part is the gourmet cafe on site that has wonderful breakfast and lunch options.  Just take a walk around Anderson''s it will make you happy!!!    Locally owned and operated multi-generational family business.', '2016-10-27 05:39:49', NULL
