SELECT 2630, 2533, 65, 4, 'While their garden prices are a little higher than a home improvement store, they have plant choices you don''t see and each plant is down-right vibrant.  There are fountains, flags, boots, soil, pergolas... The garden department is a five star.  The boutique is not for me.  $149.99 for a shirt I touched on the rack on my last visit was a wow.  You will find patio furniture here that outshines too, but you will pay furniture store price for it. I have never eaten at the cafe.  Can''t speak for that.', '2018-04-07 13:14:23', NULL
UNION ALL
