SELECT 2651, 2554, 65, 2, 'They have absolutely gorgeous flowers, plants, etc to choose from...and a good variety. I was walking around there for at least an hour and a half and not one employee talked to me or asked me if I needed help with anything. While I was in the greenhouse, I said, "I have no idea what I''m doing!", right when an employee walked by (a little passive-aggressive, I know lol)...he laughed and said that he will go and find someone that can help me. So I waited...and waited...waited a little more...and no one ever came over to help me! Smh. Not to mention, it was brutally hot in the greenhouse, which is fine, but I was standing there, waiting...feeling like I was going to burst into flames at any moment. I''m surprised by all of this, beings they have stellar reviews. Also, their merchandise is waayyy over-priced. So I left, an unhappy customer. I will not be going back.', '2016-06-22 15:50:00', NULL
