SELECT 2792, 2693, 52, 5, 'Best Gyros in town. Used to own The Castle on Jefferson Avenue. The Tsiki sauce is amazing! Highly recommend getting extra, you''ll wish you did.😋👍', '2020-11-12 00:14:49', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2793, 2694, 52, 4, 'Mr. Gyros has some awesome gyros. Been here a few times when fast food needs a change up. I think I will start to go more. The burgers here are ok, nothing too fancy but the gyros are spectacular. I would recommend this place hands down. There is rarely a line, probably because of the prices which are a few coins higher than most would expect. Still a great place to try if you haven''t already.', '2017-10-20 20:51:25', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2794, 2695, 52, 5, 'Drove from virginia beach to try. I wasn''t disappointed great gyro. Onion rings were delicious. Worth the drive for a great gyro. Next time I will try the lamb burger!', '2020-11-19 22:33:14', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2795, 2696, 52, 5, 'A little expensive, but the food is worth it. I''ve had the Greek salad, fries, chicken gyro, garden salad, and baklava throughout my visits here. Small dining room and small outdoor seating. Seems most customers use the drive-thru as it''s normally not too crowded inside. Customer service is excellent. They keep it clean, they''re friendly and helpful. The food is excellent and the baklava is the best I''ve had. I really like the vinegarette for the salads. Don''t let the hole-in-a-wall appearance throw you off, definitely worth a stop.', '2018-02-15 01:23:35', NULL
UNION ALL
