SELECT 2806, 2707, 52, 5, 'Always love coming here. Maybe a little more than I should (as they now know my order by heart). But great service, and great food. I don''t have a single negative thing to say about them. A small family-owned restaurant.', '2019-12-14 23:24:42', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2807, 2708, 52, 2, 'The restaurants was clean, had good customer service(she was really kind!) BUT I expected too much for the Gyro..I used to go to "Papa''s greek pizza" in Virginia Beach and their gyro is the best!!! It could be just my taste. I like the gyro sauce with full of garlic flavor in it. This place''s gyro sauce was just not really flavorful which made me so sad...:( I had an inferno gyro which supposed to taste spicy but their jalapeño pepper wasn''t spicy AT ALL..it was almost had no flavor😅. That was funny.', '2017-04-03 22:56:31', NULL
