SELECT 2830, 2731, 52, 5, 'It''s probably one of the best Greek restaurant that I have been too. The food is delicious and they have one of the best fries I have ever tasted. Also, they sell their salad dressing by the bottle, so if you really like your dressing you can take it home with you.', '2019-12-19 18:44:29', NULL
