SELECT 2870, 2771, 52, 5, 'Love Mr. Gyros! Rice bowls, appetizers (mushrooms, hummus, tzatziki, pomades) are all amazing!', '2020-02-12 21:46:59', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2871, 2772, 52, 2, 'I visit mr. Gyro Burger at least twice a month however on my most recent visit we encountered a problem with the order. Got home to find the wrong item in the bag. Called back to see to get this rectified. Did not want to go back out just wanted to get a credit for the wrong item. The manager / owner said sure no problem just make sure you save and bring back the wrong order. My response was what am I supposed to eat tonight. She said if you want the credit you have to bring back the food. It was a $26 order so I said fine. Got off the phone confused and said wait call back and said you know what I''ll bring all your food back. Took the food back end of the tour through the drive-thru and all all of a sudden she wanted to try to be nice I said don''t talk to me just give me my money have a nice day you don''t have to worry about me again good customers are hard to come by nowadays she should take care of her customers it''s not like the doors are being beat down. But she basically called me a thief. I will never return to this place again.', '2019-05-05 12:49:09', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2872, 2773, 52, 5, 'Our first time here today.  We both ordered the Lamb Gyro, Traditional & BBQ. The food is made fresh from your order,  even the fries.   The restaurant itself looks really small inside so we ordered drive thru.  Please eat here, you will NOT be disappointed.', '2019-04-21 00:43:41', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2873, 2774, 52, 4, 'Got the chicken gyro and the lamb gyro with baklava for dessert. The lamb was great ! The chicken one was okay. the chicken was a little tough and hard to chew with some pieces, however the last time I got it the chicken wasnt like that.... The baklava was pretty good one of the better ones I''ve had around here. 🙂', '2019-02-21 21:59:41', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2874, 2775, 52, 5, 'Don''t be fooled by this small restaurant. Delicious gyros with fresh lettuce, tomato and onions, good sized. They have different sauces and meats in fresh round bread that''s folded. I also tried the felafels which were delicious too in their sauce. Look up their menu that also has burgers, rice bowls, cheesecakes and baklava. Outdoor tables and drive thru too.', '2019-05-21 17:44:54', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 2875, 2776, 52, 5, 'Love gyro''s. The young man behind the counter was as nice as he could be. The fries and gyro where excellent. Best I''ve ever had. We also got baklava and it was delicious. We will be back!', '2017-02-03 19:12:04', NULL
UNION ALL
