SELECT 2895, 2795, 52, 5, 'My husband and I decided to try something different tonight, like, a place where we hadn''t eaten before. Gyro & Burgers was the spot we selected. We''re so glad we tried them out, they''re food is delicious. The food was fresh, hot and we think they prepare upon order so your food would taste 10 times better... It smelled awesome too. The  customer service was polite, friendly and very pleasant overall. We did have to wait a little while tho at the  drive-thru but it was well worth it. We''d definitely try this place again 😊.', '2018-09-30 02:39:12', NULL
