SELECT 3256, 3141, 15, 5, 'Excellent food, hit the spot for Vietnamese craving.  Restaurant has a nice ambiance, feels nicer than your typical plaza stop.  The bun was warm, which was nice, in my limited experience, I feel like the noodles are often served room temp or even a little cold.   The bubble tea is really sweet (too sweet and syrupy for my taste but my kids were the ones enjoying it) and the shrimp chips and custard dessert are very lovely complimentary additions.', '2019-07-28 00:11:28', NULL
UNION ALL
