SELECT 3287, 3171, 15, 5, 'Nice little Vietnamese restaurant on Main Street in Fairfax City just east of the old Courthouse.  Of course they serve pho with all sorts of meat.  They also have spring rolls and vegetable rolls (I really like their sauce, I think it''s a peanut sauce).  They also serve plates of lemongrass sauteed with your choice of meat or those thin rice noodles with meat.  Unexpectedly, they serve a small flan with a caramel sauce at the end of your meal.  The service is great.  Free parking is around the corner or a block away, but it is well worth the walk.', '2018-08-13 05:08:34', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3288, 3172, 15, 5, 'I love the healthy rolls-i don''t what they are  actually called - rice paper with shrimp and lettuce in peanut sauce.  Chicken lemongrass is also a delicious dish.  Good service too', '2018-10-17 18:10:47', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3289, 3173, 15, 5, 'The atmosphere is clean, bright, and yet cozy.  They give you shrimp crackers with pepper sauce on the table as a free appetizer.  The service was good, and the Egg Noodle Soup is the best soup I have had at any Asian restaurant!  I recommend getting it with the red pork.', '2018-01-27 04:30:48', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3290, 3174, 15, 3, 'Good food, quality atmosphere  Much of the menu is fish and shell-fish, including the free on-table shrimp flakes appetizer. They are very accommodating, but make sure you warn them about allergies.', '2019-06-17 16:13:07', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3291, 3175, 15, 5, 'Stopped here on a whim and was very pleasantly surprised. I had the grilled pork work special house (fish) sauce and the serving size was excellent. You are started out with shrimp crackers and some home made chili paste and a chili paste reduction with olive oil. There is plenty of seating as the building as very deep. Public parking is your best bet.', '2015-12-15 19:32:42', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3292, 3176, 15, 4, 'I''ve only ate here once but I will most definitely be going again. The food was flavorful and delicious.', '2019-09-15 17:15:46', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3293, 3177, 15, 5, 'One of the best Pho places in Fairfax.  Been around forever for good reason.  Food is very good.  Place gets crowded at times.  Located right in Old Town Fairfax, free parking nearby is accessible.  Prices also good.', '2017-01-29 21:09:09', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3294, 3178, 15, 5, 'What a delicious, fast inexpensive meal! I will definetly come back. The pho os to die pho', '2019-10-02 00:26:54', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3295, 3179, 15, 5, 'Great pho and other dishes. Good service. Got there around 8pm Sunday, not too busy.  I highly recommend this place.', '2018-12-24 03:53:10', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3296, 3180, 15, 4, 'This place is great. Service is fast buy they don''t rush you. The lunch specials are fantastic. I would recommend to anyone.', '2017-10-19 17:57:27', NULL
UNION ALL
