UNION ALL
SELECT 3303, 3187, 15, 5, 'Eastwind is my new favorite Vietnamese restaurant in the area.  I first visited on my daughter''s recommendation and have been back 3 or 4 times and continue to find the same excellent food and warm service.  Have loved everything I''ve tried, most recently the spicy hue.  If you''re not an expert on the cuisine, they''re great with questions.', '2016-08-19 15:46:17', NULL
