SELECT 3321, 3205, 15, 5, 'The broth here is amazing!! This is definitely one of my favorite places to get pho. The staff is always friendly. The place is very clean and decorated nicely. They offered complimentary shrimp crackers and flan dessert when we stopped by for lunch yesterday. They also have great prices with $7 pho during the lunch special. Highly recommend coming here!', '2017-03-21 11:11:26', NULL
