SELECT 3336, 1767, 15, 5, 'GREAT place for a nice dinner that won''t overkill your wallet. Great food, and if you like spicy, tell them how much because even the stuff with peppers next to it on the menu won''t be bad unless you tell them to make it that hot.', '2016-09-21 23:18:03', NULL
