SELECT 3502, 3376, 27, 5, 'Wow oh wow this place is great!! Victoria greater us with a warm smile and was the Queen of multitasking. Taking out bread, doing mobile orders, and managing a line ALL BY HERSELF!! She apologized and said she was the only one there. But my service was great , we were in a hurry but her warm personality made us take a couple extra minutes. We enjoyed our travel stop at this subway!!', '2021-04-11 14:58:13', NULL
