SELECT 3579, 3452, 45, 5, 'Excellent pizza, and sides. A must try.', '2021-04-18 13:17:32', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3580, 3453, 45, 5, 'We''re so glad we were able to stop by. It''s such a cool place. The decor remind us of our childhood in Chicago, tasteful organized graffiti (yeah, yeah, we know it''s NY). We came a little after lunch so it was quiet but we were so hungry and excited to eat that we forgot to take a bunch of pics. The lunch special is such a great deal, you really can''t beat it. Salad, pizza and a drink for $8.50. Of course I pick a meatball topping a nod to the now closed balls of glory and the meatball was great as usual, now if I can get that Rosemary sauce on that pizza I may be addicted, who cares about being lactose intolerant! The Ceasar salad was fresh and crisp as always with a generous amount of cheese. My husband got the same with sausage topping, he didn''t share but I''m sure it''s good. We can''t wait to go back for a full size pizza. Now for the service... Our server was great, funny thorough and attentive, couldn''t ask for anything better. Overall such a great experience.', '2020-03-11 21:54:06', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3581, 3454, 45, 5, CONVERT(X'' USING utf8mb4), '2020-10-07 23:17:29', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3582, 3455, 45, 5, 'I''d met Curtis online through friends. My wife is from Western NY, and very picky about pizza. We were going to Delirium, another of his restaurants, and I decided we should try Wild Wood too. It was her birthday, and pizza would be the perfect comfort food to enjoy while staying in. We got Margherita and San Andreas pizzas, a caesar salad and meatballs. The pizzas were done perfectly, with a crispy crust that you could pick up folded with no sag. The salad was good, but the meatballs stood out. My wife didn''t know that meatballs were a specialty, and the key staple of Balls of Glory that he''d also founded. A great combination.', '2020-03-28 17:06:54', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3583, 3456, 45, 5, 'Excellent pizza and inviting atmosphere. Live music was very pleasant. Staff very friendly and eager to make sure its a good customer experience. 5/5', '2020-10-09 00:01:45', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3584, 3457, 45, 4, 'Fantastic pizza when you order or eat there. Our our carry-out order was a bit cold when they first opened. Hoping this timing was worked out though.  I also hope that in the future they add more appetizers or other items on the menu. Very cool atmosphere and we had fantastic servers there too.', '2020-08-02 23:11:43', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3585, 3458, 45, 4, 'I loved the atmosphere, colors, art (they even have Bansky), and we were welcomed by a nice smile. We ordered the Sunday Family Dinner that included a house salad, marinated olives, a 16” two topping pizza, and a sunday. We didn’t wait long when our pizza came out. Sadly before our salad and olives. They apologized and said it was a computer error. I wanted to cancel the meal but they gave us the salad and had the olives put in a to-go box. They ended up giving us a discount for the mistake. Great beer selection. The food wasn’t out of this world, but something to satisfy a NY style pizza craving.', '2020-03-03 01:58:47', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3586, 3459, 45, 5, CONVERT(X'' USING utf8mb4), '2020-02-18 23:59:03', NULL
UNION ALL
