SELECT 3619, 3492, 75, 5, 'First time at this location. Beautiful setting. Open walls and umbrella seating. Right on the marina and lots of boats. Cool breeze off the water. Good food except our fries were luke warm. Food arrived rather quickly. Our waitress was very attentive.', '2020-07-04 22:35:37', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3620, 3493, 75, 5, 'We have eaten here many times over many years. Love the blackened tuna, the crab cakes, the calamari, and everything else we have had. The hush puppies are delicious. A great place to get a smaller serving of delicious seafood for a very reasonable price. Feels healthy. We always sit outside and love watching the birds and the boats. An easy place to take kids for dinner.', '2020-11-14 14:31:39', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3621, 3494, 75, 5, 'This is a great place to eat. The shrimp appetizer is great. Crab cakes some of the best in town. Poboy’s are really good - made me appreciate that kind of sandwich more. The bay burger is great for a big appetite. Boat access. You can order straight from the dock.', '2020-07-10 12:09:20', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3622, 3495, 75, 5, 'Very good service by the wait staff. The food was better than I have had in a long time!  The food  portions were very generous, plan on taking some home with you.', '2020-06-24 01:43:53', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3623, 3496, 75, 5, 'Docked the boat and had a nice Father’s Day dinner. Hush puppies are great.  Their steamed Broccoli 🥦 with cheese sauce is perfect addition to the seafood.', '2020-06-21 23:06:45', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3624, 3497, 75, 4, 'Great food, excellent service, safe practices including masks, hand sanitizer, and plenty of distance between tables.  Would have given 5 star were it not for the owner''s peculiar decision to play music via Pandora with commercials!  Heard the same 3 dumb commercials over and over while dining.  Very tacky; not what I want or expect when eating out.', '2020-07-26 03:14:07', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3625, 3498, 75, 5, 'Great food, friends and fun!!!', '2021-05-01 01:27:32', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3626, 3499, 75, 2, 'I went in, asked for a table and was told it was closed due to weather. Only to see lots of people inside eating and people waiting outside to get in. Then watched people go in as I was waiting for my friend to show up so we could find another place. I guess I''m not one of the cool kids. I''m a member of the marina and I tip well but I was still treated like I wasn''t welcome there. It''s sad this type of stereotyping still takes place in this day and age.', '2020-07-24 12:44:12', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3627, 685, 75, 1, 'CLOSED FOR THE SEASON despite saying open. Call before you go!!!!!!', '2021-02-02 22:07:24', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3628, 934, 75, 5, 'This is my favorite surf-rider restaurant. I used to keep my boat at Marina Shores and it was lovely to come here and eat after a day on the water. I think surf-rider may have the best crab cakes in Hampton Roads. This location is especially unique because it''s open to the outside so you can dine almost directly on the water.', '2019-11-20 15:55:26', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3629, 3500, 75, 4, 'We enjoyed lunch here. Most of the food was quite good but the shrimp was a little rubbery and the fish somewhat dry.', '2020-05-29 18:14:46', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3630, 3501, 75, 4, 'Love the crab cakes. Great place to check out. Has outdoor eating over the water.', '2019-05-31 20:08:09', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3631, 3502, 75, 5, 'Always DEEEE-lish!', '2020-05-24 19:23:49', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3632, 3503, 75, 5, 'Take out order     Service and food were great.', '2020-08-06 02:07:57', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3633, 3504, 75, 5, 'Great atmosphere, service, and food.', '2020-06-12 22:28:22', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3634, 3505, 75, 5, 'This place knows how to cook some good seafood! I would definitely eat here all the time if I could! Also the service here was great! Felt like we were right at home and we had a big party for one person to handle. She dd great!', '2018-07-24 23:13:06', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3635, 3506, 75, 5, 'Great seafood, great service, the crab dip is the best', '2020-09-02 01:00:21', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3636, 3507, 75, 5, 'The food was great and reasonably priced. If you like alcoholic drinks their Rum Runner is amazing. The staff was friendly and the service was great.', '2019-07-24 01:52:42', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3637, 3508, 75, 5, 'Loved our crabcake and broccoli lunch - always a family favorite! It was a gorgeous day to have lunch at Surf Rider''s open air restaurant at Marina Shores. Great breezes and views. Always terrific service and food.', '2019-05-01 17:39:39', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3638, 3509, 75, 5, 'Great marina-side restaurant with beautiful views and open air seating. Food is delicious, priced well, and comes in huge servings on most dishes. The waiters and waitresses are very good and give you quick service. Rum runner drink is a must to try!', '2019-05-29 17:37:43', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3639, 3510, 75, 5, 'We love Surf Rider.  The food is always the best.  The only suggestion I have for management is to PLEASE upgrade your cocktail selection.  We''ve never been pleased with anything but the frozen specialty drinks, and I dont typically want to drink a frozen lemonade with my excellent seafood.  Add some crushes, margaritas, etc.', '2019-08-16 23:57:29', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3640, 3511, 75, 5, 'They have the best mojitos & crab legs! & when your done you can take a nice stroll down the marina', '2016-09-08 19:26:57', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3641, 3512, 75, 4, 'Good seafood...great atmosphere...great service', '2020-08-01 00:01:07', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3642, 3513, 75, 4, 'Had another grwat meal. Service is always the best. Love those Rum Runners!', '2019-07-01 23:42:51', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3643, 3514, 75, 4, 'Tough parking with next door construction. Great food service was good. Open air though.', '2019-07-10 16:43:20', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3644, 3515, 75, 5, 'Great food and service.', '2020-08-23 12:16:36', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3645, 3516, 75, 4, 'Good food, friendly staff and great ambiance', '2019-08-12 21:50:43', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3646, 3517, 75, 5, 'This is the place to go for seafood.  We went to the one off of Shore Road next to the Yacht Club. We sat outside and had a view of the yachts while eating.  I will definitely go back the next time I''m in Virginia Beach.', '2018-08-13 17:16:50', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3647, 3518, 75, 5, 'It''s lovely to dine with a view of the marina. The wait staff is always friendly and knowledgeable. The crab cakes are the best I''ve ever had, all crab, very very little filler. Portions are well sized, and the seafood is well prepared. My girlfriends and I eat here at least once a month during their season. We switch to the Oceana location during the winter months.', '2017-07-17 02:30:18', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3648, 3519, 75, 1, 'Way over priced and the food was basic. Served at tables next to the water on cheap plates  $155 for 6 people and we left hungry. Needless to say that this place is nothing more that overpriced white privilege. Dont waste your time or money.', '2019-05-15 20:32:48', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3649, 3520, 75, 5, 'I''ve gone to this place about three times. The crab dip is amazing! The drinks are very tasty. Try the the strawberry lemonade! The staff was great and the service was as well. I have only been on Friday, and it gets pretty packed. Nice environment to go to with friends.', '2018-06-11 21:49:30', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3650, 3521, 75, 4, 'Fried shrimp not overcooked. Crabcake was good. Little to no filler. Good service. Great crab dip. Lovely view if marina. Just know that even the inside is outside. If it''s hot outside, it will be hot everywhere. It was a beautiful might when we went.', '2017-06-11 22:48:25', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3651, 3522, 75, 5, 'Pricey but good! The rum runner drinks are SO good!!  Of course they''re known for their crabcakes as they should be. Its all meat, no filler. The appetizer of calamari was also delish. Service is fast and they were packed!! Laid back atmosphere,  its all open and has a beach feel.  You can get away with shorts,  jeans or a little dressier with khackis or a dress.  Either way its good food and I will be back!', '2019-05-14 01:58:02', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3652, 3523, 75, 5, 'Real good good food - had the black an blue tuna wrap - and great service!', '2019-08-03 20:09:13', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3653, 3524, 75, 5, 'Their rum runners are amazing. Great food and atmosphere. Service is very good and pleasant people', '2018-09-18 19:50:34', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3654, 3525, 75, 4, 'Good food,drinks and wait staff.nice atmosphere', '2019-06-30 13:36:16', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3655, 3526, 75, 4, 'The food was delicious.  Our server was very attentive and brought us everything we asked for, sometimes before we even asked.  The only thing keeping me from giving 5 stars is that the place was very noisy; probably the loudest place I''ve dined for quite a while.', '2017-10-01 01:25:30', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3656, 3527, 75, 1, 'The worst place I’ve every been the food was cold and it was too loud and it took for ever to get something this place is not kid friendly. The burger was under cooked the fan made it to cold in there I hated with a passion will not be back', '2018-07-13 22:48:55', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3657, 3528, 75, 4, 'Good food.  On the pier. Beautiful view', '2019-05-17 11:44:22', NULL
UNION ALL
