UNION ALL
SELECT 3841, 3707, 44, 5, 'Great intimate fine dining.godd selection of inexpensive wine and good craft beer choices.', '2019-12-25 13:45:07', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3842, 3708, 44, 5, 'Apparently the owners (husband and wife) took years to restore this old house into their dream restaurant. Food was very good. I''d tell you what to try but the menu changes by season. The desserts were outstanding and we could not believe that they were only $5 considering the work that went into crafting them. Very good restaurant for a small town like Luray. Reservations a must (we were there 4th of July weekend so maybe that''s why).', '2019-08-08 20:15:19', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3843, 3709, 44, 5, 'The service was personal and they were very attentive.', '2020-02-29 02:18:57', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3844, 3710, 44, 4, 'We were in Luray on vacation and stopped here for Sunday brunch. The food was so tasty, and I was extremely happy to find a place with vegan options! My only complaint was that my vegan dish was nearly twice the cost of my other family members and half the size. It was so delicious, and I wanted there to be more. The portion sizes on what my family ordered were great for the price. Also, we thought the atmosphere was lovely. Would go again if we vacation in the area, but I (as the vegan not my whole family) would make sure to be snack before I go.', '2019-04-04 19:46:20', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3845, 3711, 44, 5, 'Very very good food. Simply a delight.', '2019-12-29 16:50:54', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3846, 3712, 44, 5, 'I was frankly amazed at the high quality food that we got for a super reasonable price.  You should visit Moonshadows before they realize they could raise their prices 50%.  I had the pecan pancakes with blueberries and my wife got the shrimp and grits.  Both were fantastic.', '2018-05-28 02:37:07', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3847, 3713, 44, 5, 'Delicious fancy meal! This place gets really busy on weekend and reservations are a must to be sure of a table. Their is dining upstairs, downstairs and on the front covered porch.  The menu is somewhat limited, but the choices are exquisite! I had the Grilled Spring Shrimp and loved every bite of it!', '2018-05-20 02:03:45', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 3848, 3714, 44, 5, 'Creative, beautifully executed meals at moderate (not looking) prices.  A beautiful old house.  Warning:. Service on the porch can be very noisy, even discounting the firehouse down the street.  The mason jar containing disposable was plugs made sense after a few minutes outside', '2018-06-16 03:16:21', NULL
UNION ALL
