SELECT 3879, 3743, 44, 5, 'Moonshadows is a fantastic restaurant in Luray. The food, wine, ambiance, and service were all excellent. My wife had a salmon entree with seasonal vegetables while I had seared scallops with spinach and risotto, both nicely done and arranged. Some thought clearly went into the recipes, which both had a bit of flair while remaining relatively straightforward. The scallops,  for example, were in a miso sauce. I really enjoyed it. We had a great bottle of cabernet blanc, and dessert (moonshadows pie) was excellent - more of a cake.', '2019-02-19 01:43:21', NULL
