UNION ALL
SELECT 3962, 3823, 7, 5, 'Whenever I get to choose where to eat, Nawab has been my first choice for about 15 years... maybe more. The service is great, the atmosphere is lovely, the drinks are yummy and the food is... my absolute favorite food on earth. I could be happy eating every meal from here for the rest of my life. The naan at this restaurant is superior to all other indian cuisine I have. Whenever I go out of town and eat Indian food, I always compare it to Nawab. So far I have not found a better dinner sport between Richmond, VA and Denver, CO.', '2020-12-18 13:53:06', NULL
