SELECT 4293, 4142, 49, 4, 'This is one of the better places to eat at in Norton in my opinion. The food is good and so is the service. The pizza is good but greasy. The food is cooked to order. I recommend this place to anybody. They have gluten free options also I think.', '2017-05-13 03:49:20', NULL
