SELECT 4295, 4144, 49, 4, 'Great place to eat!  The Chico Philly is amazing! The salads are great too.  Had a burger from here for the first time today, and wasn''t disappointed at all. Sometimes they are a bit short staffed, but they always work hard to take care of you.  Added bonus if you are lucky enough to get Amy Stanley as your waitress!!  She''s great!', '2017-07-04 19:43:00', NULL
