SELECT 4441, 4279, 16, 5, 'Went for a FAMILY BREAKFAST! We had 10 members in our party we were seated in the banquet room close to the back. The service was great 2 wait staff served us. The food was delicious, hot, comfort, home style. The price was even better. I paid for 4 meals and it was less than 40 dollars. I still took food home because I was so full. My only complaint was the scrambled eggs next time I will ask to have them scrambled with sharp cheddar cheese. No other complaints and I will go back again and I recommend this resturant', '2020-11-05 21:46:19', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4442, 4280, 16, 5, CONVERT(X'' USING utf8mb4), '2021-05-10 14:34:23', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4443, 4281, 16, 5, 'I''ve been coming here for years. They have a nice menu. I love the Salmon cakes. I''ve never has any major issues with my food. My server Is always nice & friendly. On the weekends the line cam be pretty long. But with covid going on, I''ve used the curbside pickup. Highly recommend', '2021-03-20 13:50:08', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4444, 4282, 16, 5, 'Its a cash only restaurant that''s worth a trip to the bank.  The service is outstanding and the food is quick and good.', '2021-04-21 11:39:52', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4445, 25, 16, 5, 'Breakfast or Lunch, it''s all good! The best catfish I''ve ever had is at Tommy''s, you don''t need any sauce or anything to eat with it. I''m addicted to the catfish but all their food is good. They make their own hamburgers too. Always fresh ingredients brought in everyday. The place is always packed but I''ve never waited for more than about 5 minutes to get a table, though the line does look intimidating to newcomers. You can''t beat the price either, and the portions are great!', '2021-01-03 18:35:44', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4446, 4283, 16, 3, 'My rating is based on the service alone. We waited 30 minutes for a table, and that isn''t a big deal the problem was the fact we weren''t even acknowledged at the door. There were no others on front of us. The kitchen and wait staff were arguing for all to hear. I''ve always had good service and great food here. It seems they aren''t able to pull off the new covid restrictions easily. The wait staff was overwhelmed even though it is reduced seating. We watched three tables finish up and pay. Those tables sat there dirty until we finally left.', '2021-04-15 21:07:00', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4447, 4284, 16, 5, 'Good food at very reasonable prices.  A cash only business so make sure you''re prepared though there is an ATM in the lobby area before you come in.  Very popular for breakfast but worth the wait :)', '2021-04-21 15:30:27', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4448, 4285, 16, 5, 'Food is delicious and prices are great. The waitress we had today was so nice. I wish every restaurant had a clone of her.', '2021-03-07 18:15:41', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4449, 4286, 16, 5, 'Very good food. Nice staff. Alot of food for the money. You wont leave hungry.', '2021-04-03 20:54:30', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4450, 4287, 16, 5, 'The food is delicious and is usually always served hot. My favorite is the catfish breakfast. **they do not advertise this, but the catfish comes fried, but you can ask for it grilled.** I''ve also had omelettes, pancakes, waffles, eggs, potatoes, so many things to name. You definitely get your money worth at this place.', '2021-01-13 22:17:32', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4451, 4288, 16, 5, 'Tommys was good as usual I waitress was awesome very kind can tell she is a very nice person. Wish her much success and blessings.', '2021-04-22 18:34:53', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4452, 4289, 16, 5, 'LOVE IT.  I was waiting for Flo to pop out an say Kiss My Grits.. 💋 The food was great an for the money it was even better..', '2021-04-22 02:12:15', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4453, 4290, 16, 5, 'Always a favorite. This is old-fashioned home cooking at is finest. Combine that with a real sense of customer service and the price great place overall. The only issues is that if you don''t get there early you have a pretty long wait, 15-30 depending when you show, due to the small service area. Finally cash only restaurant which is just a business preference.', '2020-12-05 13:38:15', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4454, 4291, 16, 5, 'Done even need a menu when I go. It is the perfect example of a small, independent local restaurant. The waitstaff know the regulars by name, they are attentive and quick, and most of all, the food is DELICIOUS! I''ve never ordered something I regretted, although I have to say that their main combo is my go to. It has a little bit of everything', '2021-01-27 14:20:30', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4455, 4292, 16, 5, 'We love Tommy’s. Great local place and a Hampton Roads must eat. All the food is good but we love the scrapple.', '2021-03-20 14:20:11', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4456, 4293, 16, 5, 'Me and my wife enjoy her MOTHER''S DAY breakfast 🙏💖👌', '2021-05-10 13:12:36', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4457, 4294, 16, 5, 'I got two eggs with crispy bacon and hash browns plus toast. The waitress we had was a gem as when my bacon came out it was limp so she went and got me some super crispy bacon. Plus my hash browns were not as crispy as I like them but they were way crisper than any others I saw in the restaurant. Both my friends really enjoyed their meals.', '2021-01-19 12:35:02', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4458, 4295, 16, 4, 'Been here twice now if I would''ve got the same waitress I got the first time I probably would''ve gave it 5 stars first experience was great the waitress had a strong personality but I liked it she was friendly and attentive and the food was amazing the second time the waitress we had was terrible barely said a word to us the service was slow it was very busy though food was still amazing . I will probably still eat here and I will just hope to get a good waitress and come on a slower day.', '2021-03-01 02:05:08', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4459, 4296, 16, 1, 'Ate here three weeks ago. Food was good. Later that night I had a really bad stomach upset. Did not think it was this place that did it. Just thought it was a random bug. Ate here again this morning and tonight again I have a really really bad stomach upset. This will be the last time Ill eat here.', '2020-12-28 06:08:19', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4460, 4297, 16, 5, 'Food was good, service was ok... It was really busy... Long wait', '2021-04-28 17:03:49', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4461, 4298, 16, 5, CONVERT(X'4e6576657220686164206120626164206d65616c20617420546f6d6d7927730a4272696e672063617368206f7220636865636b20616e6420612070696c6c6f772c20666f6f6420736f20676f6f6420796f757220676f6e6e61206e6565642061206e61702061667465727761726473206c6f6c' USING utf8mb4), '2021-04-03 16:29:34', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4462, 4299, 16, 3, 'One of my favorite go to places for brunch but this visit wasn’t so good. I ordered catfish and was given one piece of catfish and the other piece was Tilapia. I brought it to the waitress attention and she came back to the table telling me it was catfish but it wasn’t. I’m a seafood person so I know my fish.', '2021-01-08 17:54:59', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4463, 4300, 16, 5, 'Small and busy spot with good food that won’t hurt your pocket.', '2021-04-07 02:19:15', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4464, 4301, 16, 3, 'Line was long and it was packed in dining area. We didn''t stay to eat. They don''t take credit cards just cash or check', '2021-03-14 12:53:38', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4465, 4302, 16, 5, 'Fast service, waitress was really nice! Food is delicious will be back when I’m in the area again', '2021-03-05 15:02:04', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4466, 4303, 16, 5, 'My husband and I decided to try this restaurant after hearing rave reviews for years. I must say that we were not disappointed. The menu includes an extensive list of country breakfast items such as fried bologna and eggs, scrapple, corned beef hash and our favorite, fish and grits. They also offer lunch items at anytime if breakfast is not your thing. It’s a must try. But bring cash. They don’t accept cards.', '2020-10-02 15:41:54', NULL
UNION ALL
