UNION ALL
SELECT 4472, 4309, 16, 5, 'Food was great. We had an excellent waitress.', '2021-03-31 06:09:01', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4473, 4310, 16, 2, 'All the food was great a little greasy well very greasy my eggs shine like a Jerry curl and left the juice on the plate like the back of a cloth couch.  Even though the food will put me in a early grave I''ll ne back I did not like the cash only and oh go and use my 2.75 atm fee out front to pay you 60$ meal for that you get a big middle finger this will be the last Time I eat here very upset that was left by a cook and the waitress put her bare hand in ice we drink out of and ate it yes they gave use new ice from front but I see this place may not be the place for me and my family sorry for the truth', '2019-04-21 18:06:23', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4474, 4311, 16, 4, 'Its been a few years since I''ve been, but today it was pretty good and sooo filling. My sister and I did the breakfast combo 1 and 2. French toast was so light and fluffy. The pancakes say small but their small was like my idea of a normal sized pancake lol. Only 2 small complaints I never received a coffee refill and the turkey bacon I had was SUPER Salty. Other than that everything was great!', '2020-09-19 19:27:08', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4475, 4312, 16, 5, 'Great food. Well worth the wait.', '2021-04-04 03:07:27', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4476, 4313, 16, 5, 'The seafood platter was cooked to perfection, tender fish, shrimp and classic. The owners and staff are very friendly and helpful.', '2021-01-22 03:54:50', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4477, 4314, 16, 1, 'We have visited Tommy''s on more than one occasion. Sad to say this morning was the worst experience ever. The eggs and hash browns had no taste. Not even a pinch of salt for the hash browns and to make it even better, the hash browns weren''t even cooked!!!! The name is hash browns, it needs to be browned to had a little crisp. This morning was soggy and distasteful. The biscuits were ok, but the gravy was luke warm maybe by the time I got the order. Just disappointed, maybe the real cook was out sick.', '2020-12-01 23:21:37', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4478, 4315, 16, 5, CONVERT(X'4f6e65206f66206d79206661766f7269746520706c6163657320666f72206272756e63682e0a4920686967686c79207265636f6d6d656e642074686520636f756e74727920667269656420737465616b20616e6420656767732e' USING utf8mb4), '2021-01-02 16:44:08', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4479, 4316, 16, 4, 'The food here is always amazing!  Especially the fish and grits. The free toast is even cooked well!Sometimes there is a line but it moves fairly quickly. The only complaint I have is that they only take cash and the waitress did not inform us until we had finished eating and it was time to pay. They do have an ATM but it has a high service charge. What if all I had was a CREDIT card!?', '2020-08-02 04:00:09', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4480, 4317, 16, 5, 'First time dining and I enjoyed both the food and the fast-friendly service😁', '2019-06-18 17:43:32', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4481, 4318, 16, 5, 'Americana diner-style food at its finest! Great service, great classic American Breakfast food, and a warm homey atmosphere to top it off. We had the Pecan Waffles, Biscuits and Gravy meal and two extra sausage links. It was all exactly what we were looking for on a Saturday morning! It is CASH ONLY!!!', '2019-10-26 14:49:23', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4482, 4319, 16, 4, 'Awesome, you best bet is to get there early because the line stretches into the Parking lot. however it''s well worth the wait.', '2018-11-07 07:44:44', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4483, 4320, 16, 4, 'Big portions of great diner food!', '2021-04-16 01:40:57', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4484, 4321, 16, 5, 'The food is absolutely AMAZING! The Credle Crew definitely approves! Unfortunately I forgot to take photos PRIOR to eating but here are our to go containers (which you will need because the portions are generous). We had the catfish with grits, eggs, hushpuppies and a Belgian waffle and the sweet cream waffle with peaches, eggs, bacon, and deep fried potatoes. Delicious!', '2018-10-04 16:26:19', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4485, 4322, 16, 4, 'I don''t know what happened but the hash browns tasted like glue and the coffee tasted like they reused the grounds; taste like colored hot water. The waitress was great though.', '2020-10-16 22:57:54', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4486, 4323, 16, 5, 'Just love Tommy''s - the staff are always so friendly and keep your cups filled. The food is fresh and fast and very tasty. My fave is the Tommy''s breakfast combo - it''s a great price and so much FOOD!', '2020-01-10 22:09:34', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4487, 4324, 16, 5, 'Enjoy this place were really great breakfast', '2021-03-26 20:24:16', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4488, 4325, 16, 5, 'A great generally inexpensive mom and pop style diner. Definitely one of my favorites!', '2021-02-03 02:46:21', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4489, 4326, 16, 1, 'Got an seat immediately. Only to get our order taken and not receive our food. Several ppl came in after us and they received their order but the waitress just kept walking by looking at us. They tried to blame it on the kitchen but the kitchen was obviously doing their job because the other customer''s was receiving their food. The waitress for some reason did not put our ticket in and we ordered the most simple food on the menu, smh. Ignored for at least 45-60 minute''s before we adrressed the issue and left.  Horrible service and the place is not even as packed because of Covid-19. HORRIBLE SERVICE FOR SURE', '2020-12-31 14:35:48', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4490, 4327, 16, 5, 'SEAFOOD BREAKFAST.... AMAZING HOSPITALITY.. THEY MADE ME FEEL LIKE I WAS AT HOME. CATFISH. HASH BROWNS.  SCRAMBLED EGGS WITH CHEESE. TOAST. SWEET TEA.', '2019-09-22 16:15:33', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4491, 4328, 16, 5, 'Great atmosphere and home cooked food.', '2021-03-28 02:24:35', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4492, 4329, 16, 5, 'I''ve been a patron of Tommy''s Restaurant since 1985.  They are very clean, health conscious & the friendliest staff around.  Great service, fast, excellent cooks, & versatile, delicious menus!!  One of Virginia''s finest!!', '2020-09-29 14:22:07', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4493, 4330, 16, 5, 'When you are in the Hampton Roads area of southern Virginia , visiting Tommys restaurant is a must . When you arrive hungry , you will not leave hungry . Thier policy must be to give a lot of food . Regardless of what you order from the extensive menu , you will get large portions . I''m sure many people realize the quantity and quality of the food because the restaurant is always full . The line is normally long but when you think about the great food you will have , the wait is worth it all the time . The friendly and fast service always enhance an enjoyable meal . Your meal in Tommys is paid in cash only .', '2020-11-25 15:07:50', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4494, 4331, 16, 5, 'Always a favorite when the family is in town. The food is plentiful and delicious.', '2021-01-05 14:05:24', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 4495, 4332, 16, 4, 'Love going to Tommy''s! Tried lunch instead of breakfast for the first time last weekend and was not disappointed. 4 stars because of the 20 minute wait when they had open tables. Besides that, the food was fresh, fast, and cheap.', '2017-08-14 23:01:51', NULL
