SELECT 4509, 4346, 16, 5, '2017-07-01 When we arrived, parking lot seemed full, cars parked on both sides of the building, there was a short line outside the building, we were told to wait  in line, the line moved quick and we stood in line for 10 minutes or less, lady waitress took our order was honest about orange juice that tasted sour, I ordered the apple juice and it tasted good, small apple juice was all I needed, waitress brought the wheat toast (with butter on top) first and it tasted so good, did not even need jelly on the toast, we waited 10 minutes or less to get the bread;  I got my breakfast, first and then my wife got her food a few minutes later. We had a very good lasting first experience and want to come again some time.', '2017-07-01 15:27:12', NULL
