SELECT 4519, 4356, 16, 5, 'Food here was suppppper yummy! I would highly recommend the catfish! The shortcakes are two huge pancakes and I also loved the French toast! The line was super long but it went fast and the food was definitely worth it. The parking lot is kind packed too but to me the food was so good i definitely back here. Also the wait staff ia so kind, we had Ms. Karen and she was the sweetest!', '2018-08-19 16:54:39', NULL
