SELECT 4523, 4360, 16, 1, 'Covid-19 time-frame review.  Went in this morning to have breakfast with my daughter.  Was seated as close to the doorway as we could be and within 3 feet of other people eating.  I looked to the front side of the restaurant and saw empty tables.  I asked the host, who i believe is the owner because i have seen her there many time over the years i have been going here, if we could move to one of the other tables and was told "no".  No reasoning for it, just "no".  I also had a problem with her few years ago.  She checks people out at the register.  I asked for change for the $5 she game me back to pay someone i was with the $2 i owed him.  She said "Stop being cheap and tip the whole $5".  I had already left the tip on the table and its none of her business anyway.  It is a shame, waitresses and bust boys work hard here.  Management is the problem and reason I will not return.', '2020-07-23 00:00:12', NULL
UNION ALL
