SELECT 6302, 6070, 13, 1, 'So I ordered 20 minutes before they closed (unknowingly at 9, earlier than their posted time) from their website, website took the order and I receive confirmation emails and my card is charged. I drive past to make sure they didn''t close early, they were open with no signs on the doors except regular hours and customers were at a table. Waited 20 minutes and walk back to the store and all the lights are off. Call them and I was told that it''s fourth of July and they closed early. I said why wasn''t there any notification on the website or door. She said well people usually call first. Why wouldn''t you post it on the door. She said that she closed online and cancelled the order, it''s 40 minutes later and still haven''t received an email or call that my order was cancelled.', '2020-07-05 01:19:17', NULL
UNION ALL
