SELECT 6897, 6646, 12, 1, 'I ordered this Philips 4K TV for my brother in law on Black Friday 2018 but did not receive it until the middle of December. There was a miscommunication with my brother in law so the driver, not understanding him, took the TV back to Richmond where it sat for weeks. I called BJ''s, the carrier and NO ONE would help me get the TV delivered. No one would even tell me where it was! BJ''s REFUSED to contact CEVA Logistics to get the TV delivered. I had to spend countless hours on the phone with the carrier and boy their hold times are measured in hours not minutes!! Finally CEVA Logistics gave me the number for Richmond (why couldn''t this be done sooner?) and I was able to arrange delivery for late that week. After all this time my brother in law decided he did not want the TV and bought one from Walmart. I was stuck with the TV and decided I would keep it instead of returning it. I set it up and it worked for less than 15 minutes!!! I turned it on and after 10-15 minutes the picture began to fade from vibrant 4K to a dull unwatchable picture and would flicker from bright to dull. In the end I had to re-pack it and bring it to my local BJ''s. In the short time I had it I did like the apps and the availability. But, navigating the TV was cumbersome. Nothing easy or intuitive. It was a pain to use, but had it worked I would have kept it. All in all a VERY nerve wracking experience with BJ''s and their terrible customer service people. Delivery was a nightmare and even though I will NEVER order anything from BJ''s online again: IF I were to I''d have the items shipped to the store because home delivery is not something you want to deal with.', '2019-01-02 19:22:44', NULL
UNION ALL
