SELECT 7084, 6799, 14, 5, 'Met a friend for coffee and a breakfast sandwich at Lake Anne Coffee House. I had a latte with almond milk and a bacon egg and cheese croissant - both were excellent. It was a little chilly and wet outside and the waiter made sure to take care of us by turning on the outdoor heater. Can’t wait to come back.', '2021-05-09 14:33:27', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7085, 6800, 14, 5, 'I love this place. The homemade jam, homemade ketchup, local coffee and overall local connection make this place a keeper. Excellent coffee which is hard to find in Reston. Avocado toast is amazing, great presentation, friendly staff, clean and simple bistro. Excellent prices!', '2021-04-20 03:14:44', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7086, 6801, 14, 5, 'Staff was great and clearly kept busy! The iced latte and lemon ricotta muffin were to die for. Would absolutely come back to try other items another time! They seemed a little low on selection at 10:30 am but I’m sure a little earlier would’ve let me try more flavors of items!', '2021-04-18 01:45:33', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7087, 6802, 14, 5, 'Lovely little place for coffee and brunch.  I am enjoying a croquet madam.', '2021-04-11 14:38:26', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7088, 6803, 14, 5, 'We walked down and sat outside, where there was appreciable social distancing and good safety protocols. With that aside, the coffee and food was great! We each loved the dish we got (a mix of brunch and lunch items) and their cute patio has good views of the lake and the plaza.', '2021-01-12 05:24:30', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7089, 6804, 14, 5, 'I don''t know how their coffee is, but their London Fog is top notch. Food is usually pretty good to great too. Cool community hub, great location.', '2021-02-26 18:11:52', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7090, 6805, 14, 5, 'One of the best cappuccinos I’ve had in NOVA! Coffee flavor came through strong and full bodied. Will be returning soon! :)', '2021-01-17 20:51:51', NULL
UNION ALL
