SELECT 7110, 6823, 14, 5, 'Decent selection of wines by the glass, and a nice assortment of food choices as well. We really enjoy sitting outside and listening to the musicians while enjoying a glass or 3. The coffee is quite good, too! Another Lake Anne Plaza gem.', '2019-07-16 15:39:03', NULL
