SELECT 7129, 6842, 14, 4, 'Good food everytime I have been.  Service is average at best every visit.    Took a star away for it', '2019-06-13 14:45:33', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7130, 6843, 14, 4, 'i''m glad to see this coffee house is finally busy- at least on the weekends when i''ve stopped in. the coffee is a little overpriced and they have trouble managing the busy crowd/line, but the second floor is a much needed addition, and the food is good. it''s nice to be able to properly hang out in the lake anne shopping center.', '2019-07-13 14:53:54', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7131, 6844, 14, 2, 'It’s an alright place. We’ve been there a few times and the staff has been somewhat standoffish. Our last time there the server got our order wrong two times in a row. We left dissatisfied. It will be our last time going there:/', '2019-03-28 18:49:08', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7132, 6845, 14, 5, 'Yummy brunch and good mimosas. Outdoor seating is nice.', '2019-07-07 15:50:40', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7133, 6846, 14, 5, 'Really nice place to hang out with friends and family and get a cup of coffee', '2019-06-26 01:45:32', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7134, 6847, 14, 4, 'I came here for good coffee and wasn''t disappointed. The counter area is a little tight but there is plenty of indoor and outdoor seating once you get your drink or food.', '2018-12-30 14:36:34', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7135, 6848, 14, 3, 'I I had the duck tacos 3 average size tacos for $16. It was a duck compote with fresh corn tacos that were average nothing special. Decent wine list 8 to $12 for a glass. This was at 9 p.m. I believe they do most of their business as a coffee shop earlier in the day. It deserves perhaps a 3.5 star if they garnish the tacos with arugula or mesclun mix. Service was slow on this night', '2017-08-27 13:58:31', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7136, 6849, 14, 4, 'Food was good but pricy. Good wine selection and friendly service.', '2019-06-03 02:10:43', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7137, 6850, 14, 4, 'The coffee is not extraordinary, but it does the job perfectly. I usually go here during evening time, to have cup of coffee and enjoy the lake side views.', '2019-02-11 20:58:08', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7138, 6851, 14, 2, 'Had a weird experience.. Came around 8:30pm on a Saturday (they''re open until 10). Sat alone in the upstairs second floor to do some work. Around 9:30pm a guy who worked there comes up to the bar area and is clearly agitated, swearing about it being late and how someone should go home. Couldn''t make out exactly what he was saying, so I wasn''t sure if it was directed at me? Regardless I left, definitely made me feel uncomfortable. Probably won''t come back', '2018-10-07 02:07:29', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7139, 6852, 14, 5, 'Sublime croques madame, lovely setting and staff.', '2019-11-11 15:14:35', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7140, 6853, 14, 5, 'Breakfast and coffee review only: Great breakfast and fast friendly coffee service.', '2019-05-29 11:46:36', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7141, 6854, 14, 4, 'Their coffee is a massive improvement over the previous place. Finally a place to get a good cup of coffee that isn''t starbucks. They have done a great job renovating the place to make it a place you could hang out for hours. The upstairs fireplace and lounge is a nice touch if you are looking for a quiet place to do some reading or get a little work done.', '2016-11-25 18:37:42', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7142, 6855, 14, 5, 'Great cozy place..  even can enjoy live music.. it was awesome !!', '2018-11-19 02:17:49', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7143, 6856, 14, 5, 'Delicious coffees and pastries- oh my! Love this local coffee shop that pulls a fantastic espresso.', '2018-10-08 14:51:33', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7144, 6857, 14, 4, 'It''s located in a very nice shopping center with a medium sized pond, waterfall. And the Reston community center is next to it. It''s a nice place to grab coffee at sit by the pond enjoy a really nice view', '2018-08-20 21:51:03', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7145, 6858, 14, 5, 'Coffee and food is delicious, the service is wonderful, and the ambiance is perfect. Lake Anne coffee house and wine bar is my new favorite date night.', '2018-08-19 00:39:28', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7146, 6859, 14, 4, 'Cappuccino and latte were better than Starbucks, for my taste. I didn''t try the pastries, but it looked like a nice selection. Clean, modern decor and a great patio. I will definitely be back!', '2016-12-18 19:24:11', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7147, 6860, 14, 5, 'So nice sitting in the garden with a decent latte.!', '2019-08-25 03:06:33', NULL
