SELECT 7303, 7008, 9, 5, 'This is one of the best German pastry and sweets shop for the DC region. Parking is extremely limited. Weekends have a takeaway option for hot brats, wersts, potato salad, etc. And pretzels :)', '2021-05-01 20:51:02', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7304, 7009, 9, 5, 'If you are looking for great breads, pastries, cakes, and deli meats with the touch of old Europe, this is the place to go. The Black Forest cake is fantastic. Those in the Arlington/Ballston area know the place. If they don''t, shame on them. Original owners from Germany, hence the name. Yes, the prices are high but it is totally worth it.', '2021-04-10 16:32:11', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7305, 7010, 9, 5, 'Three cheers for this newfound gem! After hearing about it from friends, we went on Valentines Day for some sweet treats, and we were not disappointed! Delicious pastries, a huge variety, and savory selections that we''ll try next visit. Nice staff, clean store, helpful additional parking...all around great!', '2021-02-14 18:14:15', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7306, 7011, 9, 5, 'I have never got a bakery item here that i did not like. Pastries Cookies Breads Bagels. You can''t go wrong here.', '2021-04-17 06:20:11', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7307, 7012, 9, 5, 'It''s the go to bakery in northern VA. They also do German deli meats and sausages. Absolutely amazing.', '2021-05-02 16:14:25', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7308, 7013, 9, 5, 'Delicious little bakery! I used to live very near Heidelberg for several years and walking in here felt like I was back. The leberkase sandwich was delicious and the worker was very helpful!', '2021-02-21 03:03:33', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7309, 7014, 9, 3, CONVERT(X'' USING utf8mb4), '2021-04-04 06:07:59', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7310, 7015, 9, 5, 'A very clean and professional place with great pastries and bread I recommend going there you won''t be disappointed', '2021-04-05 01:24:47', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7311, 7016, 9, 5, 'The almond macaroons were so chewy and sweet!! I bought a box of Christmas cookies with frosting and sprinkles and they taste so sweet!! I highly recommend for a quick bite to eat, if you’re craving for an authentic German dessert, when visiting Arlington!! Like with all places I’ve been to, the staff are very friendly and always willing to help!!!!!', '2020-12-23 23:17:17', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7312, 7017, 9, 5, 'We visit almost weekly, great service, great product.  We have never had anything bad there, all has been delicious. Highly recommend.', '2021-02-06 22:54:10', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7313, 7018, 9, 5, CONVERT(X'' USING utf8mb4), '2016-08-14 22:44:07', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7314, 7019, 9, 5, 'Excellent brats and hot German potato salad outside. Delicious pastries inside...almond sweet pretzels, cherry strudel, lemon poppy pound cake, pretzels and more. Also Kuhne sweet Bavarian style mustard and traditional German mustard! Shopped inside first and then bought our grilled lunch to go! ♡♡♡', '2020-07-04 16:53:24', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7315, 7020, 9, 5, CONVERT(X'' USING utf8mb4), '2020-12-12 17:13:05', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7316, 7021, 9, 5, 'One of our favorite bakeries in all of DC! Going to Heidelberg is an experience. On weekends (pre-Covid), there will sometimes be live music inside. The selection of baked goods is INCREDIBLE and you will have a hard time choosing! We have tried breads, donuts, muffins, danishes, croissants, and more - everything is always amazing! Staff is SO friendly and fun, very attentive and quick service, too! If you haven''t already visited Heidelberg, I highly recommend it!!!', '2020-12-15 17:10:05', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7317, 7022, 9, 5, 'Loved this place. Everything is baked fresh and in house. Prices are reasonable and they have a wide variety. My friends German and she said this is as authentic as it gets. I tried the bread and pretzel and they were both delicious', '2018-06-04 01:08:04', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7318, 7023, 9, 5, 'Ordered 4 King Cakes for fat Tuesday for our Retiment community mardi gras celebration. By the time I arrived at the celebration, the king cakes had been devoured and they were all anyone could talk about. Thank you for helping to create a sweet spot for our seniors!', '2021-02-17 00:37:19', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7319, 7024, 9, 5, 'Delicious and way too many yummy choices!', '2021-04-09 23:13:21', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7320, 7025, 9, 5, 'Amazing selection of European baked goods. Also great bratwurst, plus brauenwurst and knackwurst. They had a special selection of Irish items the weekend of St. Patrick’s day. Plus they give out samples on Saturdays! Not a lot of table space to sit and enjoy a pastry and a coffee, but it depends on whether you’re coming at peak times. Everything is reasonably priced too. $6.95 for a whole Irish soda bread. $6 for a bratwurst. $18.95 for a giant rainbow cake. Totally worth it.', '2019-03-16 16:47:33', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7321, 7026, 9, 5, 'Been coming here since I was a little kid, so about 30 years now. Absolutely, hands down the best bakery in the area. Everything from delicious homemade bread to pastries and donuts to some deli meats and fixins, this place has it all. Can’t believe it’s taken me this long to give them their 5 stars', '2020-10-02 14:14:53', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7322, 7027, 9, 5, 'An amazing German bakery and deli with a high assortment of pastries, cookies, and breads. Many items are as affordable as a grocery store, but far better. The whole grain rye bread is awesome', '2020-11-05 11:51:56', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7323, 3187, 9, 5, 'I was very pleased that my order, phoned in earlier in the week, was carefully boxed up and waiting for me.  Despite being very busy, everyone I had contact with was cheerful and helpful.  Of course, the pastries are top notch, as I have come to expect over my over 40 years of patronage.', '2020-10-26 18:12:37', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7324, 7028, 9, 5, 'They really hit it out with their pies.  Ask the staff what their favorite picks are as some of the off the beaten track stuff is the best.', '2021-04-17 16:39:34', NULL
UNION ALL
