SELECT 7362, 7062, 9, 5, 'I love this place 😍. I ordered a sandwich on a bagel, it was really delicious and bagel is soft and tasty. Over all love love love it. 10 stars for me. And also you can find more different kind of yummy and delicious treats😍😍😍. Will definitely coming here every day!!!', '2020-01-10 13:25:39', NULL
