SELECT 7372, 7071, 9, 5, 'Oooh, the pastry. And bread. Excellent. Ordered specialty bread online and picked it up. Fresh and beautiful.', '2019-11-05 18:00:03', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7373, 7072, 9, 5, 'Love this place! Great bread, pastries and cake. Small selection of German products such as mustard, spaetzle and other specialties. A decent selection of German sausages including my favorite, gelb wurst. Free parking is available and you can even have a cup of coffee there. Recommended!', '2019-10-26 21:31:30', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7374, 7073, 9, 2, 'The quality has gone down. Bought a birthday cake and it was not decorated well at all. So plain, looked nothing like past years or in their website. Was quite disappointed. Still tasted good but after many years of buying their expensive cakes I doubt I''ll buy another one again. A shame.', '2019-10-28 19:01:46', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7375, 1799, 9, 4, 'One of the few places you can get actual bread in Arlington. By that I mean good, dense, dark whole grain bread, that makes you dream of German bakeries run by master bakers who work all night so you can can have real bread in the morning. No, it''s not cheap, but considering that they have to import flour from Germany to get the right texture, you are getting your money''s worth, believe me! Also lots of sweets for sale, but they''re not my thing in general, plus they are fortified with four times the amount of sugar you would get in a pastry in Germany, which makes them shockingly sweet... to the American taste just right, I presume. Buy the bread!', '2018-10-18 17:41:39', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7376, 7074, 9, 5, 'The best petite fours I''ve ever had (even my husband, who hates petite fours, loves these). They take special orders and requests. Their danishes are to die for (stay away from the butter crumb danishes- those are mine!!) and all of the employees are warm and helpful . Not a ton of seating, but we can usually find room. It gets pretty busy (go early if you have your heart set on a particular item!) but there are a lot of people to help you, so you won''t have to wait. Nice deli selection and sandwiches. Small imports market, as well. Great, family-owned business.', '2019-03-31 21:14:39', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7377, 7075, 9, 4, 'Very nice shop with lots of great pastry', '2020-07-23 14:15:27', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7378, 7076, 9, 5, 'Delicious breakfast sandwich, donuts are good, free coffee, fast and helpful service. The various sausage/wurst sandwiches are absolutely wonderful, and the deals they have when the grill is set up in the summer are great.', '2019-11-19 02:54:17', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7379, 7077, 9, 5, 'Just awesome. Every category of baked goods available and fresh. Plenty of room to sit and enjoy a quick bite or some coffee. They have good hours and very attentive and friendly staff. 10/10.', '2019-01-21 14:38:16', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7380, 7078, 9, 5, 'They produce some excellent pastry, but you''re going to pay through the nose. An alternative to this location is the German Store over on Columbia Pike.', '2019-11-23 22:26:16', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7381, 7079, 9, 5, 'This place been our family favorite for years.', '2020-08-15 01:06:48', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7382, 7080, 9, 5, 'Always awesome. Mid week purchased a few things that were 50% off. Great deal for chocolate croissant and coffee cakes. Jelly pastries as well. Just sad they don''t seem to have free coffee anymore. However they have free sample bread and cookies which help the stomach block the view of feet.', '2019-06-03 20:39:22', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7383, 7081, 9, 3, 'It was okay, they had some interesting pastries. I would like to go back and check out the various Meats they had on display as some look like they might be incredibly delicious.', '2019-08-19 09:22:51', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7384, 7082, 9, 5, 'Great little bakery offering traditional German breads and pastries (slightly Americanized) as well as a few common Lebensmittel', '2018-01-13 22:59:51', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7385, 7083, 9, 2, 'I was really excited to visit and try some of the pastries. Unfortunately I was highly disappointed I think the main reason people like this place is because it is not Starbucks or another franchise. I think the items are a bit over priced and don''t have any type of memorable or fresh taste. I purchased a pumpkin pie which did not even taste like pumpkin at all. The bread I ordered was not very fresh and the taste was ok. I feel there are other bakeries in town worthy. This place is just ok for me it is not anything special.', '2019-11-17 11:24:55', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7386, 7084, 9, 5, 'Heidelberg is one of my favorite places, just be warned it''s a small parking lot that gets busy on Saturday/Sunday mornings. And pre-order (and pay) is a near necessity for holidays (unless you can stop by midday on a weekday. Overall the baked goods are excellent, the service friendly and the prices beyond reasonable. Beyond the croissants, bread, apple turnover and strudels the giant pretzel is a must at all our casual gatherings!', '2019-04-21 11:04:08', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7387, 7085, 9, 5, 'Typical German baking good, very delicious 👍', '2020-06-02 15:45:44', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7388, 7086, 9, 5, 'I love this place. I’m a fan of their pies, sausages, bread, and biscuits. Make sure you try their spicy pumpkin dough during Christmas - to die for!! The quality of their cakes are good, just not exceptional. That said, most people I know that shop there love the cakes. Their coffee is also really good.', '2018-05-17 23:27:30', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7389, 7087, 9, 3, 'I tried their pretzels and they were ok but really not much better than one you can get at a grocery store.', '2020-08-13 19:18:44', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7390, 7088, 9, 5, 'breakfast sandwich was magical. service was great!', '2020-01-26 02:17:21', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7391, 7089, 9, 5, 'Came here on a Saturday during their outdoor bratwurst grilling hours and absolutely loved it. I''ll come back again for that. Their backery section inside was quite the selection, but I''m not sure how much of it uses real butter, as compared to substitutes. Overall super good experience though. ☺️', '2019-05-22 18:10:28', NULL
UNION ALL
