SELECT 7411, 1821, 9, 4, 'It''s a good bakery with a nice selection of quality baked goods; breads, pastries, donuts, German sausages and a few sides.  On the weekends during the summer they offer various German sausages on rolls.  The prices are a little higher than other stores, but the quality justifies the price for me.  The place can get quite busy and parking is limited, so just be aware.', '2018-07-12 00:49:16', NULL
