UNION ALL
SELECT 7420, 7114, 9, 5, 'Always good to be here. They have an extensive assortment of pastries and they even have wursts and salami. They didn''t grill on the patio today because of the rain, but did grill inside. The wurst roll came with a free piece of cake and besides this they even had a free cookie for my toddler.', '2018-09-01 17:10:37', NULL
UNION ALL
