SELECT 7508, 7195, 9, 3, 'Very disappointing experience. When we first walked in we immediately noticed the huge selection of not just bakery items but also a little deli meat section as well as some German groceries which we were pleasantly surprised by. A minute after walking around the store a lady walking around the store asked if we were ready and we told her we were still looking. It''s a big selection and store so it takes a minute to see everything and figure out what you want. Not a minute afterwards she asked loudly "are you ready yet" . We told her that we were going to order once we were ready to order which took us another minute. grabbed some Bienenstich, Some Napoleons, Some Sacher Torte And some sweet pretzels. The pretzels were good, the cakes seemed to be days old, kept refrigerated. The Bienenstich absolutely not edible, hard and stale. I am from Germany and know what this stuff can taste like, even these would be way better and pretty authentic, but sadly you get days old cakes that are dried out, which such a huge store and selection I guess they can''t make everything g fresh daily. Expectations ruined we won''t be back.', '2017-02-03 18:35:27', NULL
UNION ALL
