SELECT 7859, 1220, 53, 5, 'My first visit was somewhat disappointing but I have to say, this place grew on me. Everyone''s down to earth. Their prices are very reasonable and the bar staff is outstanding.  Food prices are good too and I have to admit, the food''s pretty damn good.  I only wish they kept the kitchen open a little later on Football nights.', '2019-10-09 18:22:17', NULL
