UNION ALL
SELECT 7864, 7527, 53, 4, 'Great place to just chill', '2020-09-20 17:19:59', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7865, 7528, 53, 1, 'This place is really close to home so I have visited a handful of times. I thought it would be a nice friendly neighborhood bar that I could make a habit of. But, I get the same lukewarm reception from the wait staff EVERY time I go. I feel invisible. It seems to me like they love their regulars but don''t care about growing new business.( Last night I had every one behind the bar (every female bar tender)see me standing there, look me in the eye, and keep on going.  Both when I tried to order and when trying to leave. Didn''t acknowledge me at all. The male bartender was much more receptive. He had no problem talking to or waiting on me. ) They do not seem friendly in the least and only seem to FINALLY wait on me when they have to. If I sit at a table, my table never gets the service that the ones around me do. They walked right by me last night and didn''t even look or ask.  I did finally get an ashtray, however. I tip at least 1.00 per drink. I say please and thank you. I smile. I don''t get it. I guess you''re "in" if you are a man or a regular. Sux to be you if you''re neither one. I used to bar tend, so I know how its SUPPOSED to be. Although Bubbas is literally 2 minutes from my house, I will drive right  by to go someplace else and only stop in here if no place else is open or I''m desperate .', '2019-09-07 09:34:52', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7866, 413, 53, 5, 'You will always feel pretty there...great drinks', '2020-01-12 02:38:14', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 7867, 7529, 53, 4, 'It was a very pleasant surprise, the food and service was above par, Kristi and Debbie made sure I was fed properly and I will be returning.  I''ve been working in the area the past 3 weeks and this was by far the best meal I''ve had (ribeye with green beans and mac salad and fried scrimps)...if u don''t mind the smoke it''s well worth it 🖒🖒🖒', '2019-06-06 03:15:34', NULL
UNION ALL
