UNION ALL
SELECT 7872, 7533, 53, 3, 'Staff was friendly. Our bartender was new so didnt know how to make the first 3 drinks we ordered, I can kind of understand that. Irish Car Bomb, Dirty Martini, Cherry Bomb, not to mention they didn''t have the ingredients for them. What bar doesn''t have Reda Bull these days! We went a lil bit b4 they closing on a Monday, so they were very slow. No entertainment on that specific night but I have seen signs for karaoke closer to the weekends. There was a pool table where a few people were shooting pool. A dining area next to the bar, a dance floor area & decent size stage. We didn''t order any food so I can''t speak to that.', '2019-07-21 22:12:12', NULL
UNION ALL
