SELECT 8052, 7676, 46, 5, 'Probably the best subway close to Salem. Fresh bread daily. The staff is very friendly and food is great. Standard subway prices. This subway is attached to a local had station. Parking is somewhat tough here since the place is popular and the parking lot isn''t designed well. There is seating inside for groups of about 4. If you''re on 81 and need a quick stop for food and fuel this is the place.', '2016-11-22 15:59:33', NULL
