SELECT 8106, 7729, 5, 5, 'Love the ambience- quiet and calm. Good spot for romantic dining. The menu is little confusing. We had 4-5 chicken and pork dishes and everything was good. Their persimmon juice was  good too.  I don’t know the names of the dishes they put there. Over all I recommend this place. Our waitress was wonderful 🙂.', '2021-02-21 01:26:49', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8107, 7730, 5, 5, 'Great food, great service! The flavors were so amazing, I knew there must be real Brazilians in the kitchen. I was right! This husband wife team are the owners and the wife came to our table to personally welcome us. Nice experience.', '2021-03-20 00:46:48', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8108, 7731, 5, 5, 'The croc pot definitely hit the spot - it''s light and tasty too! Also their Forte dipping sauce is fantastic. Apart from that, the service and ambience of the place was very good.', '2019-02-15 15:53:33', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8109, 3964, 5, 5, 'Great quality option for Brazilian steaks.  Done authentically', '2021-03-02 17:38:58', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8110, 7732, 5, 5, 'Good choice for meat lover. Just try', '2019-08-10 14:33:44', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8111, 7733, 5, 5, 'Wonderful food! Worth the wait.', '2021-03-14 01:30:04', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8112, 7734, 5, 5, 'I have to say is one of the best restaurant in Blacksburg! DELICIOUS, highly recommended! 👌', '2020-09-20 04:43:27', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8113, 7735, 5, 5, 'Feast for a king!! Literally!! Everything was great, not sure what im going to pick next time!! 😎', '2020-10-17 23:35:56', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8114, 7736, 5, 4, CONVERT(X'' USING utf8mb4), '2017-12-14 05:50:11', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8115, 7737, 5, 3, 'The menu was a little confusing at first. the first time I ordered a steak and it was great! The second time I ordered a steak sandwich and it was very greasy, to the point the bread turned into a gooey dough. The employees are very friendly and polite.', '2020-07-27 02:14:21', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8116, 7738, 5, 5, 'Delicious food and friendly, we really enjoyed ourselves.', '2020-12-07 14:28:37', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8117, 7739, 5, 5, 'Awesome food, beer, and service. Absolutely loved this place and will definitely be back!', '2020-09-05 23:13:26', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8118, 7740, 5, 5, 'Their atmosphere is special! Great for gatherings with parents, colleagues from work, and  friends. They have open space for grilling, so you can see how they grill steaks. If you have a bigger group more than 4, I recommend you to make an reservation. Names of food are exotic, so I cannot remember my steak, but I loved mine!!', '2019-08-21 14:02:42', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8119, 7741, 5, 3, 'We went there just before holiday. The food quality was very average if I consider the price we paid. One of my friends ordered medium steak. The inside of the steak was not properly cooked. They changed the meal,  still,  the steak was not up to the mark. I believe that this may be a spurious incident and hopefully we would have better experience next time.', '2020-02-05 13:25:58', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8120, 7742, 5, 5, 'We really enjoyed this quaint and interesting restaurant! The food was fantastic and the service was awesome. If you want to try something a little different, this is the place to go! We met the owner also, who was very personable!', '2019-08-23 21:45:23', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8121, 7743, 5, 4, 'Portions are decent for the cost. Flavorful food and a nice atmosphere. Good for a family. Staff are friendly too, the cook was quite excited and gracious for our business. I''d certainly go again, food seemed healthy too.', '2019-05-18 17:15:07', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8122, 7744, 5, 5, 'Words are not able to describe how delicious the food is at this establishment.  We all finished our food and then ordered more food to go after our meal because it was so good.  If you eat here and don''t like the food, then you should just keep eating the big mac''s you love so much, and feel free to sterilize your sexual organs, so you can''t reproduce!', '2019-08-22 04:33:22', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8123, 7745, 5, 4, 'The food was excellent. We had the fried plantains, Brie, and Sirloin. The only thing keeping me from giving a 5-star rating was that our server sat down to eat while we were still dining. We had to waive her a couple of times to get our check.', '2019-09-01 17:30:43', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8124, 7746, 5, 5, 'The meat is cooked perfectly, the chimichurri rice  is the best I''ve ever had, and the grilled sides taste smokey and, well, grilled, not just a grill pan like most restaurants. Service is impressively fast too, considering the variety of food it''s possible to order in one meal. This isn''t fast food, and I haven''t been during the lunch rush, but based on what I''ve seen, it might be possible to stop by for lunch break if you work nearby and don''t have anything else to do during it.', '2019-05-11 21:32:19', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8125, 7747, 5, 5, 'You just really can''t find a better place to eat. The food is cooked to perfection each and everytime I go. Tasty drinks, ice cold beer, great service. I wish I had one by my home. Awesome atmosphere 😍', '2018-12-13 20:49:49', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8126, 7748, 5, 5, 'Had for a birthday dinner. I wish I had more stomachs for all the delicious food.', '2019-09-14 18:07:30', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8127, 7749, 5, 5, 'The food was phenomenal! Many options to choose from. We ate an appetizer,  meal, and dessert and everything was delicious.  The service was a little lacking. We sat with emptt drink cups but the place was packed.  It was VERY clean.', '2019-03-02 14:08:26', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8128, 7750, 5, 5, 'Delicious Brazilian food and drinks.  Sirloin,  grilled pineapple,  and plantains.  Everyone enjoyed their meal.', '2019-07-24 01:00:06', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8129, 7751, 5, 5, 'Nice atmosphere, clean, friendly staff. The food was good & the staff was friendly & helpful. Only thing I would have liked better was some Brazilian music playing in the background. It doesn’t have to be every song but at least a couple while we eat.', '2018-10-09 14:55:41', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8130, 7752, 5, 5, 'The food was awesome, great waitstaff too. Virtually everything was gluten free. Even the fried items. One exception was the garlic bread. Clearly my favorite gluten free restaurant in the area!', '2018-10-19 16:10:31', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8131, 7753, 5, 5, 'Hands down, consistently one of the best restaurants I have ever eaten at! We love the food here!', '2019-06-09 20:18:46', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8132, 7754, 5, 4, 'One of the best restaurants in Blacksburg. The food is unique and prepared with care. The service was friendly and quick. If you''re looking for something a bit different this is a good spot. Our 8 year old loves the skewered chicken hearts!', '2017-03-28 13:06:19', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8133, 7755, 5, 5, 'The steak tour was absolutely divine. Some of the best food I''ve had. Absolutely recommend', '2019-03-09 21:15:12', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8134, 7756, 5, 4, 'One of our favourite places to eat.  Great food. Would be five stars if the service wouldn''t have been a little slow a couple times.', '2018-05-08 14:36:36', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8135, 7757, 5, 5, 'Super favorful and delicious food with friendly staff! Highly recommended!', '2019-05-29 22:49:43', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8136, 7758, 5, 5, CONVERT(X'' USING utf8mb4), '2019-04-28 00:36:41', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8137, 7759, 5, 5, 'Its authentic....the flavors are incredible! But dont tell anyone bc I dont want it to be busy next time I''m in town!!', '2019-08-22 23:14:10', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8138, 7760, 5, 5, 'Gaucho BrZillian  is it truly unique dining experience. Take the advice of your waiter and be adventurous. It''s worth it.', '2019-02-10 18:16:34', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8139, 7761, 5, 5, 'Great food. Great atmosphere. Great service.  Definitely NOT a chain ...as that was my one requirement to get my new Hokie to explore Blacksburg. LOVED it. We''ll all be back!', '2018-07-12 01:31:04', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8140, 7762, 5, 5, 'Our first visit...Very tender & delicious steak, great atmosphere and good service!', '2019-05-12 00:15:38', NULL
UNION ALL
