SELECT 8254, 7870, 19, 5, 'We only went for the milkshakes, which was delicious. Friendly service. Dine in available. Social distancing enforced.', '2021-04-05 17:32:33', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8255, 7871, 19, 4, 'My first visit to a Freddy''s, ever. Had a steak burger, hot dog, and some frozen custard...all very good. The burger really tasted like steak! It is counter service, and they could use some hand held menus instead of just the overhead ones. Employees are very nice and friendly.', '2021-04-27 12:19:54', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8256, 7872, 19, 5, 'Wichita''s finest made it to Fairfax. You have to try Freddy''s their Steakburgers & custard are great, but the fries are my fave. If you like a good simple burger & fries, this is a spot you definitely want to try.', '2021-04-21 16:55:41', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8257, 7873, 19, 5, 'We absolutely love coming to Freddy''s! The service is AMAZING, the food is extremely delicious and satisfying. I had all my teeth pulled and Freddy''s is the only place I can eat out with out having to cut everything in extremely tiny pieces. In fact I don''t have to cut it up at all due to the chicken being so tender and perfectly cooked. I love the fries so much as they remind me of the good times in highschool. I can''t say enough about Freddy''s INCREDIBLE service, food, and atmosphere!!!!!', '2021-03-06 15:22:50', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8258, 6151, 19, 3, CONVERT(X'5365656d656420746f20666f6c6c6f772070726f746f636f6c2e0a48616420746865204f726967696e616c2042757267657220616e642043686920486f7420446f6720616e6420486177616969616e2053756e6461792e0a5468652053756e646179207761732067726561742c20686f74646f6720676f6f642c2062757267657220666169722e' USING utf8mb4), '2021-04-20 23:36:53', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8259, 7237, 19, 5, 'First trip here, got a california style double burger and turtle concrete. Very good and I look forward to eating here again.', '2021-05-02 20:39:12', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8260, 7874, 19, 5, 'This place is great!! If you have some time to spare I highly recommend', '2021-04-22 20:00:01', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8261, 7875, 19, 5, 'The burgers are great not better than five guys but  still tastes great', '2021-04-26 01:42:02', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8262, 7876, 19, 4, 'They have a good variety of food and they don''t cook it until you''re in line, so it''s always hot. The chili cheese dogs to go are very sloppy, recommend asking for a knife and fork. This is one of the only places in the area you can get cheese fries. Sometimes there are too many toppings or too much ice but I don''t think that''s a complaint.', '2021-03-07 16:35:30', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8263, 7877, 19, 5, 'Freddy has a tasty burger. Topping selection and customization is awesome.  They offer a lettuce wrap burger great for keto diet.', '2021-04-06 12:14:43', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8264, 7878, 19, 5, 'It was my first time and the burgers are really good the beef they use is different and it taste really good. The ice cream 🍨 hits the spot at the end.', '2021-04-14 03:54:35', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8265, 7879, 19, 5, 'The burgers at Freddy’s are so good and flavorful that me personally I feel they are better than Five Guys or shake shack. You can order as many patties as you want and compliment them with fries or even better the fried cheese curds. Their custard desserts are creamy and delicious and they also sell cakes and pies made with their recipes. The place has a vintage diner feel which is very cool. Definitely a great place to take the family.', '2019-05-14 16:29:17', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8266, 7880, 19, 4, 'Good Deserts, havent tried the other food.  Drive Thru needs to pick up like Fast.  Noticed from my going to one when I lived in Texas that they seem to be standing around more.  My dessert should not be trying to melt when I get it.  Besides that not.  Good Concretes, just load up on toppings.', '2021-02-28 02:22:30', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8267, 7881, 19, 5, 'Very delicious burgers and fries! Wish the portions were a little bigger. I was still hungry after eating the double bacon cheese burger with fries. Definitely going back for more!', '2021-01-10 23:40:28', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8268, 7882, 19, 5, 'This is my second time here food was great and love their milkshakes', '2021-04-25 22:39:24', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8269, 7883, 19, 4, 'The food is so go, the custard is to die for, and the service is surprisingly friendly.  They have made a lot of changes to ensure that they and their customers follow COVID protocol. My only suggestion is that they clean their bathrooms a bit more frequently.', '2021-03-09 22:09:34', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8270, 7884, 19, 3, 'It was our first time having food from here and it was very good  mostly but for a semi fast food place it was “way.. too expensive” and if we do come back we will pick select items to get. We have eaten Steak Shack in Florida. Good luck !', '2021-01-07 02:47:58', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8271, 7885, 19, 5, 'Their steak burgers are crispy and juicy at the same time, such a delicious delight! My family really enjoys the shoestring fries as well as their "fry sauce". It''s a can''t miss!', '2021-01-11 23:05:58', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8272, 7886, 19, 4, 'The food here is absolutely 5+ stars, but the price is quite high for a burger joint. I still keep going back, so it must be worth it!', '2021-03-28 19:20:35', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8273, 7887, 19, 5, 'The custard is delicious and the steak burgers are amazing. Definitely will be going back.', '2021-03-28 00:34:12', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8274, 7888, 19, 4, 'I always forget the regular size sundaes are just a bit too large. Decent burger and custard stand. The matchstick fries are super skinny.I appreciate the drive-thru service but be prepared to wait a while', '2021-01-31 02:48:14', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8275, 7889, 19, 5, 'This has become a local favorite of mine! Particularly when I''m feeling like treating myself! The Cali burger is my favorite and I can''t get over how awesome the shoe-string fries and Fry Sauce are!', '2021-02-04 14:06:19', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8276, 7890, 19, 5, 'First of all it is great that they open until late so that you can enjoy late night cravings. Their food and desserts are great. I personally love their sundaes. I tried the one with oreos and gummy worms and it was amazing. Kind of like the dessert hit the spot! Many of the fast food drive through places have very boring dessert choices but here they are fun and worth trying. Try them out and the place is also easy to go in and out even during traffic time! Enjoy =)', '2020-09-08 04:17:13', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8277, 7891, 19, 5, 'Great service and love the food! Where have you been all my life?? Id have pictures but I ate it all too quickly... Maybe next time!', '2021-02-03 19:37:24', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8278, 7892, 19, 5, 'I wish there were more Freddy''s in Northern Virginia! Food is always fresh & hot every time', '2021-03-24 22:49:08', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8279, 7893, 19, 4, 'The ticket was right, but the food came out wrong. They also served us two hot dogs that were cold on the inside. Pretty lame. (UPDATE: 28 Dec 2020) I contacted the management team after they reached out and offered an open door. This is a pretty stand-up operation. I am confident they can do better than they did the last time I visited.', '2020-12-28 17:33:30', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8280, 7894, 19, 5, 'I went with my mother to Freddy''s Frozen Custard and Steakburgers and their custard and burgers were nicer than Dairy Queen. Burgers were fresh.', '2021-02-01 19:24:14', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8281, 7895, 19, 5, 'Pretty good burgers, unique style. Love their Freddy''s sauce. Good for sit down style with group or family.', '2018-02-07 23:56:47', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8282, 7896, 19, 5, 'The burgers are great, love the fries too.', '2021-05-01 12:06:14', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8283, 7897, 19, 5, 'Never heard of it.  Tried it.  Might not be able to forget it!  I think I like the chocolate ice cream the BEST. Nom nom nom', '2021-03-01 23:28:59', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8284, 7898, 19, 5, 'Amazing! Why didn''t I try them sooner? Hot, fresh, delicious burgers. Crisp, perfectly salted fries, and a perfect sundae to finish the meal. My new favorite burger place! Definitely coming back to try more of their menus!', '2020-09-30 22:40:06', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8285, 7899, 19, 4, 'Food is always good as well as service. They are taking precautions for Covid & capacity is only 25 inside. Drive thru is of course open. Looks like a long line but moves pretty quickly.', '2021-01-22 16:08:02', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8286, 7900, 19, 5, 'Spectacular! Great family atmosphere and top notch steak burgers. The custard is delicious too', '2021-01-10 01:39:10', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8287, 7901, 19, 5, CONVERT(X'' USING utf8mb4), '2019-07-31 16:54:01', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8288, 7902, 19, 4, 'Friendly fast service. Very clean facility. Everything was prepared properly and the correct temperature.  I hoped to be impressed by the custard and burgers but TBH, they weren''t any better than cheaper fast food burgers and shakes/ice cream. I won''t take the 20 minute drive to go there but will go again if I''m in the area because of the great customer service and atmosphere.', '2020-08-17 17:24:48', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8289, 7903, 19, 5, 'Best burgers and custard in the area! Staff are friendly as well and the food never disappoints :) I''ve even met Freddy himself when this place first opened and he is the sweetest and most humble man', '2021-01-28 21:07:29', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8290, 7904, 19, 5, 'Took the boys, we all loved the food. Fries especially were on point.  Chopped steak burgers with gooey cheese mixed in also superb.  Custard creamy and delicious. We are already planning on going back!', '2020-09-06 19:29:50', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8291, 7905, 19, 5, 'These burgers are the BEST!!! I LITERALLY drive from Woodbridge lol', '2021-02-16 01:46:17', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8292, 7906, 19, 5, 'This place is good from a food standpoint. However, the last time we were there they were great frkm a service standpoint as well. Thanks employees for serving your customers well!', '2020-11-23 22:53:49', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8293, 7907, 19, 4, 'Affordable. Tasty. Good customer service. Visited on a weekend so this place was packed but the staff still managed to serve the order in a timely manner and with no mistakes. The place is relatively clean. Their chili cheese fries is a must try. Their burgers are great too. Also try their fries sauces.. so good!', '2019-10-16 13:04:47', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8294, 1670, 19, 5, 'Love, love Freddy''s! We drive from Arlington for their yummy burgers - wife loves the veggie burger -- and sweet treats. Be sure to get the app for rewards, but no ordering before 😕.', '2020-09-01 00:54:55', NULL
UNION ALL
