SELECT 8303, 7916, 19, 5, 'Great place with delicious food and friendly staff. We get the burgers and hot dogs, they even have the option of having your burger in a lettuce wrap. A full variety of dessert that they are well known for. Definitely worth a try, they''ll have you going back!', '2020-07-17 22:33:40', NULL
