UNION ALL
SELECT 8311, 7923, 19, 5, 'Freddy''s has great burgers, hot dogs, french fries (get some fry sauce, I like it better than ketchup). The patty melt is my go to here, while my kids like hamburgers, cheeseburgers, and hot dogs. They also have chicken sandwiches.   That said, the entrees are simply a delay to get to the custard-cones, concrete, shakes-all very good. There is quite a bit of indoor seating (busy on weekend nights) and outdoor seating when the weather is good (or if you are immune to the cold). Highly recommend, family friendly (high chairs, booths, tables).', '2020-02-18 03:03:58', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8312, 7924, 19, 3, 'The ice cream in cups are served with a lid, therefore everything gets smashed down and stuck to the lid.', '2021-04-12 01:18:51', NULL
UNION ALL
