SELECT 8354, 7966, 19, 4, 'First time trying this place and we were so glad that we did. Service was great. We came on mother''s day for a latte lunch so it was pretty busy. There was a couple of dirty tables but it was understandable giving the situation. When the staff did have the time the tables were cleaned right away. On to the food.... I got a double with bacon and cheese. It was a good burger! The chili cheese dog I wish I could have gotten it cooked a little more. I don''t like a burnt dog but this should have been cooked a little longer. The chili had great taste and the fries was awesome! We will be back!', '2019-05-15 04:46:40', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8355, 7967, 19, 3, 'I did not like the string style fries. They had a strange fish taste especially considering they dont have fish on the menu. The hamburger was good. Very family friendly place but it was too hectic for me. Kids were running around everywhere.  Too much going on.', '2020-02-06 11:48:54', NULL
