SELECT 8374, 7986, 19, 3, 'Had been going to Freddy''s since it opened. The last 6 months the quality of the food and service has really gone downhill ... and the lack of cleanliness inside is a real problem. Tables and chairs are not wiped clean. Food is swept under the tables for guests to step on -- yuck. Condiment station is always a mess that staff ignores. Menu has been downsized. Food preparers can''t get orders right. Soda machine dispenses weak-tasting drinks. DEFINITELY not returning ... ever.', '2019-10-04 23:07:17', NULL
