UNION ALL
SELECT 8402, 8013, 19, 4, 'I love your food even though, you forgot my onion rings, and you make my ice cream too early and its melted by the time I get to the window and still have to drive home with it. Please don''t make ice cream until the person is at the window and food is almost out. Quality goes down. Other than that, you rock! Just don''t forget my onion rings again!', '2019-05-11 15:54:46', NULL
