SELECT 8421, 8031, 19, 3, 'First off the service is great! Really friendly and pleasant staff. Food wise it''s ok. We got a bacon cheeseburger,cheese curds,chili cheese dog and onion rings..We didn''t try the shakes. Nothing we had was really all that  great.', '2019-03-23 20:39:12', NULL
