SELECT 8426, 8035, 19, 1, 'Hours on the website and the door at the entrance say they close at 10. Went there around 930 to find the lights off and upon entering an employee very happy to tell me they were closed. Passed 3 other potential customers who were looking to get food on my way in/out. We all left to go elsewhere to get something to eat.', '2019-12-30 02:35:35', NULL
