SELECT 8450, 8058, 19, 5, 'Best burgers in Fairfax (to my knowledge). I believe that they do not put the patties on the grill until you order so you always get that hot-off-the-grill experience. Their custard is very good and their employees are very friendly and well trained. I appreciate that they give back to the local community as well.', '2017-11-11 21:18:29', NULL
