UNION ALL
SELECT 8464, 8072, 19, 4, 'Burger and fries were pretty good.  Their Sauces and seasoning are what make this place though. I wasn''t even that hungry and enjoyed my food.  I also got a Worms in Dirt Sunday and thoroughly enjoyed it as well. Though the toppings were a bit limited leaving a big bowl of normal vanilla custard.', '2017-11-15 03:58:24', NULL
