UNION ALL
SELECT 8466, 8074, 19, 5, 'A little pricey but delicious. All the food is good but I go there especially for the frozen custard,  which is hard to find in this area. Custard serving sizes are large. Has a drive through.', '2018-06-20 18:54:01', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8467, 323, 19, 2, 'They forgot to pack all 4 straws and sloppily put together one of the two pattimelts ordered. Also they asked what sauces but only packed two ketchup and two fry sauces for several order of fries.   The one in Fredericksburg is much more preferred and efficient.', '2019-08-04 23:16:45', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8468, 8075, 19, 5, 'They have a great service, great food!! Definitely come back again for some lunch on weekends! They will give you discount if you are military or even ex-military!', '2018-05-25 16:28:47', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8469, 8076, 19, 5, 'Burgers and fries! If I lived closer to this place I''d go more often, but as such, it''s a guilty pleasure for my family.  We go every so often as a special treat and Freddy''s never disappoints.  I love the burgers, love the fries and I love the ice cream!  A great place to bring the family, and the staff is always friendly.', '2018-05-18 04:18:47', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8470, 7091, 19, 5, 'I love this place! The burgers are always fresh. The staff is always super nice and the custard is to die for! Great restaurant, I just wish there was one closer to my house :)', '2018-01-11 19:42:13', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8471, 8077, 19, 5, 'Amazing burgers! Plus they serve custard 😍', '2019-10-31 16:26:46', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8472, 8078, 19, 5, 'First time coming here and I''m sold. Great burger and burger options. Great price. Great people working behind the counter. You literally need nothing else.', '2018-08-05 05:10:31', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8473, 8079, 19, 3, 'Best thing about this place is you can order your dessert (custard) when you order your food but have them delay making the ice cream until you''re done with your meal.  The food is ... ehh.  Salty, greasy burger faire.  Perfect for certain situations,  You could find better, they just won''t  have such awesome desserts.', '2019-05-19 00:21:38', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8474, 8080, 19, 5, 'We loved Freddy''s, always the best steakburgers, wonderful fries, and frozen custard. I have moved from this area so it was great to have the chance to be back near Freddy''s. If you want the best, head to Freud''s, you won''t regret it.', '2019-03-10 17:25:55', NULL
