UNION ALL
SELECT 8477, 8082, 19, 4, 'They did great with the ingredients they had to work with I thought the burgers were going to be a little more filling. the customer was out of this world plus you can get a pup cup for you little buddy if you have one with you. All in all such a great experience I couldn''t imagine anything better from such an affordable eatery.', '2019-02-02 16:32:21', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8478, 8083, 19, 4, 'Tried the steakburger. I wasn''t sure what to expect. It was basically a steak''em on a hamburger bun. The flavor was good but some of it was a little crunchy.  Can''t wait to try the frozen Custard! :-)', '2019-06-14 23:42:38', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8479, 8084, 19, 4, 'Good service, reasonable prices. Personally Im not so sure how much I like steak burgers, they are kind of flat and crunchy on the sides. But the service is quick, the toppings are fresh, and the fries are the extra thin cut kind. Free sauce for the fries. Its a pretty decent place, Ill probably be back in a few montha.', '2019-01-13 13:36:45', NULL
UNION ALL
