SELECT 8485, 8090, 19, 2, 'This was my second visit, and it left me puzzled and disappointed. Ordered a patty melt, and it was lay in the basket poorly assembled or coming apart. Didn''t whoever set it on the counter care? I didn''t pursue it...just ate it with plastic knife and fork. What the hell; I was hungry, but felt dissed. Fries on this occasion way too salty; fountain drink not well-balanced between soda and syrup. And, the custard is expensive. Will give Freddy''s another chance, but for a place that trumpets itself as special, this was a disillusionment. This branch needs new, or better-focused management.', '2018-02-18 23:06:38', NULL
UNION ALL
