SELECT 8502, 8107, 19, 5, 'Freddy''s has the feel of an old fashioned burger and shake shop. It is clean with a nice welcoming atmosphere. The staff are always friendly. The food is prepared when ordered and is usually ready pretty fast. The burger patties are really thin (and a bit salty), but very tasty. The fries are also very thin and very good, like shoestring potatoes. I still haven''t tried the frozen custard, but it looks great. One of these days I''ll have to give the custard a try.', '2015-06-23 04:15:18', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8503, 8108, 19, 4, 'Came for a sweet cold treat. I ordered a large chocolate custard in a waffle cone. It turned out to be 3 large scoops of chocolate custard. Wow, delicious!!', '2018-08-22 04:15:01', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8504, 8109, 19, 3, 'Customer service and cleanliness on point. Food lack luster on this particular visit. Fries were neither fresh or hot. Lettuce on my burger must have come from the bottom of the containers as I got a lot of water that made my bun soggy.', '2019-02-10 20:56:36', NULL
