SELECT 8524, 8128, 19, 4, 'My FAVORITE burger place. I can eat the entire burger without feeling sick like I do at most places (5 guys) and they fries are so good! Only downside is they don''t give you enough fries (even with a large meal). I don''t eat a lot and I can finish a large meal and still have room for desert.', '2018-01-23 11:02:09', NULL
