SELECT 8525, 8129, 19, 5, 'Outstanding value and flavor!  Great Frozen Custard that is so smooth, it''s hard to describe.  Delicious food.  Clean, comfortable, fun.  Brightly lit with a fun retro vibe.', '2017-10-26 23:54:27', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8526, 8130, 19, 4, 'I went to the Freddy''s in Fredericksburg a while ago and I was craving it, so I decided to go to this one because it was closer. I went on a Saturday and the parking was beyond horrible. I rode around the parking lot several times until I finally got a spot. The ice cream on the other hand was great, which is what I went for. It was rather busy, which was expected. The was no where to sit,  inside or outside, but it is right beside a park so luckily it was nice outside so I sat on a park bench and enjoyed my sundae. All and all it was worth it.', '2018-04-15 08:11:01', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8527, 8131, 19, 4, 'If you like burgers alot come HERE', '2019-09-15 03:08:56', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8528, 8132, 19, 5, '4th time at this establishment and I must say the consistencey of the food is incredible.  The ambaince of the restaurant is so dead on for the 50''s.  Service is fast and accurate!!!!!', '2019-07-02 00:50:14', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8529, 8133, 19, 1, 'Visit on a Friday night early summer. Almost every order in the place including ours was wrong. They lost our shake order (how?) And there was a colony of ants over taking the tables outside. All garbage cans were overflowing, condiment station was empty, restaurant exhaust wasn''t working so it was smokey. I have seen it more crowded but better run so not sure what was going on.', '2018-06-01 23:33:04', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8530, 8134, 19, 3, 'Food is OK. Eating area could be maintained better', '2019-07-13 20:52:29', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8531, 8135, 19, 5, 'Very clean, great food, and great custard! Felt a little bad we went about 40 minutes before they were close in but they were totally cool with it! Also the food only took about 7 minutes.', '2018-10-26 16:00:15', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8532, 8136, 19, 4, 'Really thin, crispy on the edges and still juicy burgers. Might be too high in salt. They taste great and their thin fries and sauce are a nice change, but if you''re watching your salt intake, you might want to review the nutritional content first.', '2017-03-23 11:13:19', NULL
UNION ALL
