SELECT 8583, 8185, 19, 5, 'Just had lunch for the 100th time. Always a pleasant staff willing to go the extra mile for the patrons. Great burgers and fries. Always a fan favorite with my wife and kids.', '2017-05-30 17:32:57', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8584, 8186, 19, 4, 'Great burgers at an affordable price. Fast drive-through service. Nice people.', '2018-06-15 13:31:22', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8585, 8187, 19, 5, 'Similar to Steak n Shake, but better. Order at the counter and they either call your number or, if they''re not too busy, they''ll bring it to you. Burgers are yummy, fries is perfectly crisp, frozen custard yummy. Service always with a smile. I''m eyeing the cakes with ice cream AND cake for my birthday.', '2015-08-27 20:52:33', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8586, 8188, 19, 5, 'This was our first visit. We ordered burgers and desserts. They let us hold off on getting the desserts until we finished our food. Burgers came out faster than expected. The reason is the patties are thinner than usual burger joints. But the thinner burger was not a negative in this case. I got a patty melt which comes with 2 patties. (The regular burgers come with 2 patties) The pattie melt was delicious and hot. I could still see steam coming off the meat. I was not too impressed with the thin shoe string fries but the portion was fairly large and they were included in the price. I could not finish all my fries. Plus I had to save room for dessert. I ordered my staple dessert, hot fudge Sundae. The custard was excellent. The point price vs. portion was spot on. Meaning you get what you pay for. And I can''t forget the staff, they are nice, helpful, and attentive to our needs. I would visit more offen but it''s a bit out of the way from where we live and work.', '2018-10-24 15:55:51', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8587, 8189, 19, 4, 'Good quality food. Love the Freddy sauce on both their burgers and fries, including chili cheese fries. And for a fast food/"fast casual" place their service is excellent, you can definitely tell they emphasize great service.', '2015-11-25 02:02:11', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8588, 8190, 19, 4, 'Burgers were awesome! Almost as awesome as in-n-out! The frozen custard was just okay to me..nothing too special. Maybe I have to try a different flavor next time!', '2016-08-16 16:57:36', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8589, 8191, 19, 5, 'Great food; great service.', '2019-05-29 02:56:45', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 8590, 8192, 19, 5, 'Very yummy steakburgers and fries here, not to mention shakes and sundaes! Polite staff and quick counter service.', '2018-12-19 12:18:45', NULL
UNION ALL
