SELECT 9516, 9064, 63, 2, 'So I''ve had some pretty good experiences here but staff turnover is very evident. And a better job could be done on keeping the restrooms clean. The last time I visited this location, I was told by the barista to do all the add-ins myself. And he was arrogant enough to point out where it all was as if I hadn''t known or seen myself. Will never return to this location. I never have an issue ordering my drink anywhere else. And I was the only one at the time ordering anything', '2019-10-16 15:51:46', NULL
UNION ALL
