SELECT 10041, 7746, 59, 4, 'As good as local places? No, what do you expect, it''s still a large chain. Better than Subway? By a mile, the bread, the toppings, the unprocessed cooked-to-order meat, everything. The prices are even a little better, if you count that a 6" here is equivalent to a footlong at Subway in its ability to fill you up. The cookies and 100% gooey brownies are much better too. I got the chipotle cheesesteak with jalapeños (come at me cheesesteak purists), and while I wish it had been spicier, all of the flavors and textures were perfect. Somehow, it managed to be stuffed to bursting, with tons of sauce, yet still not messy. It''s a little slow because the meat is, again, cooked to order, but it''s worth the few minutes'' wait, which amazingly doesn''t increase during lunch hour.', '2018-03-11 00:11:32', NULL
UNION ALL
