SELECT 10132, 9645, 68, 5, 'This place never disappoints. My favorite here is the challah bread French toast during their weekend breakfast hours. But really, anything on the menu at any time is fantastic. The staff is always quick and friendly. The number of regulars here are an easy indication of how loved this restaurant is.', '2021-03-16 05:27:00', NULL
