UNION ALL
SELECT 10155, 9667, 68, 5, 'This is a great restaurant with a wide range of delicious food! The staff is very nice and there''s lots of seating options. This is just a very friendly place. I got a gyro here the other day and before that, a grilled cheese. I want to visit here for breakfast soon, but that is only available on the weekend.', '2018-05-26 15:44:05', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10156, 6105, 68, 5, 'Always get the patty melt and a french onion soup', '2021-01-08 00:42:36', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10157, 9668, 68, 5, 'Delicious blueberry pancakes filled with bursting juicy berries. I like they''re still doing curbside pick up in front despite the restaurant being open.', '2020-09-27 15:31:44', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10158, 9669, 68, 5, 'Absolutely fantastic place to take the family or order a family meal. Yum! I love the food here!', '2020-05-29 23:10:26', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10159, 9670, 68, 5, 'Greatest family restaurant out there!  We moved out of the area and rarely get back, but everyone still remembers us and us them.  The food is delicious and reasonably priced especially given the areas inflation.', '2019-09-20 01:27:53', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10160, 9671, 68, 5, 'Fun family restaurant. I enjoyed their greek pizza recently', '2018-05-15 12:05:30', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10161, 9672, 68, 5, 'Love this place! So many choices of good food. They are also doing great at social distancing and sanitizing the space after each customer.', '2021-04-21 01:19:34', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10162, 9673, 68, 5, 'This has been our family''s to go spot for breakfast lunch and dinner.  I''m sure it''s been more then 20 years. Like I''ve said before, nobody is perfect.  Mistakes happen service might not be on top of there game. You cant say honestly that you have never had a bad day of off one. So dont expect to never see it or experience it. I once had a bad burger at five guys.  Didnt want to go back but said I''ll give it another try. And have not stopped going since.  People need to stop being so critical to think that people need to be prefect.  I can I rate based on everything that happens. They are time this restaurant struggles but they rise above and make it right.  Watching and experiencing the owners and managers walking around to check on guest is something that should be done other places.  This restaurant and there sister one Olympian have managed to keep there reviews on the good side. A few good apples but for the most part 5 stars. As far as pricing. I''ve seen same prices for same type of food somewhere else but it''s not as much as they give you. They have a good size menu with lots of options.  Next time you have a problem please talk to them they are there to please there customers.  They want you to leave happy full and with a smile and tell there friends about it. My experience here has always been great. Lots of memories have been made.', '2020-01-29 13:01:37', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10163, 9674, 68, 5, 'I am the father of young children and this eatery provides a stress free place to eat a family dinner. The staff is proficient and I have received above average service at times. The food is excellent and the portions are adequate for a large family. I personally like the Gyro dinner. I will often get takeout pizza from Spartan''s and although it is pricier than a national establishment like Papa John''s and Domino''s, I like supporting small businesses. All in all well worth a visit.', '2019-06-07 22:15:26', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10164, 9675, 68, 5, 'Delicious food and print service if you catch them at the right time they are very popular', '2018-08-24 03:16:13', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10165, 9676, 68, 5, 'Great spot! I''ve had the gyro with fries 3 times this week. Fries are crispy and on point. Gyro is stuffed and delicious. Highly recommend.', '2019-07-01 16:27:10', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10166, 9677, 68, 5, 'Very good cheese pizza. The guy who takes the orders at the counter was very nice.', '2020-02-15 02:12:50', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10167, 9678, 68, 5, 'Great Greek food.  The pastitiso is phenomenal, great service and good prices. A real family restaurant.', '2019-10-01 00:12:17', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10168, 51, 68, 3, 'I habe been eating at Spartans for years.  The food here is usually pretty good, not made from scratch but a little better than the usual American Greek restaurant.  Very busy around dinner time and sometimes there is quite a wait for food.  The staff is friendly and it has a good atmosphere.  The reason for my 3 stars is that as of late food quality has slipped.  I usually order a chicken gyro.  One recent time I got my gyro there were only 4 cubes of chicken on it, very dissapointing.  The last two times I got chips with my gyro I got bottom of the bag basically chip crumbs with only one or two actual chips.', '2019-09-28 01:25:34', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10169, 9679, 68, 5, 'The food is always amazing. They serve a nice portion size, so I never leave hungry. The staff is truly amazing. Every time you go, you feel like you''re apart of the family.  I love their Gyro''s and spaghetti with meat sauce. Have yet to find a place that can even serve anything as near as good as them! I love Spartans/Olympians, been going ever since high school! And their food never gets old!', '2019-03-05 17:12:57', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10170, 9680, 68, 5, 'Friendly sercice, cosy atmosphere, good food, but could be a bit faster.', '2020-02-24 13:24:55', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10171, 9681, 68, 5, 'Food is great and the staff are the nicest. I haven''t had a single bad experience for the past few years I''ve been going here, however because reservations aren''t offered we''ve generally needed to arrive 5 - 10 minutes earlier to wait for a table during the restaurant''s busy hours. Definitely worth the visit if you''re in the area.', '2018-12-28 00:22:29', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10172, 9682, 68, 4, 'Great omlette. Good prices. Coffee could be better.', '2020-01-17 03:53:18', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10173, 9683, 68, 3, 'We visited on a week day  about 5pm.  Surprisingly few patrons (maybe 50%).  We found our seat, and this is when things started to go poorly.  Waitress didn''t show up until we flagged a different one to serve us. This was highly unusual, given the 30 years we have eaten here. After we ordered we had to find someone to get our meals delivered (30 minutes).  The food was good as usual.  Waitress never came back, we went to the cashier to pay what we felt were inflated prices.  Sorry to say we won''t be eating here for a long time to come.', '2019-07-14 17:18:44', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10174, 9684, 68, 4, 'Wonderful food. Had the weekend breakfast. Staff provided excellent service.', '2019-11-03 22:11:02', NULL
UNION ALL
