SELECT 10177, 9687, 68, 5, 'It was my first time going to Spartans Restaurant but my mom has been here a few times. She ordered the same thing as last time the Steak and Cheese and again loved it!!! I on the other hand ordered the Gyro Dinner...👍👍Loved it as well!!! If you decide to go, those are 2 plates I recommend trying. Oh yeah and for an appetizer, the Hummus Dip w/2 Pitas. 😁', '2018-06-03 01:35:54', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10178, 9688, 68, 5, 'Amazing place! My boyfriend works at the MyGym next door and always gets their pepperoni pizza. Last time we went they were understaffed--on a Saturday at lunchtime--but the server still kept our water full and attended to our needs. Their salads are great. You can tell service and good food is really their passion. They don''t skimp on portion sizes! Great small business.', '2019-03-09 20:25:28', NULL
