SELECT 10202, 9709, 68, 4, 'I tried this place for the first time with my family.  The place was very crowded and I finally realized that it was Super Bowl night.  I have never seen so many people pick up pizzas to go.  From the looks of patrons around , they seemed to be a lot of regulars. I’m not sure if it was due to the shortage of workers or the fact that they were super busy, but I found the food just ok.  I would probably give them a 3.5 but to see that everyone was working very hard and trying their best is why I give them 4 stars.  I will definitely come back to give them a second taste test and judge for myself again.', '2019-02-06 07:58:55', NULL
UNION ALL
