SELECT 10537, 10012, 71, 3, 'I have visited this location before but had the worst service tonight.  There were no cars at the pickup window when we rolled up, and just 4 cars in line to order ahead of us.  It should have been quick . . . But 30 minutes later we finally had coffee.  I''m not sure what was happening.  It took a good 10 minutes to get to the order screen, but then we were asked to wait, probably another 5.  I should have left and gone to McDonald''s across the street.  When I finally got to the pickup window, I was handed the wrong drinks and not using a mug like other Starbucks do.  I''m sure those drinks had to be re-made since we touched them during a pandemic.  We were also asked if we wanted a receipt.  I responded with "Yes, since no one has told me how much it cost. "  Clearly the 2 people working this evening are undertrained and needed help. The coffee tasted good but it would have been better had it not taken a half hour to get it.', '2020-12-24 01:57:51', NULL
UNION ALL
