UNION ALL
SELECT 10569, 10039, 71, 5, 'Last Friday around 8 p.m. I went to this Starbucks location after mobile  order.A series unfortunate events at work. The sandwich that I ordered through the mobile app was not available. I got very assertive and asked for my money back, and was not polite when they asked if I wanted anything else. there was nothing right about the way that I behaved. Both baristas handled the situation very well an even gave me positive greetings that tomorrow will be a better day. They gave me a gift card I did not deserve. I''ve been to this location multiple times and the crew is always polite. My drinks are always made correctly the food is always hot. I want to thank them both for their positive actions towards me during my idiocracy and taking my frustration out in the drive thru.', '2019-09-11 18:14:45', NULL
UNION ALL
