SELECT 10577, 10046, 71, 1, 'So disappointed, again, with this Starbucks. I ordered a venti s''mores frappuccino to share with my hubby. We both agreed whoever made it was new and made caramel and just sprinkled the Graham crackers on the top. To top that she gave it to me spilling out and dripping everywhere. Didn''t give me napkins but gave me a larger cup to put it in....still leaking over the top. Horrible experience yet again. I''m done with them. What a waste of money', '2019-05-05 00:11:44', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10578, 10047, 71, 3, 'This was place OK. If you like Starbucks, then you will like the coffee. My only issues with this location was that it was extremely cold inside . It was really hard to sit there and "enjoy" my beverage and conversation because I was shivering the whole time. As for the staff, they were friendly, but to me they seemed to be paying a little too much attention to the drive through. At one point, all 3 employees were tending to the drive through while no one was tending to any of the inside guest. Maybe they were short on workers that day, I''m not sure. It would have been nice to have a little faster service. Final review, 3.', '2017-10-03 14:53:47', NULL
UNION ALL
