SELECT 10817, 10253, 61, 5, 'GREAT chicken and friendly staff. They also have other Korean food.', '2019-01-14 15:24:00', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10818, 10254, 61, 5, 'Great chicken as always', '2020-12-20 02:22:09', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10819, 10255, 61, 5, 'This place has definitely delicious wings... super crispy and made to order. They are to die for. They only have two flavors but it is worth it. They also make a killer bulgogi. The place isn''t that big but it''s never too crowded. Remember if you order the wi gs that they take their time since they are made to order. Service is also good but at times a little lacking in attentiveness. Overall a good place to eat at', '2019-07-04 11:56:02', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10820, 10256, 61, 5, 'My wife and I enjoyed our meal. The service was really good also. We had the spicy chicken tacos and a small order of spicy chicken strips.  We will be back.', '2019-04-20 22:06:06', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10821, 10257, 61, 3, 'Your order will take FOREVER. but the food isn''t bad. a fried rice dish is about a 30 min wait. There is a high turnaround on cashiers. They''re  are always confused about any additional questions like ,what type of sauce comes with this? What type of seafood is in your dishes labeled "seafood rice, seafood noodles, seafood____? Food is good and very reasonable.', '2019-02-23 00:11:27', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10822, 10258, 61, 1, 'Haven''t had bonchon in a while so i ordered boneless wings (sweet crunchy garlic soy) and seasoned fries. Fries were good just overpriced i usually order strips (spicy and garlic)  wings were just extremely dry and tough hard like maybe its been frozen forever idk definitely not worth the price and WAIT (25M) plus the new flavor is gross tooo sweet they put a divider in my wings but the syrup from the sweet mixed in with the other flavor was just gross probably wont be back anytime soon', '2020-01-17 05:28:21', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10823, 10259, 61, 5, 'Their portions match their prices. The food always tastes and smells fresh! The food is hot as well. I’ve come here plenty of times, I work in the shopping center where they are located. Love their spicy and garlic wings, drums and tenders. Love their bulgogi rice.', '2019-02-08 05:55:03', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10824, 9771, 61, 5, 'Bonchon has really figured out something magical with their chicken! Last time I went, I tried the chicken strips for the first time as I normally go for the bone-in chicken. The skin was crispy and flavorful without the meat itself losing any succulent juiciness. The portions are large and filling but the prices are fair. I accidentally ordered way more than I could eat last time I was there and I took home 2 meals worth of food! In addition to the spicy chicken tenders, I had the seafood fried rice and spicy chicken tacos. Nothing disappointed.', '2018-11-18 22:10:36', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10825, 10260, 61, 5, 'I felt that I needed a change of taste so I treated my granddaughter to Korean style restaurant Bonchon and it was perfect. I have been wanting to try Bimbimap. It was so delicious,  the crackling sizzling rice chocked full of vegetables and meat with a nice spicy hot Korean sauce ..... yum. My granddaughter had a scrumptious beef fried rice and my husband had a shrimp fried rice. The meal wad topped off with a chocolate yogurt iceream. The price was reasonable considering we had enough left overs for our evening meal. Our waiter was very polite, thoughtfully asking if we needed refills of ice tea or soda.  We don''t usually tip over 20% however,  he was very good at attending to his customers we decided he deserved a boost of sunshine 🌞 so we were a little more generous.  This is an excellent place to enjoy something different. 😉', '2019-06-05 18:51:31', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10826, 6092, 61, 1, 'Everytime I eat this food I get food poison..At it last week and almost had to go to the ER..Never again..and that smell in there..OMG!!', '2020-03-09 00:55:44', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10827, 10261, 61, 5, 'I''m addicted to the Soy Garlic potstickers!', '2020-07-09 00:24:59', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10828, 10262, 61, 2, CONVERT(X'' USING utf8mb4), '2019-02-17 18:34:56', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10829, 10263, 61, 5, 'The food and customer service are always pleasant', '2019-12-17 11:16:47', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10830, 10264, 61, 5, 'This was a great place!  Loved the food, service.  Not quite a hole in the wall, but close.  Will definitely be back again.  Frequently.   It was very yummt', '2018-09-23 16:36:18', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10831, 10253, 61, 5, 'GREAT chicken and friendly staff. They also have other Korean food.', '2019-01-14 15:24:00', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10832, 10265, 61, 4, CONVERT(X'' USING utf8mb4), '2019-03-13 19:24:02', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10833, 572, 61, 5, 'The fried chicken is out of this world. Get it', '2020-01-18 02:25:21', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10834, 10266, 61, 5, 'I had such a great time my first visit(happyhour..), i wanted to wait on the review, and its simply, I''ve fallen under their slogan.  Call answered on the second ring, friendly upbeat voice, accurately called time for order readiness.  I got outta there AND THE SMELL told me i didn''t get enough.  Five stars is not enough. Decor, parking, the bath room was clean, employees smiling.. Cheers', '2018-04-29 02:02:07', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10835, 10267, 61, 1, 'On a Tuesday night, eight total customers, four staff, and a to go order that was promised in twenty minutes took forty. The bibimbap (at Woodbridge) cost half again as much as it does in DC, which is crazy. And my bibimbap had romaine lettuce as an ingredient! Why?', '2020-01-15 00:20:20', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10836, 8157, 61, 4, 'Really great place for Fried Chicken. They have two options: a spicy and soy garlic. Both are very tasty, but beware, the spicy is rather hot. Might be a turn off for some. I love spicy foods so this is pretty much perfect for me. The breading of the chicken has a nice crunch to it and it never gets soggy. The only thing I can really ding them on is their customer service ,which can be rather spotty at times. Sometimes you get great service, other times not so great. Other than that, this is a really great place for chicken. They do have other food options, but I have yet to try them.  I will update once I do.', '2016-11-02 03:31:38', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10837, 10268, 61, 4, 'Would like more sauce but good', '2019-11-18 18:18:06', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10838, 10269, 61, 5, 'Nice service good food', '2019-12-10 22:08:50', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10839, 10270, 61, 5, 'Food and staff is excellent!', '2019-12-22 19:59:46', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10840, 10271, 61, 5, 'Outstanding Food and Service! The chicken was out of this world, the fries were so good, the shrimp and dumplings were amazing. I thought that wasn''t enough the service was fantastic. Definitely going to go on a regular basis to try EVERYTHING!', '2016-09-27 22:01:11', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10841, 10272, 61, 5, 'Great chicken friendly staff', '2020-05-22 18:34:07', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10842, 10273, 61, 5, 'Great wings, bar is convenient (nice to have a beer while waiting for fresh wings)', '2019-07-27 02:27:52', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10843, 10274, 61, 5, 'Korean chicken served in a nice setting with a great Happy Hour. You can choose the flavor of your chicken. Soy garlic is recommended. Call ahead if you are ordering to go as food is usually cooked to order.', '2017-04-23 14:30:06', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 10844, 10275, 61, 1, 'Definitely not 4 stars. Bad bad bad. Chi mc and choong man chicken is way better.', '2019-08-25 19:25:49', NULL
UNION ALL
