SELECT 10870, 10300, 61, 2, 'Came in this past Saturday with my family of 5, as soon as we entered, we noticed all of the staff behind the bar notice us, which took a few mins for us to gain any acknowledgment as customers....  then our waitress Britney had a very smug attitude, we order 5 waters initially that took a good while to receive, and when on the way, were spilled all over the table next to us!  Still a piss poor attitude from our waitress, we placed our order which was quite tasty but we continue to receive lack luster service with a smug attitude as if we we''re burdening our waitress....  Food was great, but service was piss-poor.  Waitress really needs an attitude adjustment, we won''t be returning.', '2018-08-23 05:03:41', NULL
