SELECT 10896, 10326, 61, 5, 'OK...Normally I don''t post restaurant reviews. About a month ago I had a bad experience at BonChon Chicken WOODBRIDGE. I mentioned something to a FB friend of mine. He asked me to give them a second chance. He knows the owner, and bad service doesn''t sound like him..Well, The owner called me and invited me back for lunch or dinner on him. IT WAS FABULOUS!!! the service was great! The food was superb!...Ladies and Gentlemen. The owners name is Peter, and he made us feel like valuable customers..I give them a 10+++ Excellent food excellent service', '2014-03-11 21:53:30', NULL
UNION ALL
