SELECT 11120, 10530, 67, 4, 'Good place and cute server with simple welcome smile which made our day good. service is bit slow as restaurant is quite busy. Food is delicious and we enjoyed only disappointment with shrimp as it over burnt and we can feel the burn taste. other than that everything is good.', '2020-12-22 21:57:10', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11121, 7877, 67, 5, 'Great spacing between tables. Lots of space to handle many patrons. Our server Geo was great and attentive. The food and sauces were very tasty and spiced perfect. Reasonable prices. Good set of menu choices. Try the Carne and also veggie tacos. Shrimp Diablo was spicy but not too much.', '2021-04-21 00:23:12', NULL
