SELECT 11126, 10533, 67, 4, 'This is a great place to visit and It has ample of space to sit. The food is really good here and my personal favorite is the mexican tortilla soup which is really tasty. Should surely give this place a try. It has happy hour from 7pm to 9pm. Everyday except Saturdays. The customer service is really good.', '2019-02-26 21:17:38', NULL
