SELECT 11131, 10538, 67, 5, 'La Sandia is a delicious Texas mex style restaurant located near the Barnes and Noble at Tyson''s Corner Center. The salsa is a smoky salsa, much like Uncle Julio''s.  The tableside guacamole was delicious as were our meals. The service was quick and friendly.', '2019-01-08 00:32:33', NULL
UNION ALL
