SELECT 11149, 10549, 67, 4, 'The first time I came here, we split an appetizer sampler and it was amazing. I was so eager to come back to find out that they changed the menu. The new appetizer sampler was not as good. The chicken enchiladas and wings were dried out. I got the watermelon margarita which is very good though.', '2020-01-12 03:29:14', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11150, 10550, 67, 5, 'I reserved my table few hours in the same day and it was excellent. The customer service was excellent. The chips and salsa were great as I waited for a friend. The food presentation was nice, I ordered the beef taco platter. I definitely recommend using the online reservation system since it can be quite busy on Saturday nights.', '2019-02-21 01:08:27', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11151, 10542, 67, 4, 'the salsa and chips were great.', '2018-07-16 16:16:34', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11152, 10551, 67, 5, 'While doing some Christmas shopping we ran in to this delicious Mexican restaurant. The name really called my attention. Food drinks and service were just perfect. Well be back!!', '2019-12-16 00:05:59', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11153, 10552, 67, 5, 'Excellent food. Loved the fresh tacos n Avocado. Churros for dessert was super fresh n delicious. Highly recommend this place.', '2019-12-20 00:19:51', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11154, 10553, 67, 5, 'Went there for lunch. Not crowded. Food was good. Served quickly. Big points for waiter to quickly and accurately get our big party separate checks.', '2018-02-11 13:15:04', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11155, 10554, 67, 5, 'Sat at the bar during happy hour on a Tuesday which was a great value. $6 margaritas, $2 tacos, and free chips and salsa. You could easily fill up and drink up for $20! Staff was friendly and atmosphere was nice. I would definitely recommend checking it out.', '2019-02-13 01:36:31', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11156, 10555, 67, 5, 'Always a great experience with Darius and Krystle. Try the Watermelon infused Margarita and the Frozen Strawberry Margarita (pictured below). Make sure you get the Flan', '2019-02-25 21:00:47', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11157, 10556, 67, 4, 'Def enjoyed the food and delicious salsa with the chips.  Great atmosphere. The kids menu is a bit eccentric for my kids taste but I liked it!! The staff was awesome and checked on us often! Very attentive! Thank you guys!!', '2018-06-21 19:19:51', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11158, 10557, 67, 4, 'Came here for lunch. The staff are great. They bring you chips and salsa. Always have good food. I ordered the braised beef taco that came with rice and beans. Very tender and tasty.  Price on point.', '2018-10-15 14:38:28', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11159, 10558, 67, 5, 'Harmando was a great waiter. The food was amazing. I recommend the veggie tacos wrapped in lettuce!', '2019-09-07 21:31:46', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11160, 8210, 67, 3, 'I would give this a 5 star rating, unfortunately our server did not provide us with our drinks nor silverware while we were visiting. Unfortunately after talking to other waiters we were still not serviced and finally decided to get silverware ourselves. I think the food is good I hope if you visit this restaurant you get better service than I did.', '2018-06-28 21:26:41', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11161, 10559, 67, 4, 'This is very good mexican food.  The Marghertias are excellent.  Try the fish tacos or beef burritos with the spicy guacamole dip to start.', '2019-10-26 06:04:42', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11162, 10560, 67, 5, 'Great food, but their guacamole is what always brings me back.', '2020-02-06 01:05:54', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11163, 10561, 67, 1, 'We had a group of 8 people and everyone was disappointed with the food.  This is easily the worst Mexican restaurant I''ve been to food wise. This place is charging way too much for the food they were serving. The wait staff was fantastic but I can''t justify giving this place more than one star based on the food and the price.', '2019-07-20 00:52:15', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11164, 10562, 67, 5, 'This Mexican restaurant was found by chance and buy was it on the spot for filling my desirous stomach! I had the brunch steak and eggs and it was delicious! The tomale on the side was a great balance. Also if you enjoy a tasty drink try the margarita, very nice! I will have to visit again for dinner!', '2019-03-03 23:49:43', NULL
UNION ALL
