SELECT 11203, 10599, 67, 3, 'Mediocre service, not very clean.  The molcajeta that the guacamole came in was falling apart.  Some pieces of the covering material feel into the guacamole.  The silverware had food particles stuck to it.  The waitress came to refill our drinks, all three of us had Coke, she grabbed the glasses by sticking her fingers in them.  Then can back and want sure whose was whose.  The food tasted okay, but not very authentic.  At least no one got sick.', '2018-07-20 22:08:15', NULL
