SELECT 11214, 10606, 67, 5, '5 stars for their happy hour because I never went to have regular dinner. I normally have their tacos, they serve 3 and you can have carnitas, al pastor, chicken, or fish (you can order them in lettuce wraps too). We also had a mixed plate they serve for appetizer, that''s good too. My friends always order quesadillas.', '2019-02-26 15:39:31', NULL
