SELECT 11216, 10608, 67, 4, 'Always a solid choice.  Their queso fundido is the best out there, but everything else is pretty typical.  Above average for sure, but not exceptional.  Happy hour from 4-9 weeknights makes for good drinks and small plates at a reasonable price, but don''t waste your money on the drinks when they are full price.', '2018-12-01 16:31:20', NULL
