SELECT 11538, 8081, 30, 5, 'Shiny new coffee bar, with shiny new baristas! Everyone is smiling and chatty, and the ( peak hours ) lines forming to test out the grinds & staff skills  point to the reputation Compass has already earned. Seating is comfortable, and the computer toting, not quite-at-work crowd have discovered the upper floor. The coffee game has officially been upped!', '2018-09-14 12:58:15', NULL
