UNION ALL
SELECT 11542, 10894, 30, 4, 'I love compass and having one in Arlington has made life nearly complete to say the least. The coffee is wonderful and the atmosphere of the place is sunny and happy. Come here and stay a little bit. The upstairs is a great place for a casual meeting, off site group collaboration or just catching up with your gossipy friend. I have to say the cold brew and the colada are my favorites. The hot coffee cups are a little odd. They tend to leak easily. I think they are bio friendly but I’d highly recommend to sip the coffee faster to not experience that. The staff here are always nice and friendly. I think I might fall in love with one of the baristas. Too be continued....', '2018-08-04 20:02:44', NULL
UNION ALL
