UNION ALL
SELECT 11550, 10900, 30, 3, 'Yes, the people are nice and service is pretty fast, but they don''t seem to get the espresso right consistently. I usually expect to to It''s not a stretch to say Compass rates lowest of the area''s up-scale coffee-bars. Baked N Wired, Chinatown, Peregrine, The Wydown, Filter, Swings, Commonwealth, and La Columbe all consistently produce better espresso-based beverages. Today I had a cortado remade because it was watery. Very nice people happily remade it 2 time before presenting the new one. Seemed to be some trouble with the settings. Still it was at the lower end of acceptable. I guess a lot of people don''t know or care what espresso is supposed be. Yes, they''re nice, but considering the capital investment behind Compass, they don''t get a pass.', '2019-02-04 21:54:18', NULL
UNION ALL
