SELECT 11662, 11002, 62, 5, 'Like a Greek-Mediterranean Chipotle, especially the way you order. Food is amazingly fresh and tasty. My kids love eating there. The staff is friendly and attentive. The teas and soft drinks are unique and refreshing. Good place to eat if you are near Barracks Road.', '2019-04-13 02:08:59', NULL
