UNION ALL
SELECT 11670, 11008, 62, 5, 'The newest Mediterranean bowl place in town. Great food, very flavorful. I had the lamb meatballs in the saffron basmati rice bowl and a bunch of toppings. They have fresh mint at the very end of line, my recommendation is to get it on your bowl,  it adds brilliant bit of freshness to the food that elevates it. The portion sizes were really good. Enough to fill up a hungry belly. Fantastic beverages too. Sweet tea and fruit lemonades. They are not sugar free so keep that in mind while you go for refills.  Atmosphere is fast casual, good ambience. Service was really good with tons of energy. Off to a great start!', '2018-07-06 18:12:47', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11671, 11009, 62, 5, 'Your typical build your own Mediterranean bowl place, but the quality is good and the place is clean. Staff is helpful & nice also.', '2019-10-22 15:11:07', NULL
