SELECT 11706, 11039, 62, 4, 'Assembly-line style Mediterranean bowls with a large selection of toppings and dressings.  Cava ressembles Chipotle with their counter of choices to pile on rice or greens.  There are very healthy options that reflect Palestinian and Greek food.  The pickled vegetables are fantastic!  All bowls come with pita bread.  Drinks choices include cane sugar soda, lemonade, and juices. Expect to pay about $15 for a meal for one.', '2018-10-28 19:34:26', NULL
