SELECT 11881, 11204, 48, 3, 'PFC offers a surprisingly decent happy hour, half price apps and bottled beer. Their dinner selection however was on the more expensive side. Like most places service does get slow during peak hours, even sitting at the bar it took 10 minutes to get my check.', '2018-12-01 22:10:01', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11882, 11205, 48, 3, 'I haven''t been to a PF Chang''s in a few years and decided to go to the one in Woodbridge with my family today. Years ago, it was not my MOST favorite place, but I definitely enjoyed the Asian Mac and Cheese. Unfortunately the Mongolian Pot stickers did not agree with my stomach much. (I think it''s me, not the restaurant. I don''t eat a lot of fried food.) The lettuce wraps are still my go to thing to get at this restaurant, if I choose to go here. Our server was very nice and gave superb service!', '2019-08-01 23:53:02', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11883, 11206, 48, 5, 'A long wait to be sure, but if you are in the mood for upscale Chinese food this is a great option. The prices are competitive, service was amazing and the bar made the drinks at a top notch level. We will be back for sure!', '2020-02-17 04:39:02', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11884, 11207, 48, 3, 'This particular trip was not great. I like PF Changes for their gluten free menu and how they handle the dietary restriction. In this visit our waitress had no idea what gluten was and brought my food on a plate that was not marked as gluten free but she thought it was fine. That''s not ok so I talked to the manager who was very sorry and had a new meal made for me. I was also disappointed that the gluten free menu does not have a single vegetarian option. Feels like they have gone down hill.', '2020-03-07 13:58:17', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11885, 11208, 48, 5, 'New menu, new management. Great staff food was cooked to order. Drinks where fantastic. The over all experience was very pleasing. Will go back again.', '2020-03-01 16:14:38', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11886, 11206, 48, 5, 'A long wait to be sure, but if you are in the mood for upscale Chinese food this is a great option. The prices are competitive, service was amazing and the bar made the drinks at a top notch level. We will be back for sure!', '2020-02-17 04:39:02', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11887, 11207, 48, 3, 'This particular trip was not great. I like PF Changes for their gluten free menu and how they handle the dietary restriction. In this visit our waitress had no idea what gluten was and brought my food on a plate that was not marked as gluten free but she thought it was fine. That''s not ok so I talked to the manager who was very sorry and had a new meal made for me. I was also disappointed that the gluten free menu does not have a single vegetarian option. Feels like they have gone down hill.', '2020-03-07 13:58:17', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11888, 11209, 48, 1, 'This place is a huge lie...the food does not taste Chinese at all. My friend had her son graduation Dinner here and the food was awful. The mall makes better sesame chicken and fry rice than this restaurant. Infact, we all ordered fry rice and the entire rice was raw. Even the white rice. I mean real raw. We sent it back to the kitchen and the cook heated up the same rice and brought it back to our table. What an insult. Everyone food was disgusting. Even the kids refused to eat it.  And we were a party of 15 people. Everyone regrated choosing this place. I spoke with the manager and he give us a discount. However, we did not eat the food, but we still paid. Will never recommend this place. It is a nice location, but the cook is terrible. The food is what makes a restaurant not the furniture. Please think again before going here. We all left hungry.', '2018-06-24 13:45:12', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11889, 11208, 48, 5, 'New menu, new management. Great staff food was cooked to order. Drinks where fantastic. The over all experience was very pleasing. Will go back again.', '2020-03-01 16:14:38', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11890, 11210, 48, 1, 'If I could give a negative star I would. We thought we liked P.F. Chang’s. Maybe we do, but NOT this location. I thought it would be nice to bring dinner home for the family, since we haven’t eaten here in a while. Well $89.00 later, the rice tasted like a burnt wok. The egg in the rice was burnt. The seaweed salad from the poke bowl tasted almost rotten. The avocado on the lobster roll was brown. My whole family was so disappointed. I will never return to this place. I should’ve seen the 2 star reviews before I went here.', '2019-10-23 13:30:32', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11891, 11211, 48, 4, 'Great food. The Dynamite Shrimp are not too spicy. The tempura veggies were crisp. Wonderful evening.', '2020-02-16 04:05:12', NULL
UNION ALL
