SELECT 11906, 11224, 48, 1, 'Poor service! Food was under cooked some parts were over cooked! Better to avoid this place at all costs', '2020-01-20 00:36:21', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11907, 11225, 48, 5, 'I am not a fan of most Asian foods although I do have a few favorites.  But my husband loves all noodles so we went.  Food service and food was fantastic.  My drink from the bar didn''t arrive till half way through the meal and had it not been a good drink I''d probably have sent it back but it was delicious and maybe worth the wait.  We went during happy hour and 3 appetizers and an adult beverage came out to be under 30$.  We will be back (for happy hour:)!', '2019-01-22 18:46:17', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11908, 11226, 48, 4, 'I used to love going this restaurant every Tueaday however, their service and food taste has decreased and it takes much longer to sit people even WITH MANY empty seats. How could it take 30 minutes to sit customers when you look around and they have half the restaurant EMPTY? That is absurd.', '2019-10-03 11:22:40', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11909, 11227, 48, 4, 'Ordered the Kung Pao, was good. Food came out fast but my side garlic chili green beans took longer. Had them to go. Server was prompt and very polite.', '2019-10-05 22:03:01', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11910, 11228, 48, 3, 'Service was slow for a Friday evening with half the restaurant filled. The lettuce wraps were really good but my usual dish was less than usual. I love and always order the Orange Peel Chicken dish. I may need to find a new favorite. The sauce was watery and they didn''t use orange peel at all. There was a couple slices of canned mandarin oranges that tasted old but no orange peel. Don''t expect me to believe a dish is made fresh when you cheat with canned, PF Changs!', '2019-07-16 12:11:19', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11911, 11229, 48, 4, 'Very nice dimly lit dining area and ambiance, it wasn''t busy at all, would''ve loved to see it packed. Only a few couples scattered; no vibe or energy in the room. But the food always good, The pad thai was...pad thai. And the lettuce wraps A+. We would have stayed longer or even ordered more if the vibe was different.  We got bored', '2019-10-28 00:27:03', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11912, 11230, 48, 2, 'This location service is tooooo slow and this may explain if your reviews and sales are slipping. I am sitting in the restaurant now waited over 40 mins for our entrees... Also, lots of dirty tables and bathroom. If you are not staffed up for the day before the holiday then what do you expect? I hope they are not putting costs cutting first then customers like us. I hope you guys can be better as I love PF Changs and there are too many competitions out here!', '2019-10-14 00:37:57', NULL
UNION ALL
