SELECT 11915, 11233, 48, 1, 'We waited 30 min for a glass of water....just imagine how the rest of the dinner went. We''ve been to this location once before and service was horribly slow. Gave it a second chance and it was worse. So not ever going to this location again. I will drive all the way to Tysons if I feel a craving.', '2020-02-17 00:00:48', NULL
