SELECT 11918, 11236, 48, 1, 'So let me start with this, I have ate other P.F. Chang''s. Now with that being said this is the worst location. I ordered curbside today and called after 5 min of sitting out there. Lady responded by saying they should have bought it out already, let me bring it to you. Ok..so not on point of watching for cars at curbside. Now that''s not the worst part. Food was cold and all the sauce was pretty much dried up/off my chicken! Not fresh and huge disappoint! $15 wasted on cold, not fresh Honey chicken! Just dont go here! Go to their other locations!', '2019-09-06 19:16:05', NULL
