SELECT 11941, 11257, 48, 1, 'Open talk: We tried ordering on Door Dash & couldn''t find our favorites nor was their menu user friendly, so we went in their online ordering & ended up in the same situation, as the last resort we called the PFC to place the order for pick up, when we arrived they couldn''t find our order. After finding it, they were very apologetic that the order was taken wrong & the items were not available on the NEW menu, matter of fact all lobster except the sauce is gone, even my seafood rice, gone. So while they bagged what was not lobster on our order we sat to the bar & ordered 2 of the nastiest ginger beers (homemade fresh) I''ve ever tasted. It tasted like straight saccharin or diet sugar. We never said a word. Walked right to the restaurant & bought 3 ginger beers & food that was very satisfying. We value date nights, so we plan NOT to return...  Bcz I tasted the food they bagged up & the standards just seem lower (bang shrimp, wonton soup etc) on a good note: the Wonton was ok but chinchy ($5 for the size smaller than what ur egg fooyung sauce comes in).', '2019-12-11 05:35:03', NULL
UNION ALL
