UNION ALL
SELECT 11945, 11261, 48, 1, 'Took a long time for food to come out and it was cold. Some of our food never came out and we just cancelled it. I thought the food tasted decent but was not worth it as something I ate gave me a seriously upset stomach. Really bad will never eat at a PF Chang''s for the rest of my life', '2019-09-28 09:56:00', NULL
