SELECT 11978, 11283, 48, 3, 'My three starts are based on what I personally order. There fried rice/noodles are dinner size and they are pretty tasty and worth the cost. But the moment I decided to "branch off" the food was so nasty. I ordered Sweet and Sour Chicken with side of fried rice for lunch (again at a good price), but man... absolutely no flavor. Made me sick to my stomach. Maybe I''ll try something new each time (within reason and allergy limits) I go for now on to make this review more accurate.', '2017-09-13 22:44:46', NULL
