UNION ALL
SELECT 11981, 11286, 48, 3, 'While the service was good, the atmosphere good, and the environment clean, the food was mediocre to bad and way too pricey for what came out of the kitchen. Two of the dishes (lettuce wraps and Shanghai street noodles) were burnt. Everyone in our party was gluten free and ordered from the gluten free Chang for 2 menu, which comes with a dessert. Unfortunately,  there is no gluten free dessert at this restaurant, BUT we did not know this and our waiter served the dessert to our table, and one member of our party ate it, because we did not know it was not gluten free. We assumed it was gluten free because our waiter brought it to a table that had ordered all gluten free items.', '2018-09-23 20:07:54', NULL
