UNION ALL
SELECT 11997, 11295, 48, 3, 'It''s okay. This resturant hires young people, who are still in high school,  so that''s a big plus. They are hired to work up front not just in the kitchen. The service was good and the food was okay. This review is based on the resturant in Woodbridge, Va.  But when comparing this PF Chang to the one I eat at closer to the city (Washington, DC) the food was better in the Washington, DC area. More flavorful....less number of younger people working and more if a couple''s  atmosphere...Woodridge is more of a family spot...to me', '2019-06-28 16:13:52', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11998, 11283, 48, 3, 'My three starts are based on what I personally order. There fried rice/noodles are dinner size and they are pretty tasty and worth the cost. But the moment I decided to "branch off" the food was so nasty. I ordered Sweet and Sour Chicken with side of fried rice for lunch (again at a good price), but man... absolutely no flavor. Made me sick to my stomach. Maybe I''ll try something new each time (within reason and allergy limits) I go for now on to make this review more accurate.', '2017-09-13 22:44:46', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 11999, 9697, 48, 2, 'Service was non existent. They hid in the back of the kitchen, and only appeared when bringing food out. They didn''t check on us at all, we had to flag them down for more water to drink. Food tasted good though.', '2018-11-28 19:18:10', NULL
UNION ALL
