UNION ALL
SELECT 12426, 11653, 55, 3, 'Actually a really good burger. Whatever they put on it, it was one of my favorite burgers ever. Nice seating by a fireplace outside. Downside is that it took 15 minutes for someone to get my drink order after I was seated. Would not recommend if you are in a hurry, but if you have time to kill, great burger!', '2019-10-19 23:23:19', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12427, 11654, 55, 4, 'Great social vibe. Easy bar seating. Food is savory and shakes are thick and rich.', '2018-10-20 02:15:55', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12428, 11655, 55, 4, 'I came here for happy hour. I arrived around 5:30 and it wasn''t busy. There were 8 of us at a long table by the bar by the time I arrived. Some left before I got there. I was surprised that there wasn''t a waiter or waitress assign to attend to us or the bar area. We had to order drinks and food at the bar, and it took a long time for the waitress to bring the banana cream pie to me. I had to check with the bartender. The banana cream pie was delicious. The crust was crunchy and the rest just melted in my mouth. There was chunks of banana in the pie. It was bigger than I thought and it was so easy to eat the whole thing. I will probably come back and try their food and milkshakes. I was too full to eat a meal today. The bartender was responsive and she was very professional and nice. The bar was more than half full and she worked the bar and took our drinks and food orders all by herself.  Impressive. Not having a waiter/waitress assign to our table is the only complain I have from this visit.', '2019-04-04 03:44:51', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12429, 11656, 55, 4, 'So.... I''m going with 4-stars because I don''t really remember the food all that well. I remember I got a burger with an egg... it was delicious... but I only remember that. Now.... the shake was phenomenal. I sucked the whole thing down within minutes. They have a wonderful open atmosphere, great servers and customer service. If I lived closer, I''d be there often. You should go check this place out. I did and I don''t regret it.', '2019-05-15 13:38:45', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12430, 11657, 55, 4, 'Some really tasty unique burgers here! Nice selection and variety to chose from, plus our food came out pretty quick which is always a plus.', '2020-03-30 20:15:53', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12431, 11658, 55, 5, 'Interior and exterior portions of the restaurant are kept clean as well as the public restrooms. Burger choices are plenty, and you can truly, "have it your way," if you recognize the slogan. The food arrives hot and service is significantly better than 95% of all of the established chain restaurants that have served the same menu choice for 40+ years. The menu has an interesting array of drinks for all ages and taste buds! Make sure someone at your table order the sweet potato fries and some other person orders a popular shake for sampling.', '2019-08-25 23:54:45', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12432, 11659, 55, 5, 'Delicious and what a bargain - drinks, apps, and a burger for under $20 at happy hour - what a great deal!  All of their food and drinks are delicious.  You can go wrong.  Great atmosphere too - live music and comfy sofas outside, with firepits to ward off the cold.  Perfect!', '2019-09-19 18:30:58', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12433, 11660, 55, 5, 'Not only does this place serve your standard burgers, but they have specialty ones and I had their burger of the week which was like a topless bun burger in a garlicky sauce with arugula omg it was so good. They also have AMAZING milkshakes and you can even spike them (; will be back. Bri was awesome at helping decide what to eat/drink and super sweet!', '2020-02-16 19:55:51', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12434, 11661, 55, 5, 'I thought the interior is too bright, but overall it was a great experience.', '2019-11-26 00:05:25', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12435, 11205, 55, 5, 'I had went to a Zin Burger years ago in Charlottesville and was so happy when I realized there was one in Springfield. What drove me to come here was the truffle fries (which I absolutely love) but I was so glad I ordered the Farm salad with champagne vinegarette. First off the dressing itself was AMAZING, but I loved that the salad had quinoa and chickpeas in it! I will definitely be back for this salad and fries again. My friends and I sat outside and the outdoor seating area was great!', '2019-09-10 14:44:10', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12436, 10556, 55, 5, 'Very very good! Excellent service. We went around lunch and the service was fast! I thought the burger was delicious until I had my milkshake. Words can''t describe how delicious it was. I dream about that milkshake...', '2017-01-28 13:14:34', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12437, 11662, 55, 3, 'The food was good. My friends and I had lunch here about a month ago. The three-star rating is because we ordered two drinks a piece. Both of our second drinks were super super weak. We asked the pregnant bartender about it and she basically said tough luck. Our waitress was gracious enough to refund us and we left the water down drink on the table. Good customer service is simply topping us off with liquor vs. Brushing us off.. I''m the customer if I complain do something about it!', '2019-05-17 18:39:55', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12438, 11649, 55, 3, 'Very pricey for a burger.  $21 bill for their company burger, fries and an Ice Tea.  The burger had caramelized onions but combined with the burger meat it just has no real taste.  The burger Patty is a nice size.  The burger was cooked to order.  Just needed some more taste', '2019-09-23 18:08:33', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12439, 11663, 55, 4, 'Great food and a great place to catch the game', '2018-12-08 00:52:01', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12440, 11664, 55, 5, 'Amazing burgers. The food is all fresh and organic, you can tell the restaurant has a special place for good food', '2020-03-08 13:51:02', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12441, 11665, 55, 4, CONVERT(X'' USING utf8mb4), '2020-02-24 16:09:03', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12442, 11666, 55, 5, 'Great burgers and many options to choose from. Happy hour prices are good and runs longer then most of the other bars located there. Atmosphere is nice, option to sit outside at the bar but yet still have some of the AC cooling you.', '2019-07-04 14:51:32', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12443, 11667, 55, 1, CONVERT(X'' USING utf8mb4), '2019-10-12 15:49:02', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12444, 11668, 55, 2, 'Staff was friendly and the space was clean with a modern and welcoming decor. Food was underwhelming and under-cooked. Ordered a medium burger that came out medium-rare, leaning toward rare and generally lacked flavor. Beyond burger was also under-cooked and bland. However, the French Fries were well done and satisfying. Overall, if you are near the mall and in the mood for a burger, you''d be better served by going to BGR in the food court.', '2019-07-01 16:22:01', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12445, 11669, 55, 5, 'I tried the seasonal bison burger and it was really good. The shake of the month was Nutter Butter and it was AMAZING. The chef was out and about and even refilled drinks for us, which we thought was really nice.', '2019-09-26 02:24:39', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12446, 11670, 55, 5, 'Delicious. Burgers cooked perfectly! Fries cooked perfectly! And dipping sauces were amazing! I will definitely come back.', '2019-09-21 12:33:42', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12447, 11671, 55, 3, 'Burger were good but I would questions the cleanliness of the place. My feet were sliding on the floor and we sitting a booth. The bathroom was ehhh. Our server was kind and efficient.', '2020-01-04 14:28:39', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12448, 11672, 55, 5, 'I''ve been here a number of times and it never disappoints! ZB is one of the few places that will cook a burger exactly how you order it. The fries are house made and very good.', '2019-11-03 19:41:08', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12449, 11673, 55, 4, CONVERT(X'' USING utf8mb4), '2018-05-09 15:31:47', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12450, 11674, 55, 5, 'Amazing service, burgers, and atmosphere! Tried this place out for the first time a while ago and just keep going back for more. The burgers taste fresh, made to order, and are delicious.', '2019-05-18 11:08:45', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12451, 11675, 55, 5, 'Delicious burger spot! When you want a real burger this is a great spot to go', '2020-03-08 02:06:17', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12452, 11676, 55, 4, CONVERT(X'' USING utf8mb4), '2019-03-28 01:11:47', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12453, 11677, 55, 3, 'Updated 10/30 - must take rating diwn to 3. Just there, for 1st x, charged 1.25 for sour cream. I said something tonour mediocre waiter who said we have to pay it. What!!! I just paid 14.25 for sn everything burger and now being charged fir a condiment. And, frie order getting less and less fries. Coleslaw same issue. Servers lacking basic skills like filling water glasses. On a Friday too. Need a break from Zinburger''s. Updated Review 10/17 - service needs work. Waiters need training big time. Best burgers ever. What I like the most about this restaurant is the consistency of the food. You can depend on getting the same quality of food each time. Happy hour every weekday beginning at 5 p.m. and drinks and food items are half price. Wednesday is half off a bottle of wine and you can take the bottle home if you don''t finish at the restaurant. TV''S are set to sports channels and the bar is large and quite nice and open. Outside seating available with half the bar on the outside as well. Each month they have different burger or sandwich specials.  You can sign up for a Zinburger VIP card on line, present each time you go and you receive $10 off when you spend a certain amount.', '2017-10-30 22:34:06', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12454, 8045, 55, 5, 'Interesting, good burgers. 5 or so beers on draft. Service has always been good. They have happy hour.', '2019-10-03 19:22:10', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12455, 10810, 55, 5, 'Awesome first time. Turkey and beef burger was the freshest I''ve ever tasted. Burgers are big too. Tater tots and fries are good. Manager was very attentive and accommodating', '2019-02-18 21:02:30', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12456, 8274, 55, 5, 'Very high quality burgers here as well a nice atmosphere and staff. I do like the happy hour special on burgers and beer, you can''t beat it.', '2019-09-11 16:35:59', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12457, 11678, 55, 4, 'Amazing food at this place.  Service was phenomenal for lunchtime.  Pricier than my normal lunch stops, but I also usually don''t have food this good for lunch!', '2019-10-13 21:45:43', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12458, 11679, 55, 5, CONVERT(X'' USING utf8mb4), '2018-06-21 23:18:02', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12459, 11680, 55, 5, 'Good old american burger joint. Big burgers, so so nice. Extra nice staff and plenty of space. Definitely returning here for a few more burgers. Might try something new. Well priced and excellent kids meals.', '2018-05-10 16:39:30', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12460, 11681, 55, 5, 'Very interesting concept, but pulled off wonderfully. There is a huge selection of creative burgers, in addition to a rotating burger of the week, and everything I''ve had was delicious. Sides of loaded fries or tater tots were also wonderful. Seasonal sangrias are a great addition to the standard wine list. I do enjoy their wine flights, as it''s the only place I''ve seen have that take on a traditionally beer-centric tasting', '2018-11-02 22:32:09', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12461, 11682, 55, 5, 'We sat at the bar Saturday night. We had great service !!! Bartender was honest when we asked questions and super nice! Food was awesome !!!! Burger was cooked to perfection and the chopped wedge was AMAZING!! We will definitely be going back soon :).', '2019-02-28 22:09:41', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12462, 11683, 55, 4, 'Some of the best burgers I''ve had, they might be gourmet burgers. Great service too. But the fries are a bit small. It''s not cheap, but the burgers taste good enough. I''ve gone here for lunch on weekdays a few times and there''s never a wait, not sure about evenings and weekends.', '2018-06-24 20:46:11', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12463, 11684, 55, 5, 'Service at Zinburger is always pleasant and professional. It''s a bit loud for meaningful conversation, but aside from that, the atmosphere is great for families or friends. The burgers are consistently excellent (whether on the delicious brioche rolls or lettuce wraps) and the sides and wine selection are great.', '2018-12-07 13:48:03', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12464, 11685, 55, 2, 'Good food- worst service ever. Been there like 10 times and it’s always the same. My daughter loves the place so I take her.', '2019-09-26 00:57:24', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12465, 2536, 55, 4, 'Huge location with table service and great happy hour specials. The food is greasy and delicious, but service is not always accurate. Huge bar with seven flat screen TVs.  Easy parking in the mall lot, though it''s packed on Saturday nights. Summer special is $3 meals including drink for kids! Great deal anywhere, especially here.', '2018-07-07 23:14:35', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12466, 2536, 55, 4, 'Huge location with table service and great happy hour specials. The food is greasy and delicious, but service is not always accurate. Huge bar with seven flat screen TVs.  Easy parking in the mall lot, though it''s packed on Saturday nights. Summer special is $3 meals including drink for kids! Great deal anywhere, especially here.', '2018-07-07 23:14:35', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12467, 11686, 55, 3, 'Wasn’t greeted until about 10 mins after we sat at the bar. Got water which had stuff floating in it. Didn’t complain. Ordered drinks, okay. Ordered food, waited, still waiting 4 people come in we still, they all ordered food after us and got food after us. They brought out cold fries, not no burger. I could go on. The reason for the 3 was because of the food being good. However the service sucks and to wait I’ve 50 mins for just a burger and some fries. The food being good saved this review from getting a 1 star.', '2019-05-05 02:54:57', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12468, 11687, 55, 5, 'Gotta say my burger was Fantastic. It looked so good and was so juicy, I forgot to take a pic. I''ll show you the next one.....only  if I can resist eating it first.  🙄😁😁', '2019-05-07 22:18:34', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12469, 11688, 55, 5, 'Great burger and awesome fries. I highly recommend you get the sweet potato waffle fries. The yogurt dipping sauce was amazing!', '2019-03-16 03:54:50', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12470, 11689, 55, 4, 'Pretty good burgers!  Really good wine and a wide selection.  Their beer selection is ok, at least there should be something everyone likes, but maybe not the most exotic beers.  Happy hour is from 3-6 which seemed short, but I would go back.  Not usually a wait time.', '2018-05-10 03:39:02', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12471, 11690, 55, 5, 'The el diablo burger is great!', '2020-01-30 19:17:21', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12472, 9703, 55, 5, 'Good food and good staff. Recommend their truffle fries. Delicious.', '2019-06-17 07:46:33', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12473, 11691, 55, 5, 'This is a high quality burger joint. The burgers come with a gluten free bun, as do some of the fries. Hooray for a fabulous gluten free burger!!!', '2018-12-25 15:32:24', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12474, 11692, 55, 3, 'Food is good and it is a relatively nice place. I don’t know why they do it but I am not a fan of any restaurant that isn’t full and they s at you right next to someone else. I am sure it has something to do with beaut staff sections or the software but I would prefer to not sit next to people when there are dozens of tables open.', '2018-07-22 13:34:12', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12475, 10387, 55, 3, 'Just not the same experience it once was. It is like the staff doesn''t want to be there. Still have Evo #3 on tap, which is the only reason I ever go. And that isn''t very often.', '2019-06-03 21:20:03', NULL
