SELECT 12504, 11715, 55, 1, 'I WILL NEVER EAT HERE AGAIN. 3 out of the 5 times I''ve been here and the customer service is terrible when the guys with the big suits are not there. The first time I went was the very first week it opened and we had to wait at the table to be served longer then 15 minutes. We had to wait longer then 20 minutes to put the order in for dessert''s and then we had to wait another 15 minutes in order to get the check. WTH I ended up giving the waitress 5 dollar tip but wrote on the receipt we should not have to look for our waiter. The second time I went service was great. The third time I went we were not greeted by the hostess right at all. There were some guys that came in first and there were three hostesses at the front and they sat up there flirting with the guys, having a personal conversation and didn''t even acknowledge that I was standing there. Until my face got real unpleasant. The fourth time I went service was excellent and I really liked my waitress. The fifth time which was last night was horrible. I ordered a to go meal. I came and said I would like to order to go. The hostess said you have to order at the bar. I went to the bar and I got serviced pretty fast. I ordered and then she brought me this receipt that I ordered and walked away. She didn''t tell me how long the wait was going to be or that I can come back and pay. I had to wait to ask her. Then I came back and I give them that they were busy so I stood there and waited and I saw my food just sitting there. The red head supervisor came to help some people and then looked me dead in my face and walked off. So, I walked off too because I thought to myself I don''t have to eat here and keep waiting here. I stood there for about 8 minutes. That''s crazy and customer service needs to be much better.', '2016-07-09 20:10:25', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12505, 11711, 55, 5, 'Zucchini fries and the Kobe burger are the way to go! Some notable specialty drinks are available as well, like the Jalapeno Margarita, Mango Mojito and the Kentucky Smash! Love this spot!', '2019-03-14 17:53:40', NULL
UNION ALL
