SELECT 12511, 11720, 55, 2, 'The burgers were yummy but overpriced for what you get. You end up paying $13 for a burger that''s good but nothing to brag about. The burgers don''t include any sides which are an additional $5-8. Honestly, the most off putting aspect of this establishment was the service. It was not busy and the service was super slow. We were never checked back up on and there was a lot of waiting around. I ended up going to the bar and sat there for about 10 minutes without any of the bartenders even acknowledging me. Out of all the restaurants at Springfield mall this is definitely one I don''t plan on returning to. Try Yard House or Chuys if you want good food and drinks.', '2016-12-02 04:14:11', NULL
UNION ALL
