SELECT 12862, 12025, 24, 2, 'It was our first time at this location. It was ok the server was nice but she couldn''t really tend to us because she had other tables. Food came out cold was disappointed because I have never had issues with the other location. With all the money we spent you would have thought everything would have been nice and hot. But instead it was warm or had to wait on sides. Maybe it was an off night for this location. Might try again in the future.', '2021-04-13 01:36:38', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12863, 12026, 24, 5, 'Went for Sunday lunch for first time.  Food terrific. Ordered banana pudding for table. We thought it would be just enough for the 3 of us. It was enough for an entire family.   It was in a 9in dish. Had to take most home.  Delicious.  Worth it.', '2021-04-16 01:15:41', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12864, 12027, 24, 4, 'First time dining here and food and service was great. I had the Mississippi Peace Maker with collards and mac n cheese. One complaint the mac n cheese was fair at best. Dry and perhaps sitting. Complimentary corn bread was good. The star of this show was the BBQ shrimp app I split with my brother. They offer a entree portion that I will be getting next time. Lot of beers on tap but I had water. Will return!', '2021-02-21 01:49:20', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12865, 12028, 24, 5, 'Delicious, fresh food, and kind wait staff. Alicia was very attentive and professional.  You get a lot of food for your money.  I plan on eating there again.', '2021-04-09 19:57:57', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12866, 12029, 24, 5, 'Great BBQ restaurant, close to my dad''s house. Went there to meet a high school friend for dinner. Great expansive menu. Several great choices to choose from. Our server Maddie was awesome. She explained the menu to me and when I made my choice she said it was one of her favorites on the menu. She also was very attentative and refilled my drink without me even asking for a refill which was awesome.  I will be back here for sure. Awesome customer service from Maddie.', '2020-11-12 20:53:43', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12867, 12030, 24, 5, 'Yes, yes, all of the yes. We got 3 appetizers to share- the nachos, the brisket and bacon dip, and the bbq egg rolls. The pork on its own is scrumptious- with everything else, it''s to die for. The beer selection is fantastic as well. It''s a fun atmosphere, like you''d expect from a smokehouse with a good beer selection. Overall is good', '2021-03-22 16:19:31', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12868, 12031, 24, 1, 'What''s the point of making a reservation if you don''t actually have a table for the party coming. We were flexible, but after waiting over thirty minutes, we left. Staff was rude to our guests that were waiting. This was my Wife''s birthday celebration and we had to go elsewhere. Lost our business for good.', '2021-04-03 23:58:17', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12869, 5409, 24, 5, 'Decent BBQ, server was awesome, but honestly I go for the BBQ Shrimp skewers, gotta try them!', '2021-04-19 00:36:00', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12870, 12032, 24, 3, 'The good.....we were told the wait would be 25 minutes. No big deal. 2 minutes later we got the text that said our table was ready. We were seated and our server took our drink order right away. Looked over the one menu at the table for the 4 of us....no one told us we could scan the qr code at the edge of the table for the menu. We placed our order and then our server brought out a basket of corn bread muffins. They were nice and hot. Tasted great. Now the not so great. Out of 4 meals the only thing hot was the burger that was ordered and the collard greens. Everyone else''s meals were cold or lukewarm. Half rack of ribs had no warmth to them at all. Everyone''s fries were cold. Blackened tuna cold in the middle. Mashed potatoes and gravy were lukewarm.pulled pork sandwich was barely lukewarm. Hubby was not happy at all. Flavor was good on the food even if it was cold. But we will not spend 80 dollars again to get cold food.', '2021-04-04 00:16:09', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12871, 12033, 24, 5, 'Took my mom out to a birthday dinner! Always enjoy a good brisket, steak and great service! Friendly servers, open space and nice environment.', '2020-12-11 02:30:49', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12872, 12034, 24, 5, 'Wonderful staff, delicious food, refills/cornbread keep coming. There were ten of us and no wait time. Awesome!', '2021-03-05 04:33:42', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12873, 5247, 24, 5, 'Had the Sweet Heat Smoked Wings and boy were they so good. Will definitely order those again.', '2021-03-05 19:57:58', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12874, 815, 24, 4, 'County Grill had been a staple of my family dining for several decades. Just about everyone loves their complementary cornbread muffins and the house-made honey butter. We love the brisket and wings. The house made pickles include red onion giving them a unique flavor. The brisket is tender, but doesn''t have a distinctive bark like others I''ve had. The beer selections are always on point. I went with the Alewerks Bourbon Barrel Porter. It paired well with my brisket platter dinner. My wife had their bacon wrapped buffalo shrimp appetizer and a Caesar salad as her meal. Unfortunately her shrimp made it out 10 minutes after everyone else at the table receive their entrees. The venue has expanded in the recent past, so it can cater to parties of up to a hundred people. The bar is typically packed out on Friday and Saturday nights; just be aware the regulars can be territorial.', '2019-03-09 19:11:43', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12875, 12035, 24, 4, 'This place was so great!! The only reason I gave them a 4 star because they''re mashed potatoes and Mac n'' cheese were just ok, we ordered curbside and our order didn''t have everything in it (but they def made up by giving is tons of their amazing corn bread), they didn''t give any plasticware, napkins or BBQ sauce...it''s a BBQ place and they gave no BBQ sauce at all. They''re fries were so good, very interesting seasoning mixer, and their brisket was delicious! Just wish we had BBQ sauce.', '2021-01-17 02:00:55', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12876, 12036, 24, 5, 'It was so yummy. The wings are the best! Our service was fantastic. I think her name was Johnny?', '2021-02-05 02:51:10', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12877, 12037, 24, 5, CONVERT(X'477265617420666f6f642e0a4262712e2e2e726962732e2e2e736d6f6b65686f75736520717565736164696c6c61732e2e2e0a36207361756365732062726f7567687420746f20796f7574207461626c652e2e2e0a57686174206d6f72652063616e2049207361792e2e2e2e62757420474f202e' USING utf8mb4), '2021-04-03 22:07:12', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12878, 12038, 24, 5, 'Amazing food!! The servers are very knowledgeable and quick to respond to your questions and needs! Great atmosphere!! I had the beef brisket platter, with baked beans and mashed potatoes and gravy!! I savored every bite!! The cornbread muffins they bring out are delicious!', '2020-11-14 11:49:16', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12879, 5061, 24, 5, 'Always loved this place. Had an amazing experience tonight because their hospitality is AMAZING!! (Thank you Susan)', '2021-01-27 04:34:18', NULL
UNION ALL
