SELECT 12912, 12059, 24, 5, 'Enjoyed a delicious half chicken with mashed potatoes and vegetables. We were part of a private event function and the staff was attentive and courteous. The corn bread was nice and hot. The chicken was juicy with a good flavor (even without one of the bbq options). I also had a slice of the key lime pie which was delectable.', '2018-10-16 01:26:34', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12913, 5286, 24, 5, 'Great food, good prices. Highly recommend and would visit again.', '2020-12-15 13:05:13', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12914, 4448, 24, 1, 'This place was one of my favorite places to go over the past 20 years. However last week I went and it was an utter gross and disappointing venture. The staff was not being covid 19 safe by using masks appropriately especially the kitchen staff WHILE TOUCHING PEOPLES FOOD! And the pulled pork sandwich platter I ordered came out cold. The bar tender that was assisting asked me and my mother what we needed after delivering our food and I said more water, bbq sauce, and utensils. She proceeded to go to the outside patio take someone else’s drink order then go to the amber make their drinks and never bring us what we asked. Our server was nice but was very overwhelmed by the lack of support she was getting from her fellow staff. I will never go here again and if I were you I would not even tempt fate.', '2020-10-13 11:04:24', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12915, 12060, 24, 1, 'Food was very good.  Our server did not wear her face mask properly, (she wore it under her nose).  Dead and dying flies were all along the window sills.  Light fixture hanging over table had dust and webs on it, and it was not Halloween decorations.', '2020-09-29 21:09:37', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12916, 12061, 24, 5, 'Alex, our server was awesome!  He made excellent menu and drink suggestions. And the banana pudding was top notched. We will definitely visit again.', '2020-08-29 01:22:56', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12917, 12062, 24, 4, 'The only thing I say bad about this places the half a chicken is tiny like the size of a pigeon the rest of the food wonderful and the service there spot on our server tonight he was kind considerate helpful never left a glass go dry he was an excellent person', '2020-10-31 02:34:00', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12918, 12063, 24, 5, 'The food was delicious, the staff is very friendly and helpful so the service is excellent and fast. EVA was awesome introducing us to the mimosa and margarita''s bar as well as recommending food. Very knowledgeable about the menu.', '2018-12-17 13:47:09', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12919, 2864, 24, 4, 'We were running late to my son''s baseball practice and got the orders to go. Had a unnamed guest pay our bill no explanation. Not only the wait staff but also the Patrons are world class!', '2021-03-28 23:06:18', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12920, 12064, 24, 5, 'We got seated right away on a Saturday night. It was chilly at our table. Food arrived quickly. Hubby got the corner beef special. The cabbage was peppery. My roasted veggies were cold. Overall a good time. We will be back.', '2020-03-14 23:14:56', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12921, 12065, 24, 5, 'To make a long story short everything is freaking delicious and the service is the best. You cannot go wrong with anything you order. They''re always busy so call ahead for a table.', '2020-02-29 17:37:56', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12922, 12066, 24, 5, 'Always a great place for good food. Great southern BBQ and the meals are large for the price. Enjoy this restaurant every time we get down to Newport News, VA.', '2020-08-15 11:27:27', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12923, 12067, 24, 3, 'A local''s favorite, for sure.  Good service, but considering the prices they charge, the food is just *okay* in my opinion.', '2020-07-29 18:40:11', NULL
UNION ALL
