SELECT 12932, 12074, 24, 5, 'They have the best banana pudding that I have ever had. If you want good food in a nice down home restaurant then this is the place. I am a  huge bread eater and I will tell you they have the best corn bread and muffins that I have ever had. They also have good salads and amazing,barbecue  sandwiches. Do not think twice about eating at the County Grill, (you will be completely satisfied  in every way )', '2020-03-08 19:36:36', NULL
