SELECT 12949, 12089, 24, 4, 'Went with a large group. Ambiance was cozy & felt tight yet was roomy at the same time, hard to explain. Service was quick, responsive,  helpful & friendly. One person had an issue with the special but the manager corrected it quickly. Food was overall very tasty. I had the brisket which was so tender & delicious. Everyone ordered something different of the menu& all were satisfied.', '2019-10-23 19:55:33', NULL
