SELECT 12951, 12091, 24, 5, 'Excellent. Not sure if there has been a change in ownership but the food is still great - just a slightly different vibe to me. Love the wings and pulled pork. You must arrive very hungry! Love the sauce options.', '2019-11-29 18:06:16', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12952, 12092, 24, 5, 'There is no such thing as a bad meal at County Grill. Visits might be far between, but the food is always delicious; and the staff is always friendly and efficient. Today, my husband enjoyed his perfectly cooked ribeye. My beef brisket sandwich was a piled high mound of tender,  juicy goodness. Since it was New Year''s Day, we both ordered their home-style collards and black eyed peas, and they did not disappoint.', '2020-01-01 22:53:26', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 12953, 12093, 24, 5, 'Oh my Goodness!!! Why have we Not heard of this place before tonight?!! If you LOVE BBQ don''t walk but run to your vehicle and go to County Grill & Smokehouse right Now!! We had a party of 8, didn''t call ahead so we had to wait for a table, and I tell you what!! It was Well worth it!! (When I got my menu I thought it was a little pricy until I got my meal and changed my mind. The prices were Great for the amount of food you get.) I ordered the Mississippi Peacemaker (In which was HUGE!! A huge chunk of pork, a sausage, and lots of bacon, cheese, & fried onions, All on a bun) with slaw and beans as my sides and also ordered potato boats in which were potato skins with bacon, chilli sauce, and cheese. When my food arrived I was like "😮Wow!!!" & Yes, I definitely had to get a doggy bag! It was so Yummy-licious!!  Ace, my son, ordered a double cheeseburger with sides of fries and mac-n-cheese! He said his burger was the biggest he''s ever had, the fries were really good, and he loved the mac-n-cheese. He also recommends this place. There''s a bar too in which has a Great assortment of different beers on tap! The waitress was Awesome! The people were Awesome! The food was Amazing! Most definitely going back for more! You have to go!! My son, Ace and I give this place a 4 thumbs up! And give it more thumbs up but we only have 2 each 😜', '2018-07-04 12:15:18', NULL
UNION ALL
