SELECT 12964, 12100, 24, 1, 'I went to Country Grill to watch a football game and eat some baby back ribs at around 4pm. I took a seat at the bar but the bartender did not approach me for over 15 minutes. There weren''t that many people sitting at the bar, this wasn''t a really busy time.  Eventually , after 20 minutes of  sitting and waiting, the bartender approached me and I got to order my food and drink. The ribs came pretty soon, but I never got asked for a second  drink. The collard greens had a big piece of bone in them, which was pretty gross, and it clearly did not look like a part of the ribs. The ribs were ok. I just ate the ribs and fries, payed for my food and left. Hopefully,  the other bartenders are better with  clients . Or maybe she just didn''t like something about me.', '2019-12-08 01:16:31', NULL
UNION ALL
