SELECT 13097, 12197, 24, 4, 'This is a very good barbecue place! Lunch or dinner everything is fantastic except the brisket, which is kind of a big deal. It is very lean to the point to where it''s almost too lean, and despite asking for fatty or portions received more lean brisket meat, which is extremely disappointing. The cornbread muffins you get before the meal are fantastic and very addicting. Parking here is challenging however as it''s in a fairly busy Shopping Center for lunch.', '2018-06-21 13:16:40', NULL
