UNION ALL
SELECT 14330, 13178, 6, 5, 'Food and customer service was great. The rolls were nice and hot, salad was crisp and my salmon was tasty. Will definitely return.', '2020-01-21 17:55:50', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14331, 13179, 6, 3, 'The service was great! The food was alright. My steak was okay but my guy absolutely loved his ribs. Finger licking and all that. Breads good. Typical steakhouse prices.', '2019-08-06 03:05:20', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14332, 13180, 6, 5, '1st time coming here. We ordered mozzarella sticks, kids ribs, tenders and steak & shrimp. It was amazing. Highly reccomend to anyone looking for a steakhouse. Plus Wednesdays kids eat free.', '2020-01-15 23:58:31', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14333, 13181, 6, 4, 'As much as I wanted to be able to give them 5 stars, I couldn''t. We walked in around 4:00 p.m. We proceeded to order our food, my salad came out and as I picked up my fork half way through the salad, a piece of hair came up with the salad. I have short red hair and this was a blonde curly hair. I notified the waitress and she offered a new one I declined because I didn''t  want to chance it. Finally our food came out and as my daughter was eating. As she turned over her mash because she didn''t want the gravy and what does she pull up with her mash. that''s right, the same type and color of hair. So I call the waitress and ask her if a curly blond works in the back and she confirmed there was. At that time I told her about the hair in my daughters mash and she then proceeds to call the manager. The manager offered new food to my daughter but she refused also. We were comped one dish and a drink and the manager was very apologetic but ewh, why do you have people with long not tied up in a net working with food? I can only imagine how the rest of the night went.', '2020-03-02 05:23:37', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14334, 13182, 6, 3, 'Waiter was nice, atmosphere can''t say because I went am hour before closing so not many other there. 3 stars because the steak was rough on the outside. I get medium rare and thought it was medium well because the outside was so tough.', '2020-02-23 15:27:56', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14335, 7602, 6, 5, 'Great food,awesome service..', '2019-03-05 22:56:59', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14336, 13183, 6, 5, 'Food was very yummy. Everything was prepared and presented well. Staff was friendly and polite. I highly recommend the ribs as they are very well prepared.  Unlike some ribs where the sauce is just on top,  these ribs are marinated and you can taste the bbq sauce in the meat.  5 stars.', '2019-08-01 02:37:33', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14337, 13184, 6, 3, 'I really haven''t eaten here as of yet.  But as I was here to pickup my brother''s friend, i was able to observe a good atmosphere,  somewhat friendly staff, and clean restroom.  Here for  a while you wait snack they have peanuts in the shell, and you can take a bag home if you want.   I hope to give a more precise review in the future.', '2019-08-19 19:23:51', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14338, 13185, 6, 5, 'It was a great first date. Summer the bartender was great. She was friendly and attentive. The food delicious. We will definitely return.', '2019-08-14 02:31:08', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14339, 13186, 6, 3, 'My husband and I stopped for a lunch on Saturday. No wait time at 2:30. His salmon was cooked to perfection. Asaparagus too. My broccoli had great taste but was mush! Severely over cooked. My shrimp was a B+. My steak was too rare for medium well but I was not interested in sending back . The mashed potatoes were real and very good. The service persons were polite and reasonably attentive.  The coffee was weak and the bread was doughy! The prices are high enough that the food should be better.', '2019-03-02 20:30:03', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14340, 13187, 6, 5, 'There food is Amazing. I''ve order take out several times and the food is always fresh and delicious.', '2020-02-04 20:25:23', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14341, 101, 6, 4, 'I ordered the ribeye steak with broccoli and asparagus to go. The steak and broccoli were lovely. I mean its steamed broccoli, no challenge really there. The asparagus however could''ve been trimmed a bit shorter so that the extra flavorless crunch could''ve been avoided from the stalk. I ordered to go so I cant grade on dine-in service but I''m sure it''s nice!', '2019-11-08 21:12:55', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14342, 13188, 6, 5, 'Was skeptical at first after reading all the negative reviews. Glad we gave it a try, food was good. It wasn''t packed at all and our waitress was great.', '2020-02-16 05:21:10', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14343, 965, 6, 3, 'Music was very loud and it took over 29 minutes to get food. Services was great, friendly staff, food was good when it got there. Bathrooms were semi clean. Ensure you read coupons carefully!', '2019-10-26 01:36:37', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14344, 13189, 6, 4, 'I a regular at this location. Food is always good which earns it 4 stars. Drinks aren''t watered down either. Subtract one start because the bread is a major gamble. 14% chance it''s incredibly good. 86% chance it tastes like it''s missing a chromosome.', '2019-03-07 02:39:17', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14345, 12741, 6, 4, CONVERT(X'' USING utf8mb4), '2020-02-21 17:12:08', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14346, 5098, 6, 1, 'Worse visit EVER. My steak was not cooked as requested so they took just the take back and when I could find our waitress I let her know that the mushrooms I ordered also were not done but by the time she came to get them my steak was there I asked for a manager because while waiting for my state my sides got cold so she suggested to go heat up my side in the meantime I stayed would have gotten cold so I sent the whole meal back. My daughter also ordered chicken without the gravy on it they bought the chicken with the gravy on it which had to be sent back it was just horrible that we had to wait four pieces of our meal I refuse to eat so they agreed to take my milk off of the check. But I bet and I waited what my daughter ate hers after waiting 20 minutes for them to remake it. It will be a long time before I come back to Logan', '2020-01-12 11:15:00', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14347, 13190, 6, 5, 'Food drinks and service was wonderful!', '2020-01-26 05:33:10', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14348, 13191, 6, 5, 'A great place to eat. The yeast rolls are  delicious and the salmon is my favorite. The sweet tea is hit or miss. For $2.59 Sweet Tea should be sweet enough to give a sugar rush!! Logan''s has the buy a $50 gift card and get a $10 gift card free. We love this deal!', '2017-12-14 13:08:34', NULL
UNION ALL
