SELECT 14350, 13193, 6, 3, 'For my first time there I wasn''t really too impressed considering I order a sirloin at medium cook and it was well done.Not only that but I noticed three other tables around had the same thing happening as well.The staff was friendly,bathrooms were neat and atmosphere was descent. Maybe cook had a bad day but it might be a while before I go back', '2019-05-13 10:25:11', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14351, 13194, 6, 2, 'As you can see from the pic my salad was brown. The food was not good. The server was friendly but with the food being subpar, I definitely won''t be back.', '2020-01-21 19:47:21', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14352, 7651, 6, 5, 'The server and staff were great. The food was good. They did a special yeehaw for my son''s birthday.', '2019-09-01 21:47:59', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14353, 13195, 6, 3, 'Service was fine but food subpar. Popcorn shrimp hard and tasteless. Steak tips were ok and bread was tasty. Too many better places to visit.', '2019-11-12 19:36:39', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14354, 13196, 6, 4, 'It was fine. The service was great. The food was ok', '2019-12-03 12:04:21', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14355, 13197, 6, 5, 'I have been here three or four times and every time the food was absolutely terrific.  The staff was very friendly and the waitress did a wonderful job. Glad to recommend it to anybody at all who cares to try them.  I''m pretty sure you walk away very happy', '2019-01-17 03:42:25', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14356, 13198, 6, 4, 'I had steak and chicken breast with a potato...food was on the table when I walked in....salad was ample of fresh veggies and a good dressing. .. very nicely kabob mushroom. our server was courteous. Great Lil saloon style atmosphere.  🍴', '2018-09-15 19:10:51', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14357, 13199, 6, 5, 'Awesome menu with many mouth watering selections to choose from. Best ribs ever, bar none. Love the down home atmosphere. Staff very  accommodating and friendly. Best carrot cake I''ve ever had. If you''ve never tried Logan''s, you are truly missing out. Love, love, love this place...', '2018-05-27 21:32:52', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14358, 13200, 6, 1, 'I have eaten here before and it was pretty decent. However, this time I was very disappointed and felt like I was being pushed out at 9 pm even though they are open until 10. I would assume they turned they fryer off early and as a result, I was told they are "out of fries". This would not have been a problem if the server told me up front rather than waiting until she brought my food out and I looked down at a place of soggy chips. I also didn''t like the fact they were sweeping the floor and moving chairs around right where I was trying to eat. Sorry guys, you failed to impress me.', '2019-05-13 21:39:09', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14359, 13201, 6, 5, 'Waitress did an excellent job taking care of our party of 7.', '2019-12-27 01:05:21', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14360, 13202, 6, 4, 'Was here with a large party. The organizer had called ahead and was told they didn''t make reservations, and even though we were over 15 minutes late we still got immediately seated. Food was good, we all had a great time. The sides weren''t the largest but the entrees we''re delicious and the service was excellent.', '2019-02-02 05:20:05', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14361, 13203, 6, 2, 'Service was excellent. Steak was dry. Baked potato was overcooked and dried out. Everyone else with me had hamburgers. Their hamburgers tasted fine but their fries were cold Was not overly busy so there was not a wait. Went at 6 pm Hostess and waitress very pleasant', '2018-05-03 04:52:32', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14362, 13204, 6, 3, 'It wasn''t bad but I can''t say I was impressed. The food came out and it was warm, not anywhere near hot. The steak was cooked nicely but the rest of the food lacked flavor. The waitress was friendly and she made the experience. We had a group of 5 and not one of us loved our food. I would describe it as "okay" It would not be somewhere I would pick to go back to.', '2018-08-10 05:08:06', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14363, 13205, 6, 5, 'Overall the visit was very good. That is to say, after we woke up the hostess who neglected to give us the complimentary bucket if peanuts, the service was excellent. The food was excellent as well and the serving size allowed take home for tomorrow''s lunch. Our very friendly and accommodating waitress gave us a bag of peanuts to bring home. This was not our first visit to this restaurant and it will not be our last.', '2018-08-20 22:50:21', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14364, 13206, 6, 5, 'The service was great, as was the meal. My steak was cooked perfectly. For a 35 dollar meal it was worth every second.', '2019-04-29 15:59:57', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14365, 12308, 6, 2, '2 out of three steaks came out over cooked. The service was good. But not enough to make up for the over priced food not cooked to order.', '2019-05-12 21:33:59', NULL
