SELECT 14381, 973, 6, 3, 'Food was okay, nothing impressive though. The wait for food was long, even though they weren''t very busy. The wait staff did apologize for the kitchen being backed up and keep up with drinks as needed, which we appreciated. Overall, food was decent, but, as our first visit, nothing that makes me want to go back. Staff was friendly though.', '2019-04-11 15:57:45', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14382, 13221, 6, 5, 'So good! Perfect service. Great atmosphere. Just a really good place to go.', '2019-04-11 14:15:12', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14383, 971, 6, 2, 'The place is clean, cool, and spacious. That is the plus. I have never eaten from here because the one time I tried I ordered my food online and came to pick it up to find it not only not ready but presented as ready when it was still incomplete! I had to bring it to their attention that the food was still missing. The staff is young and not knowledgeable and didn''t know what to do to fix the order or refund it. Horrible first impression.', '2018-08-17 01:41:18', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14384, 13222, 6, 2, 'Three weeks ago I went and had a great ribeye. So I went back last week. What a disappointment.  After expressly telling the waitress that I liked a nicely marbled steak, she brings out a ribeye that resembled a sirloin.  Even had it cooked medium...  do I go for best two out of three or head to Longhorn ?', '2019-03-18 23:28:18', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14385, 13223, 6, 5, 'First time in here.We were pleasantly surprised. Steak was cooked perfectly. It wasn''t butterflied either.', '2019-06-01 17:13:21', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14386, 13224, 6, 2, 'The only reason this place got 2 stars was because of the waitress Corey. She was kind and helpful. It started with the hostess taking what seemed to be a personal call while we were waiting to be seated. She was still on that call we we asked to be seated somewhere else and there was a line. Next the food took forever to come. The waitress, God bless her, apologized and brought extra rolls. We waited a good 45 min and still no food. The manager then offers to cover what is on my table free rolls and drinks. Really?! Never again!!. Please don''t eat here.', '2017-05-10 23:18:35', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14387, 13225, 6, 4, 'Good food good price', '2020-01-19 23:00:24', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14388, 13226, 6, 2, 'Server was very nice and rolls were good but it was the worst food I ever had! Steaks were ordered medium but arrived over cooked to the point of being burnt. The mashed potatoes that my wife had were just a mashed up baked potato with no butter completely flavorless. Won''t be back.', '2019-04-20 23:25:45', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14389, 13227, 6, 4, 'Good place for a quick dinner on a budget.', '2020-01-20 19:50:07', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14390, 13228, 6, 4, 'Great steak had a good time with friends.', '2020-01-26 00:40:26', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14391, 13229, 6, 4, 'My husband loves coming here. We''ve eaten here 4xs since 2016. The peanut shells on the floor take getting used to, for me. There aren''t enough handicap accessible parking spaces & the music is so loud that I have to ask the server & my husband to almost shout or mouth words slowly so I can lip read. I have to be very careful with food allergies at this restaurant ...& I have to always have my drink redone cause the servers can''t understand NO ICE the 1st time I tell them for my pop/soda,  not paying attention or music is way too loud???', '2019-02-06 09:30:06', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14392, 13230, 6, 1, 'Even though the service was excellent, the food was mediocre for the price. Also, both me and my fiance got food poisoning after eating their steak.', '2018-12-23 18:49:17', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14393, 13231, 6, 5, 'Pretty strong rum and cokes. Great food. Recommended', '2019-06-29 15:14:01', NULL
