UNION ALL
SELECT 14402, 13239, 6, 3, 'The food was just ok.  Not a lot of selections of cuts of meat nor a variety of sides. Very basic menu.  Service was good the staff is friendly and accommodating.  Probably would not go there again because of the lack of choices.', '2018-12-29 21:35:29', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14403, 13240, 6, 5, 'We were able to get in, get seated immediately. We had a party of 7 and it was so nice to get in right away since it was a Sunday afternoon. The food was very satisfying and the staff were sweet. They also give military discount.', '2018-03-18 18:35:59', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14404, 13241, 6, 4, 'Typical of the chain. Good food, cold beers, great atmosphere. Staff are friendly and attentive at this location.', '2019-03-30 02:01:04', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14405, 13242, 6, 5, 'Outstanding service, and very affordable! Waitress was awesome!', '2019-08-04 07:59:48', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14406, 13243, 6, 2, 'We go here quite often and today they were just awful. Steak was overcooked then undercooked. We didn''t even get a side we ordered and waited 25 minutes for our meal after ordering. They did take off 20%, but we had to wait another 20 minutes for the bill, box and a to go cup. Then when we got the to go cup they didn''t put any tea in it and when I asked for a fill up they looked shocked.  Come on Logan''s get it together. Definitely not worth the $60 we had to pay.', '2018-12-30 20:09:02', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14407, 13244, 6, 1, 'Terrible experience! Party of 7 restaurant was empty when we arrived. Waited an hour for food and my daughter''s entre which was a salad was the last meal out, a good 15 minutes after everyone else. Sides (corn) was brought out last, well after the meals. We asked for the manager explained the wait, he asked the server if the order was in and was told yes, then he glanced over at us and said "it''s coming) and walked away. One young woman whose name I did not catch was very sweet and tried to help hurry things along even though she was not our server.', '2018-08-22 01:10:07', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14408, 13245, 6, 1, 'My seat afforded me the opportunity to watch the cooks making food in the kitchen. I watched and ultimately filmed a cook wearing just one glove but using both hands to cook, wipe counters with a rag and wipe his hands on his shirt, pants and through his hair. Even after most of the employees watched me filming and the waitress asking me what I was doing, no manager approached us at all to discuss so it''s obvious they don''t care. The food was dry and the steak a big blob of primarily fat. I should have listened to my children and believed the bad reviews. Yuck', '2018-10-22 15:18:36', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14409, 13246, 6, 4, 'Pretty good food. Really good service. Staff is very kind and took great care of our rather large party.', '2019-01-04 01:14:47', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14410, 13247, 6, 5, 'We got there late, no problem.  Food was as ordered and out quick.  Our waitress was great, even with the last customer after a long day.', '2018-06-23 15:44:25', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14411, 13248, 6, 5, 'Our waitress (who was also the bartender) was the best! She made the experience.', '2019-10-20 23:02:21', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14412, 13249, 6, 4, 'Great food! Never a long wait for a table. Usually quiet and casual. Wait staff are generally great!!!! Not noisy like other steakhouses.', '2017-11-12 18:39:16', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14413, 13250, 6, 1, 'Large events during the day....they can not handle. Our server was outside talking to a friend which explains why she couldn''t keep up. Food was good when it FINALLY arrived.', '2019-03-24 13:53:13', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14414, 13251, 6, 5, 'I really enjoy the food here and it''s never super busy. I always leave full with leftovers', '2019-08-23 14:48:17', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14415, 13252, 6, 5, 'Server was nice. Food was okay I liked the mashed potatoes. It was really hot inside though. My grandma loved it it was her birthday so that''s all that matters.', '2018-02-11 21:48:37', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14416, 13253, 6, 3, 'The wait time was ridiculous. We had a large party but they were not that busy. We only had one server which didn''t make sense and the food was mediocre.', '2019-07-04 13:48:30', NULL
UNION ALL
SELECT 14417, 13254, 6, 5, 'I really enjoyed the customer service, meal, atmosphere, and price. The electric lemonade was excellent!', '2019-03-16 01:45:11', NULL
