SELECT 14481, 13316, 6, 1, 'I should have left as soon as I walked in the door. I was third in line at the hostess stand. 2 parties of 2 and me....party of one with my high-chair needing son. So, after 10 minutes of waiting in a particularly sparsely occupied restaurant, we were seated......no high chair. As soon as I turned around to tell the girl I needed a high chair, POOF, she was gone. So there i stood until the waitress came over. I told her I needed a high chair and off she went. When she came back, the high chair wasn''t as tall as the booth i had been seated. No biggie but come on, who orders the stuff too short? I guess all the tables that accommodated a party of one were taken. Food ordered. Kept it simple. Potato brisket skins and a side of mashed potatoes. Bland and tasteless. Even the mashed potatoes were plain. No salt, no pepper, no butter, no seasonings. The only saving grace was the waitress. She was understanding and friendly but I will never go back to this restaurant......or any other Logan''s EVER.', '2017-08-27 19:48:36', NULL
UNION ALL
