SELECT 14512, 13344, 6, 4, 'This Logan''s was decent. We went on a Wednesday so it wasn''t too busy and the food and service were good. The food took a while to come out considering there weren''t many people seated. This was our first visit here so I dont know if maybe it''s a regional thing, but the menu was different than the Logan''s we''ve been to in other places and they didnt have the same spreads for the rolls that we''ve always gotten at other Logan''s (the butter was different and they didn''t have the cinnamon butter) , but that''s all personal preference. All in all it was good, but a little bit difficult to access if you''ve never been there and don''t know how to get to the parking lot because GPS will send you right past it.', '2017-12-30 15:37:54', NULL
