UNION ALL
SELECT 14520, 13352, 6, 2, 'We were there on a Sat around 6pm. The place was not busy. They sat us at a table in a little nook. Then we waited..and waited. I went to the front and grabbed a handful of peanuts. Still no one came. The place was swarming with staff but we were invisible. We went to the front desk. There were 3 people taking names and seating folks. We asked to have our server sent over. One of them apologized, took our drink order and brought them then left. 10-15 minutes later... Still no waiter, no rolls, no one to take our order. I went back to the front desk and asked to see the manager. She came. We asked if they were short staffed. She said no. We explained our problem and she took our order, brought rolls, gave us a free appetizer with her apologises. She was great. Still took a bit to get our food. Food was great. I do not suggest letting them seat you in the wall side alcoves. Seems you become invisible. We were there last weekend. Were seated in the center boothes. Service was great.', '2018-06-03 20:34:38', NULL
UNION ALL
